<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">- Vidunda Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Hisabu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hisabu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hisabu</para>
  <para style="toc3">His</para>
  <para style="mt1">Hisabu</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Hisabu changusimila majendo ga miyaka 40 ja Waisilaeli kukolela kuchiwala, lowawele wang'hali kwinjila mgati mwa isi ya ilagano, mina ndo isi ya Kanaani. Chitabu achi changuchemigwa Hisabu kwa vila china honhu heli halingulavya winji wa walume wa walinguweza kitowa ngondo wawele kuli chila nhanzi ya Isilaeli (sula ya 1 na 26). Wasomile wa katali wangukunda kota chitabu cha Hisabu na vitabu vinji vine vya mwaluko (Mwaluko na Kulawa na Walawi na Kukumbuchila), navyandichigwa na mloli Musa. Ayi yangulajilwa kuli Hisabu 1:1. Yoweza kuwa kota Musa nakandika honhu hakulu ha chitabu achi na walingwandika wanji nawonjezela honhu hanji kuli miyaka jiwinzile hamba. Haiwa ubewe kukunda kota Musa ndo yandichile msitali wa Hisabu 12:3, honhu hawele Musa nakatogoligwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kuli majendo ga hewo kuchiwala, Waisilaeli nawang'ung'uta na kumbelenhuka Nguluwi mala nyinji. Kwa chiwalo cha madito ga hewo, nawagazigwa. Honhu hamwe ha mbuli ayi ndo mhela Waisilaeli nalowadumbile na kung'ung'uta kota Wakanaani nawali na mong'ho lukami kusinda hewo (Hisabu 14:1-4). Kwa chiwalo cha mbuli ayi, Waisilaeli nawalubaluba kuchiwala kwa miyaka makumi gane kung'hali kwinjila mgati mwa isi ya ilagano. Naifika mbaka Musa yuyu nakalemwela kumhulichiza Nguluwi, na kwa chiwalo cha mbuli ayi heye nahakundigwe kwinjila kuli isi ya ilagano. Hanga wanhu nawabelenhuka, ila Nguluwi nakalutilila kuwamila. Mhela wang'honyo wa Waisilaeli nalowamholile kwa sendi mloli yachemigwe Balaamu yalonje upanjilo kwa wanhu wa Isilaeli, ila Nguluwi nakamkundiza hela yalonje utambichizo kwa hewo (Hisabu 22-24).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1 mbaka ya 10:11 zina mbuli zilinguwala kuwazigwa kwa Waisilaeli na kahi zina mbuli ya ndaze vyoiwichigwe kambi ya hewo na mijito ja watambika na ndolendole zikungajizwe kulawa kuli chila nhanzi mhela uwele honhu ha kulavila nhambiko navyohawichigwe chiuyeng'ha.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Kulawa aho, chitabu cha Hisabu changusimila majendo ga Waisilaeli kukolela kuchiwala, kuli sula ya 10:12 mbaka 25.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Sula ya 26 mbaka ya 36 yangusimila kuwazigwa kwa keli na malajizo ganji kwa chiwalo cha Waisilaeli. Ayi ndo hamwe na matagwa ga honhu hawele wanhu Waisilaeli nawawika kambi wawele kuli majendo kulutila kuli isi ya ilagano. Kahi yangusimila ndaze isi ayo navyowa igawilwe hali nhanzi zeng'ha howowa wenjile mgati mwa isi ya hewo wawo.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kuwalizwa kwa wawele woweza kitowa ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1"/>Nalyali zuwa lya mwaluko lya mwezi wa keli, mwaka wa keli kuli wanhu wa Isilaeli kulawila Misili, Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga na Musa mgati mwa ihema lya Nguluwi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ihema lya Nguluwi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya mhela wunji ihema lya Nguluwi nalyali lichemigwa ihema lya nhing'hano. Natuhagula kulichema ihema lya Nguluwi leka wanhu waleche kijesa kota ndo honhu heli.</char></note> kuchiwala ako Sinai, nakamlonjela ahi, <verse eid="NUM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2"/>“Hegwe na Aluni muwawaze Waisilaeli weng'ha, ivyazi limwe mbaka liyage kwa kuwinza lukolo lwa hewo kota vyogali matagwa gawo chila mlume yumwe mbaka yunji, <verse eid="NUM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3"/>wala weng'ha kuli Isilaeli walinguweza kuluta kuza kitowa ngondo, wawele na miyaka kwaluchila makumi meli na mzidi, hegwe na Aluni mowawika kuli kuwazigwa kwa vilundo vilundo. <verse eid="NUM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4"/>Kahi mlume yumwe wa chila nhanzi kowa hamwe na hemwe, chila yumwe yawele chilongozi wa ivyazi lya heye. <verse eid="NUM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5"/>Ayi ndo mbuli ya matagwa ga walume walingukutanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 1:5">“kwa nhanzi ya Lubeni, Elisuli mwana wa Shedeuli,<verse eid="NUM 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6"/>kwa nhanzi ya Simeoni, Shelumieli mwana wa Suli-shadai,<verse eid="NUM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7"/>kwa nhanzi ya Yuda, Nashoni mwana wa Aminadabu,<verse eid="NUM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8"/>kwa nhanzi ya Isakali, Netaneli mwana wa Suali,<verse eid="NUM 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9"/>kwa nhanzi ya Sebuluni, Eliabu mwana wa Heloni,<verse eid="NUM 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10"/>kuli wana wa Yusufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 1:10">kwa nhanzi ya Efulaimu, Elishama mwana wa Amihudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 1:10">kwa nhanzi ya Manase, Gamalieli mwana wa Pedasuli,<verse eid="NUM 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11"/>kwa nhanzi ya Benjamini, Abidani mwana wa Gideoni,<verse eid="NUM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12"/>kwa nhanzi ya Dani, Ahieseli mwana wa Amishadai,<verse eid="NUM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13"/>kwa nhanzi ya Asheli, Pagieli mwana wa Okilani,<verse eid="NUM 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14"/>kwa nhanzi ya Gadi, Eliasafu mwana wa Deueli,<verse eid="NUM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15"/>kwa nhanzi ya Nafutali, Ahila mwana wa Enani.”<verse eid="NUM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16"/>Awa ndo vilongozi wahaguligwe kulawa kuli Waisilaeli weng'ha, kota vilongozi wakulu wa nhanzi ya hewo na vilongozi wa ng'holo za Isilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17"/>Lelo Musa na Aluni nawawahola vilongozi awo wachemigwe matagwa ga hewo, <verse eid="NUM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18"/>na kwaluchila zuwa lya mwaluko lya mwezi wa keli, nawawakungajiza Waisilaeli weng'ha walume wawele wawazigwe chila yumwe kulawa ivyazi lya heye na lukolo lwa heye. Kwa kuwinza matagwa ga walume wawele na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi wawazigwe yumwe yumwe, <verse eid="NUM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19"/>kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Musa. Musa kawawaliza walume awo kula kuchiwala ako Sinai.<verse eid="NUM 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20"/>Walume walawile kuli nhanzi ya Lubeni, yawele yavumbuche wa mwaluko kwa Isilaeli, kwa kuwinza vyowavumbuche hewo, kulawa ng'holo za hewo na kulawa ivyazi lya hewo, kwa kuwinza matagwa ga hewo yumwe yumwe, chila mlume yawele na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi, yoweza kwinjila kuli kitowa ngondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21"/>nawali walume makumi gane na sita elufu na miya zihano (46,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22"/>Kulawa nhanzi ya Simeoni kwa kuwinza vyowavumbuche hewo kuli ng'holo za hewo na kulawa kuli ivyazi lya hewo kuli winji wa matagwa gawo yumwe yumwe, chila mlume yawele na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi, yalinguweza kuza kitowa ngondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23"/>nawali walume makumi gahano na tisa elufu na miya zidatu (59,300).<verse eid="NUM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24"/>Kulawila kuli nhanzi ya Gadi kwa kuwinza vyowavumbuche hewo kuli ng'holo za hewo na kuli ivyazi lya hewo na kuli winji wa matagwa ga hewo, wawele na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi, walinguweza kuza kitowa ngondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25"/>nawali walume makumi gane na gahano elufu miya sita na makumi gahano (45,650).<verse eid="NUM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26"/>Kulawila kuli nhanzi ya Yuda kwa kuwinza vyowavumbuche kuli ng'holo za hewo na kuli ivyazi lya hewo kuli winji wa matagwa ga hewo, wawele na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi, walinguweza kwinjila kuli kitowa ngondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27"/>nawali wanhu makumi saba na gane elufu na miya sita (74,600).<verse eid="NUM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28"/>Kulawila kuli nhanzi ya Isakali kwa kuwinza vyowavumbuche hewo kuli ng'holo za hewo na kuli ivyazi lya hewo kuli winji wa matagwa ga hewo, wawele na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi, walinguweza kuza kitowa ngondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29"/>nawali wanhu makumi gahano na gane elufu na miya zine (54,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30"/>Kulawila nhanzi ya Sebuluni kwa kuwinza vyowavumbuche hewo kuli ng'holo za hewo na kuli ivyazi lya hewo kuli winji wa matagwa ga hewo, wawele na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi, walinguweza kuza kitowa ngondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31"/>nawali wanhu makumi gahano na saba elufu na miya zine (57,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32"/>Kulawila nhanzi ya Efulaimu, mwanage Yusufu, kwa kuwinza vyowavumbuche kuli ng'holo za hewo na kuli ivyazi lya hewo kuli winji wa matagwa ga hewo, wawele na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi, walinguweza kuza kitowa ngondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33"/>nawali wanhu makumi gane elufu na miya zihano (40,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34"/>Kulawila kuli nhanzi ya Manase, mwanage Yusufu, kwa kuwinza vyowavumbuche kuli ng'holo za hewo na kuli ivyazi lya hewo kuli winji wa matagwa ga hewo, wawele na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi walinguweza kuza kitowa ngondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35"/>nawali wanhu makumi gadatu na meli elufu na miya mbili (32,200).<verse eid="NUM 1:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36"/>Kulawila kuli nhanzi ya Benjamini, kwa kuwinza vyowavumbuche kuli ng'holo za hewo na kuli ivyazi lya hewo kuli winji wa matagwa ga hewo, wawele na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi, walinguweza kuza kitowa ngondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37"/>nawali walume elufu makumi gadatu na gahano na miya zine (35,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38"/>Kulawila nhanzi ya Dani kwa kuwinza kota vyowavumbuche kuli ng'holo za hewo na kuli ivyazi lya hewo kwa kuwinza winji wa matagwa ga hewo, wawele na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi, walinguweza kuza kitowa ngondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39"/>nawali walume elufu makumi sita na meli na miya saba (62,700).<verse eid="NUM 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40"/>Kulawa nhanzi ya Asheli, kwa kuwinza kota vyowavumbuche kuli ng'holo za hewo na kuli ivyazi lya hewo kwa winji wa matagwa ga hewo, wawele na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi, walinguweza kuza kitowa ngondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41"/>nawali walume elufu makumi gane na yumwe na miya zihano (41,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42"/>Kulawila nhanzi ya Nafutali, kwa kuwinza kota vyowavumbuche kuli ng'holo za hewo na kuli ivyazi lya hewo kwa winji wa matagwa ga hewo, wawele na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi, walinguweza kuza kitowa ngondo, <verse eid="NUM 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43"/>nawali walume elufu makumi gahano na gadatu na miya zine (53,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44"/>Awa ndo walume wawele wawazigwe na Musa na Aluni hamwe na utanzi wa wala vilongozi kumi na weli wa Isilaeli, chila chilongozi yalawile honhu ha lukolo lwa heye. <verse eid="NUM 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45"/>Awo ndo walume weng'ha wa Isilaeli kuwinza ivyazi lya hewo wawele na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi, walinguweza kuza kitowa ngondo kuli isi ya Isilaeli, <verse eid="NUM 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46"/>nawali walume lachi sita na elufu zidatu na miya zihano na makumi gahano (603,550).<verse eid="NUM 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47"/>Ila Walawi hawawazigwe hamwe na zila nhanzi ziyage, <verse eid="NUM 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48"/>kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49"/>“Uleche nhanzi ya Walawi na uleche kuwawaza hali wanhu wa Isilaeli, <verse eid="NUM 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50"/>ila kowabagula wawe wololela ihema lya Nguluwi lya ulolezi, vinhu vyake vyeng'ha na chila chinhu chiwele amo mgati mwake. Wowa wolipika hamwe na vinhu vyake vyeng'ha. Wokola mijito mumo mgati na kuwika kambi kwa kuzunguluta. <verse eid="NUM 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51"/>Kahi mhela wa ihema kung'humbuligwa Walawi na ndo wong'humbula na mhela wa ihema kuwichigwa Walawi ndo wolimiza, na mjenzi yohejelela kokopoligwa. <verse eid="NUM 1:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52"/>Waisilaeli wanji weng'ha wowika kambi za hewo kwa vilundo vilundo, chila munhu hali chilundo cha heye na hasi ha bendela ya heye. <verse eid="NUM 1:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53"/>Ila Walawi wowika kambi kwa kuzunguluta ihema lya Nguluwi lya ulolezi kuno wololela leka munhu yoneche yaleche kuhejelela na kwambuza ng'halazi ya heni iwe kwa Waisilaeli weng'ha, lelo Walawi wowika goya ihema lya Nguluwi lya ulolezi.” <verse eid="NUM 1:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54"/>Ahyo Waisilaeli nawadita kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 1:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kuwichigwa goya kwa kambi na majendo ga nhanzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakawalonjela Musa na Aluni, <verse eid="NUM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2"/>“Waisilaeli wowika kambi, chila munhu kochikala hali bendela ya heye, hali ulajilo wa ivyazi lya heye. Wowika kambi kuzunguluta ihema lya Nguluwi.<verse eid="NUM 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3"/>“Wala wawele wowika kambi nzingo ya kolilawila isanya, wowa chilundo cha wanhu wawele hasi ha bendela ya Yuda na chilongozi wa hewo kowa Nashoni mwana wa Aminadabu, <verse eid="NUM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4"/>chilundo cha heye kwa kuwawaza ndo walume elufu makumi saba na gane na miya sita (74,600). <verse eid="NUM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5"/>Wala wawele wowinza wanhu wa Yuda kuwika kambi, wowa nhanzi ya Isakali, chilongozi wa hewo nayawele Netaneli mwana wa Suali, <verse eid="NUM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6"/>chilundo cha heye kwa kuwawaza ndo walume elufu makumi gahano na zine na miya zine (54,400). <verse eid="NUM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7"/>Hamba nhanzi za Sebuluni, chilongozi wa hewo nayali Eliabu mwana wa Heloni, <verse eid="NUM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8"/>chilundo cha heye kwa kuwaza ndo walume elufu makumi gahano na saba na miya zine (57,400). <verse eid="NUM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9"/>Wanhu weng'ha wa wowa kuli kambi ya Yuda ndo kwa vilundo vya hewo ndo walume lachi imwe na elufu makumi nane na sita na miya zine (186,400). Awo ndo wolongola kwaluka majendo.<verse eid="NUM 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10"/>“Kwa ubanzi wa kusini, wala wawele hasi ha bendela ya chilundo cha Lubeni kwa vilundo vya hewo, chilongozi wa hewo yawele Elisuli mwana wa Shedeuli, <verse eid="NUM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11"/>chilundo cha heye kwa kuwazigwa ndo walume elufu makumi gane na sita na miya zihano (46,500). <verse eid="NUM 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12"/>Baho du wala wowika kambi hafungo ha wanhu wa Lubeni ndo wanhu wa nhanzi ya Simeoni, chilongozi wa hewo kowa Shelumieli mwana wa Suli-shadai, <verse eid="NUM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13"/>chilundo cha heye kwa kuwazigwa ndo walume elufu makumi gahano na tisa na miya zidatu (59,300). <verse eid="NUM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14"/>Nhanzi ya Gadi, chilongozi wa hewo ndo Eliasafu mwana wa Leueli, <verse eid="NUM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15"/>chilundo cha heye kwa kuwazigwa ndo walume elufu makumi gane na gahano na miya sita na makumi gahano (45,650), <verse eid="NUM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16"/>walume vyowowa kuli kambi ya Lubeni kwa vilundo vya hewo ndo wanhu lachi imwe na elufu makumi gahano na imwe na miya zine na makumi gahano (151,450). Awa ndo wowa kuli chilundo cha keli kuli majendo.<verse eid="NUM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17"/>“Hamba, nhanzi ya Walawi naiwa hagati ha nhanzi zinji kuno wohola alyo ihema lya Nguluwi wojenda. Chila nhanzi yojenda kwa kuwinza honhu hake kwa bendela.<verse eid="NUM 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18"/>“Kuli ubanzi wa kolilinguzinjila isanya, wala wawele hasi ha bendela ya chilundo cha Efulaimu wochikala mkambi kuli vilundo vya hewo, chilongozi wa hewo ndo Elishama mwana wa Amihudi, <verse eid="NUM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19"/>chilundo cha heye kuli kuwaliza ndo walume elufu makumi gane na miya zihano (40,500). <verse eid="NUM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20"/>Nhanzi ya Manase yowinza nhanzi ya Efulaimu. Chilongozi ndo Gamalieli, mwana wa Pedasuli, <verse eid="NUM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21"/>chilundo cha heye kuli kuwaliza ndo walume elufu makumi gadatu na mbili na miya mbili (32,200). <verse eid="NUM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22"/>Hamba nhanzi ya Benjamini, chilongozi ndo Abidani, mwana wa Gideoni, <verse eid="NUM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23"/>chilundo cha heye kuli kuwaliza ndo walume elufu makumi gadatu na gahano na miya zine (35,400). <verse eid="NUM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24"/>Wanhu nawawele kuli kambi ya Efulaimu kuli vilundo vya hewo ndo walume lachi imwe na elufu nane na miya imwe (108,100). Chilundo achi cha nhanzi ya Efulaimu chowa chilundo cha kadatu kuli majendo.<verse eid="NUM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25"/>“Kuli ubanzi wa kasikazini, wowika kambi kuli vilundo lya hewo wala wawele hasi ha bendela ya Dani, chilongozi wa hewo ndo Ahieseli, mwana wa Amishadai, <verse eid="NUM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26"/>chilundo cha heye kuli kuwaliza ndo walume elufu makumi sita na mbili na miya saba (62,700). <verse eid="NUM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27"/>Baho du wowika kambi kulawila aho wowa wanhu wa nhanzi ya Asheli, chilongozi wa hewo ndo Pagieli mwana wa Okilani, <verse eid="NUM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28"/>chilundo cha heye kuli kuwaliza ndo walume elufu makumi gane na imwe na miya zihano (41,500). <verse eid="NUM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29"/>Baho du wanhu wa nhanzi ya Nafutali, chilongozi wa heye nayali Ahila mwana wa Enani, <verse eid="NUM 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30"/>chilundo cha heye kuli kuwaliza ndo walume elufu makumi gahano na gadatu na miya zine (53,400). <verse eid="NUM 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31"/>Weng'ha wowa kuli honhu howawichile kambi ya hewo walume lachi imwe na elufu makumi gahano na saba na miya sita (157,600). Chilundo achi cha Dani chowa chilundo cha mwiso kuli majendo, kulawa bendela imwe mbaka iyage.”<verse eid="NUM 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32"/>Awo ndo Waisilaeli wawalizwe kulawila kuli ivyazi lya hewo, kuli kambi ya chilundo cha hewo, weng'ha nawali lachi sita na elufu zidatu na miya zihano na makumi gahano (603,550). <verse eid="NUM 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33"/>Ila Walawi hawawazigwe hali wanhu wa Isilaeli kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34"/>Ahyo ndo Waisilaeli vyowaditile chila chinhu kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Musa. Nawawika kambi kwa kuwinza bendela za hewo na walutilila na majendo chila yumwe na lukolo wa heye na ivyazi lya heye.<verse eid="NUM 2:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3"/>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Aluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1"/>Awa ndo wana wa Aluni na Musa mhela Mkulu Nguluwi loyalonjile na Musa mchidunda cha Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2"/>Aga ndo matagwa ga wana wa Aluni. Nawali Nadabu, mlelwa wa heye wa mwaluko na Abihu na Eleasali na Itamali. <verse eid="NUM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3"/>Aga ndo matagwa ga wana wa Aluni nawawichigwe kwa mijito yelile na kubakalizwa mafuta wawe watambika. <verse eid="NUM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4"/>Ila Nadabu na Abihu nawabagama hali Mkulu Nguluwi, mhela lowamlavile Mkulu Nguluwi chiluli chohachikundigwe kuli chiwala cha Sinai. Hewo nawali hela wana, ahyo Eleasali na Itamali nawakola mijito kota watambika mhela wa ukomu wa Aluni Mhaza wa hewo.<verse eid="NUM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wanguhaguligwa kuwakolela mijito watambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6"/>“Uwegale habehi wanhu wa nhanzi ya Lawi, uwawiche kumwando kwa mtambika Aluni waze kumkolela mijito. <verse eid="NUM 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7"/>Wowakolela mijito Aluni na Waisilaeli weng'ha hala kuli ihema lya Nguluwi howokola mijito ya ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8"/>Wololela vinhu vyeng'ha vya ihema lya Nguluwi na kuwatanza Waisilaeli howokola mijito ja hewo kuli ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9"/>Aluni na walelwa wa heye wopegwa Walawi, awo walavigwa hali Waisilaeli wawakolele mijito.” <verse eid="NUM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10"/>Kowahagula Aluni na wana wa heye leka wazengukola mijito ja hewo ja utambika, ila wone munhu nyunji hoyojeza kukola mijito ja utambika, kokopoligwa.<verse eid="NUM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakalutilila kumlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12"/>“Ulole, ndiwahagula Walawi kuli wanhu wa Isilaeli weng'ha honhu hali chila mlelwa wa mwaluko mlume kuli chila ivyazi lya Isilaeli. Walawi ndo wa heni, <verse eid="NUM 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13"/>kwa vila chila mlelwa wa mwaluko wa Isilaeli ndo wa heni. Mhela londiwakopole walelwa wa mwaluko wa Misili nandimdita chila mlelwa wa mwaluko wa wanhu na wa migongolo yawe wa chiuyeng'ha, hewo wowa ndo wa heni. Heni ndo mbele Mkulu Nguluwi.”<verse eid="NUM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwazigwa kwa Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14"/>Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa kuli chiwala cha Sinai, <verse eid="NUM 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15"/>“Wawaze wana wa Lawi weng'ha kwa kuwinza lukolo lwawo na ivyazi lya hewo, chila mlume yawele na mwezi umwe na mzidi.” <verse eid="NUM 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16"/>Lelo Musa nakawawaza kota vyoyalajizwe na lizi lya Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="NUM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17"/>Awa ndo wali wana wa Lawi, Gelishoni na Kohati na Melali. <verse eid="NUM 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18"/>Aga ndo matagwa ga wana walume wa Gelishoni kwa kuwinza ng'holo za hewo, Libuni na Shimei. <verse eid="NUM 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19"/>Wana walume wa Kohati kwa kuwinza ng'holo za hewo nawali, Amulamu na Ishali na Hebuloni na Usieli. <verse eid="NUM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20"/>Wana walume wa Melali kwa kuwinza ng'holo za hewo, nawali Mahuli na Mushi. Ali nalyali ivyazi lya Walawi kulawa kuli ng'holo za hewo.<verse eid="NUM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21"/>Ivyazi lya Walibuni na Washimei nalilawa kwa Gelishoni, azi ndo nazali ng'holo za Wagelishoni. <verse eid="NUM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22"/>Hisabu ya hewo kwa kuwaza walume weng'ha kwaluchila nawawele na mwezi umwe na mzidi ndo elufu saba na miya zihano (7,500). <verse eid="NUM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23"/>Ng'holo za Wagelishoni naiwalapa kuwika kambi kuli ubanzi wa kolizinjilaga isanya, kumbele kwa ihema lya Nguluwi, <verse eid="NUM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24"/>na heye Eliasafu mwana wa Laeli yawele mkulu wa lukolo lwa Wagelishoni. <verse eid="NUM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25"/>Mijito ja wana wa Gelishoni najali kulolela ihema lya Nguluwi hamwe na chigubiko cha ihema lya Nguluwi na ipaziya lya lwizi lwa ihema lya Nguluwi <verse eid="NUM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26"/>na mipaziya ja lugagala naluwele lulinguzunguluta ihema lya Nguluwi na honhu ha kulavila nhambiko na ipaziya lya lwizi lwa lugagala na ng'weso zake. Mijito jeng'ha jilingulapa vinhu avi najali ja hewo.<verse eid="NUM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27"/>Ng'holo za Waamulamu na Waishali na Wahebuloni na Wausieli nazilawa kwa Kohati, ali ndo nalyali ivyazi lya Wakohati. <verse eid="NUM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28"/>Kota vyoliwazigwe kwa walume weng'ha kwaluchila na wawele na mwezi umwe na mzidi, nawali elufu nane na miya sita (8,600), nawali wololela honhu helile. <verse eid="NUM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29"/>Ng'holo za wana wa Kohati nayali ilapigwa kuwika kambi ubanzi wa kusini mwa ihema lya Nguluwi, <verse eid="NUM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30"/>na heye Elisafani mwana wa Usieli, yawele mkulu wa lukolo alo lwa ivyazi lya Wakohati. <verse eid="NUM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31"/>Mijito ja hewo jali kulilolela isanduku lya ilagano na visaga na chinhu cha kuwichila chenje na honhu ha kulavila nhambiko na vinhu vyowalingukolela mijito honhu helile na ipaziya, mijito jeng'ha jilingulapa vinhu avi najali ja hewo.<verse eid="NUM 3:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32"/>Na heye Eleasali mwana wa mtambika Aluni nakawichigwa kuwa mng'hangala wa wakulu wa Walawi mlolezi wa wanhu weng'ha walingukola mijito honhu helile.<verse eid="NUM 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33"/>Ng'holo za Wamahili na Wamushi nazilawila kwa Melali. <verse eid="NUM 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34"/>Weng'ha kwa kuwazigwa kwa kwaluchila walume wawele na mwezi umwe na mzidi nawali wanhu elufu sita na miya mbili (6,200). <verse eid="NUM 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35"/>Mkulu wa lukolo lwa ivyazi lya Melali nayali Sulieli mwana wa Abihaili, awa nawaganigwa kuwika kambi ubanzi wa kasikazini mwa ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36"/>Awo wana wa Melali nawapegwa mijito ja kulolela fulemu za ihema lya Nguluwi, mhajilo na mizengo na mambo na vinhu vyeng'ha vya kibatilila ihema, mijito jeng'ha jilinguwala vinhu avi, najali ja hewo. <verse eid="NUM 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37"/>Na kahi nawaganigwa kulolela mizengo ja lugagala luzungulute ihema lya Nguluwi na vigingi na ng'weso zake.<verse eid="NUM 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38"/>Musa na Aluni na wana wawo, nawaganigwa kuwika kambi hali ihema lya Nguluwi ubanzi wa kolilawilaga isanya. Nawaganigwa hewo kukola mijito ja utambika kuli ihema lya Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha Waisilaeli. Munhu yunji yoneche yahejele habehi naiganigwa yakopoligwe. <verse eid="NUM 3:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39"/>Hisabu ya Walawi kwa kuwinza ivyazi lya hewo, walume weng'ha kwaluchila wana wawele na mwezi umwe na mzidi wawele Musa na Aluni nawawawazile kwa ilajizo lya Mkulu Nguluwi, nawali wanhu elufu makumi meli na mbili (22,000).<verse eid="NUM 3:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wanguhola honhu ha walelwa wa mwaluko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, “Wawaze kwa matagwa walelwa wa mwaluko walume weng'ha wa Waisilaeli kwaluchila wawele na mwezi umwe na mzidi. <verse eid="NUM 3:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41"/>Nagwe kowabagula Walawi kwa chiwalo cha heni Mkulu Nguluwi wawe honhu ha walelwa wa mwaluko wa Waisilaeli, kahi kobagula kwa chiwalo cha heni migongolo jeng'ha ja Walawi jiwe honhu ha walelwa wa mwaluko wa migongolo ja wanhu wa Isilaeli.” <verse eid="NUM 3:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42"/>Lelo Musa nakawawaza walelwa wa mwaluko weng'ha wa wanhu wa Isilaeli kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize. <verse eid="NUM 3:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43"/>Walelwa weng'ha wa mwaluko walume kuli kuwazigwa kwa matagwa, wawele na mwezi umwe na mzidi, nawali elufu makumi meli na mbili na miya mbili na makumi saba na zidatu (22,273).<verse eid="NUM 3:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45"/>“Lelo wabagule Walawi weng'ha wawe wa heni honhu ha walelwa wa mwaluko wa Waisilaeli. Kahi, ujibagule misenga ja Walawi weng'ha honhu ha walelwa wa mwaluko wa misenga ja Waisilaeli. Hewo Walawi ndo wa heni. Heni nda Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 3:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46"/>Kwa chiwalo cha kuwagombola walelwa wa mwaluko walume wa wanhu wa Isilaeli miya mbili na makumi saba na wadatu (273), wawele mzidi wa walume Walawi, <verse eid="NUM 3:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47"/>kobochela kwa chila mlume sendi migwala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:47 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">migwala </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ndo shekeli, na shekeli ndo igwala liwele na itunyo lya kota gilamu kumi na imwe hino.</char></note> jihano, kwa kuwinza chipimilo cha honhu helile, <verse eid="NUM 3:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48"/>na sendi azo kwa chiwalo cha kuwagombola awo wawele mzidi kwa Walawi komha Aluni na wanage.” <verse eid="NUM 3:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49"/>Musa nakahulichiza, nakahola sendi azo za kuwagombola awo wawele mzidi wa wagomboligwe na Walawi, <verse eid="NUM 3:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50"/>nakabochela kulawila walelwa wa mwaluko wa Isilaeli sendi chasi cha migwala elufu imwe na miya zidatu na makumi sita na gahano (1,365), kwa kuwinza chipimilo cha honhu helile, <verse eid="NUM 3:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51"/>Musa nakawapa Aluni na wanage sendi azo za kuwagombola kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize.<verse eid="NUM 3:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Mijito ja Wakohati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakawalonjela Musa na Aluni, <verse eid="NUM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2"/>“Muwawaze walelwa wa Kohati, yumwe wa lukolo lwa Lawi kwa kuwinza wanhu wa hewo na ivyazi lya hewo, <verse eid="NUM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3"/>kowawaza walume weng'ha wawele na miyaka makumi gadatu mbaka makumi gahano walinguganigwa kilumba na mijito ja ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4"/>Ahyo ndo vyojiwa mijito ja wana wa Kohati kuli ihema lya Nguluwi, kuli vinhu vyelile ng'hatu.<verse eid="NUM 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5"/>“Mhela wa kubena kambi, watambika, Aluni na wanage, wokwinjila kuli ihema na kutelemla ipaziya liwele hali isanduku lya ilagano, hamba woligubika kwa ipaziya alyo. <verse eid="NUM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6"/>Mchanya mwake wowika chigubiko cha migozi ja migongolo jilingikala mbahali, mchanya mwake migozi ajo kahi wowika chibende cha lanji ya buluu inojile. Hamba wokwinjiza mipichilo ja kuliholela isanduku alyo.<verse eid="NUM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7"/>“Mchanya mwa chisaga cha kulavila mibumunda jelile, wowika chibende cha buluu chiwele mchanya mwa acho kowichigwa luhelo na visaye vya ubani na chizombe kwa chiwalo cha kulavila nhambiko za kunwa. Mazuwa gose kowa na ibumunda mchanya mwa chisaga. <verse eid="NUM 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8"/>Hamba, wogubika vinhu avyo vyeng'ha kwa chibende chidung'hu na mchanya mwake wowika chigubiko cha igozi lya igongolo lilingikala mbahali. Hamba wokwinjiza mipichilo jake ja kuliholela.<verse eid="NUM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9"/>“Wohola chibende cha buluu chiwele ndo chowogubika chinhu cha kuwichila chenje na chenje chake na vinhu vya kibatila ikala na luhelo na vinhu vyeng'ha vilinguganigwa kuwichila mafuta. <verse eid="NUM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10"/>Wochiwika hamwe na vinhu vyake vyeng'ha mgati mwa igozi lya igongolo lilingikala mbahali na kuchiwika mchanya mwa fulemu ya kupichila.<verse eid="NUM 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11"/>“Hamba wowika chibende cha buluu mchanya mwa honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ha zahabu na kuigubika kwa igozi lya igongolo lilingikala mbahali mchanya mwake. Hamba wokwinjiza mipichilo ja kupichila. <verse eid="NUM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12"/>Wovihola vinhu vyeng'ha vilinguganigwa honhu helile, woviwopa kwa chibende cha buluu na kuvigubika kwa igozi lya igongolo lilingikala mbahali, hamba woviwika mchanya mwa fulemu ya kupichila. <verse eid="NUM 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13"/>Wokusa mivu hali honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ha shaba na mchanya mwake wowika chibende cha zambalau. <verse eid="NUM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14"/>Mchanya mwake wowika vinhu vyeng'ha vilinguganigwa kuli mijito ja honhu ha kulavila nhambiko, makala na mibano na mihuka na visaye. Hamba, mchanya mwake wowika chigubiko cha igozi lya igongolo lilingikala mbahali na kwinjiza mipichilo jake ja kupichila. <verse eid="NUM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15"/>Aluni na wanage lowagubiche honhu helile hamwe na vinhu vyake vyeng'ha, wawa wewichile goya kwa kwaluka majendo. Hamba wanhu wa nhanzi ya Kohati wokuya na kuvipika. Ila hewo, hambe wakundizwe ng'hatu kuvidoliza vinhu avyo vyelile, leka waleche kubagama. Ayo ndo mijito ja nhanzi ya Kohati chila mhela ihema lya Nguluwi holikusigwa na kuhilichigwa honhu hanji. <verse eid="NUM 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16"/>Eleasali, mwana wa mtambika Aluni, kanguganigwa kulolela mafuta ga chenje na ubani wa kununyhilila na nhambiko za nyhule ya chila zuwa na mafuta ga kubakaliza leka yalolele chila chinhu kuli ihema alyo na honhu helile na vinhu vyake.”<verse eid="NUM 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17"/>Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakawalonjela Musa na Aluni, <verse eid="NUM 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18"/>“Mleche kuleka nhanzi ya ng'holo za Kohati hali Walawi zidumigwe. <verse eid="NUM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19"/>Lelo kwa kuwalemeza waleche kubagama kwa kuvihejelela vinhu avyo vyelile ng'hatu kodita ahi. Aluni na wanage wokwinjila na kumlonjela chila yumwe wa hewo vyoyalonjelwe kudita mijito ja heye. <verse eid="NUM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20"/>Ila walelwa wa Kohati hawokwinjila ng'oo kuvilola vinhu vyelile ng'hatu, wone wadite ahyo, wobagama.”<verse eid="NUM 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mijito ja Wagelishoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22"/>“Wawaze walelwa wa Gelishoni, kwa ivyazi na ng'holo za hewo, <verse eid="NUM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23"/>kowawaza walume weng'ha wawele na miyaka makumi gadatu mbaka makumi gahano walinguganigwa kihanza kuli mijito ja ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24"/>Awu ndo uchitumagwa wa ivyazi lya Wagelishoni kuli mijito na kupika mhomolo. <verse eid="NUM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25"/>Hewo wopika mipaziya na ihema lya Nguluwi na chigubiko chake na chigubiko cha migozi ja migongolo jilingikala mbahali jiwele mchanya mwake na ipaziya lya lwizi lwa kwinjila kuli ihema lya Nguluwi, <verse eid="NUM 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26"/>na mipaziya ja lugagala na ipaziya lya kwinjila kuli lugagala lulinguzunguluta ihema lya Nguluwi na honhu ha kulavila nhambiko na ng'weso zake na vinhu vyeng'ha vya kukolela mijito. Wagelishoni wokola mijito na mbuli zeng'ha zilinguwala vinhu avi. <verse eid="NUM 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27"/>Aluni na wanage wowalajiza kukola mijito jeng'ha ja Wagelishoni kwa vinhu vyowopika na mijito jowodita. Kowawichila vinhu vyeng'ha vila viwele vyowalinguganigwa kupika. <verse eid="NUM 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28"/>Ajo ndo mijito ja walelwa wa Gelishoni kuli ihema lya Nguluwi, wokola mijito hali ulongozi wa Itamali mwana wa mtambika Aluni.<verse eid="NUM 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mijito ja Wamelali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29"/>“Na kahi kowawaza walelwa wa Melali, kwa kuwinza ng'holo za hewo na ivyazi lya hewo. <verse eid="NUM 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30"/>Kowawaza walume weng'ha wawele na miyaka makumi gadatu mbaka makumi gahano, walinguganigwa kukola mijito kuli ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31"/>Awo, ndo wowa na mijito ja kupika fulemu na mhajilo na mizengo na msisi wa ihema lya Nguluwi <verse eid="NUM 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32"/>na mizengo ja lugagala lwa kuzunguluta nzingo zeng'ha za ihema lya Nguluwi na vikalilo na vigingi na ng'weso hamwe na vinhu vyake vyeng'ha na vinhu viyage vyeng'ha. Nagwe kowawichila vinhu vyowalinguganigwa kupika kwa kuwinza matagwa ga hewo, chila munhu na mhomolo ya heye. <verse eid="NUM 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33"/>Ajo ndo jowa mijito ja walelwa wa Melali kuli kukola mijito ja hewo jeng'ha mgati mwa ihema lya Nguluwi, hali ulongozi wa Itamali mwana wa mtambika Aluni.”<verse eid="NUM 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwalizwa kwa Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34"/>Lelo Musa na Aluni na vilongozi wa Waisilaeli weng'ha wowawaza walelwa wa Kohati, kwa kuwinza ng'holo na ivyazi lya hewo. <verse eid="NUM 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35"/>Nawawandika wanhu weng'ha wawele na miyaka makumi gadatu mbaka makumi gahano, chila yoweza kwinjila kuli kukola mijito ja ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36"/>Wanhu wa ivyazi lya hewo nawali elufu mbili na miya saba na makumi gahano (2,750). <verse eid="NUM 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37"/>Awa ndo wanhu wa ivyazi lya Kohati, wawele ngukola mijito kuli ihema lya Nguluwi, liwele Musa na Aluni nawawawaza kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyonayamlajize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38"/>Walelwa wa Gelishoni kwa kuwinza ng'holo za hewo, <verse eid="NUM 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39"/>wawele na miyaka makumi gadatu mbaka makumi gahano, wawele woweza kukola mijito kuli ihema lya Nguluwi, <verse eid="NUM 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40"/>nawali wanhu elufu mbili na miya sita na makumi gahano (2,650) kwa kuwinza ng'holo za hewo na ivyazi lya hewo. <verse eid="NUM 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41"/>Awa ndo nawawele walelwa wa Gelishoni weng'ha kwa kuwinza ng'holo za hewo na ivyazi lya hewo, wakolile mijito kuli ihema lya Nguluwi, wawele Musa na Aluni nawawawaza kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyawalajize. <verse eid="NUM 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42"/>Walelwa wa Melali kwa kuwinza ivyazi lya hewo, <verse eid="NUM 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43"/>wawele na miyaka makumi gadatu mbaka makumi gahano, wawele woweza kukola mijito kuli ihema lya Nguluwi, <verse eid="NUM 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44"/>nawali wanhu elufu zidatu na miya mbili (3,200). <verse eid="NUM 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45"/>Awa ndo walelwa wa Melali kwa kuwinza ng'holo za hewo wawele Musa na Aluni nawawawaza kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46"/>Ahyo, Walawi weng'ha wandichigwe na Musa na Aluni na vilongozi wa wanhu wa Isilaeli, kwa kuwinza ivyazi lyawo na ng'holo za hewo, <verse eid="NUM 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47"/>wawele na miyaka makumi gadatu mbaka makumi gahano, wawele woweza kukola mijito ja kulilolela na kulipika ihema lya Nguluwi, <verse eid="NUM 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48"/>nawali wanhu elufu nane na miya zihano na makumi nane (8,580). <verse eid="NUM 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49"/>Kwa mzilo wa Mkulu Nguluwi, nawawazigwa na Musa. Chila munhu nakapegwa mijito ja heye na itunyo lya heye, kota Mkulu Nguluwi navyoyamlajize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5"/>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wakokomoche</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2"/>“Walonjele Waisilaeli wamlavye kunze mwa kambi chila munhu yakokomoche na chila munhu yawele na utamwa wa ngozi na yalingulawa mifila na chila yawele yakokomoche kwa kudoliza mtufi. <verse eid="NUM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3"/>Mowalavya kunze mwa kambi wanhu awo weng'ha, wawe walume ama wadala, leka waleche kuidita ikokomoche kambi ya heni yondilingikala hali hewo.” <verse eid="NUM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4"/>Waisilaeli nawadita ahyo, nawawalavya kunze mwa kambi. Kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Musa, ndo Waisilaeli vyowaditile.<verse eid="NUM 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhilula kwa chiwalo cha kusilwa nongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5"/>Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6"/>“Walonjele Waisilaeli kota munhu yoneche, mlume ama mdala, wone yomditila munhu gehile, kuno kahela makundo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi wa heye, munhu ayo kana nongwa, <verse eid="NUM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7"/>yomlapa yalonje kwa mlomo wa heye gehile ga heye goyaditile. Na imgana kulavya chinhu chenele kwa gala goyaditile, yokonjeza honhu ha kahano ha chinhu acho, komha chinhu acho munhu yula yamditile gehile. <verse eid="NUM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8"/>Ila wone munhu ayo yaditilwe gehile yabagame na kahela mng'holoze wa habehi wa kubochela chinhu acho, lelo chinhu acho kwa chiwalo cha nongwa ayo cholavigwa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha watambika. Kuhilusa kuno ndo hamwe na ing'holo ilume liwele lyolavigwa kwa chiwalo cha uhanyisi na kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga heye. <verse eid="NUM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9"/>Chila ndolendole zelile za Waisilaeli za kumlavila mtambika, zowa za ayo mtambika. <verse eid="NUM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10"/>Chila chinhu chelile cha kuhilikwa kwa mtambika chowa cha heye.”<verse eid="NUM 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Utaguso kwa ung'hondwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12"/>“Walonjele Waisilaeli ahi. Wone mdala wa munhu yoneche nakapaluka na kumdita yaleche kukundigwa kwa mlume wa heye, <verse eid="NUM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13"/>nakawasa na munhu yunji ne mlume wa heye kuvizela, nakedita yakokomoche ila haduhu munhu yachiwene chinhu acho chikoleka kwa vila hebatigwe hebu. <verse eid="NUM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14"/>Lelo wone mlume wa heye yenjilwe na majesa na kona fihi kwa mdala wa heye yeditile yakokomoche, ama wone nakawa na fihi kwa mdala wa heye hanga mdala wa heye naheditile yakokomoche, <verse eid="NUM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15"/>lelo ayo mlume komigala ayo mdala kwa mtambika kigala nhambiko ilinguganigwa, iwele ndo kilo imwe ya utimbo wa shayili, ila ne kujida mafuta ama ubani, kwa vila ndo nhambiko ya fihi, nhambiko ilingulavigwa kulajila kota kana nongwa ama hebu.<verse eid="NUM 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16"/>“Mtambika komigala ayo mdala behi, na kumwimiza hali Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17"/>Hamba mtambika kojida mazi gelile mli chisaye na kuhola nhimbwisi kulawa hasi mli ihema lya Nguluwi na kujela mli mazi ago. <verse eid="NUM 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18"/>Mtambika komuwika mdala ayo hali Mkulu Nguluwi na kumgubula mnvili na kumha nhambiko ayo ya nyhule ya kulajila nongwa, iwele ndo nhambiko ya fihi. Mtambika heye kochibatilila chila chisaye chiwele na mazi galingigala kupanjilwa. <verse eid="NUM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19"/>Hamba mtambika komlonjela ayo mdala yelahe kwa kulonga, ‘Wone huwasile na mlume yunji kidita ukokomoche hali ludali lwa mlume wa hegwe, lelo hupanjilwa hebu na mazi gano. <verse eid="NUM 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20"/>Ila wone uhinduche uwele hali ludali lwa mlume wa hegwe, kiyambuza ukokomoche kwa kuwasa na mlume yunji uwele hali ludali lwa mlume wa hegwe, <verse eid="NUM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nayakugaze na kilaha kwa kukupanjila hali wanhu wa hegwe, uwe mhende na lida lya hegwe litutume. <verse eid="NUM 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22"/>Mazi aga galingigala kupanjilwa genjile mlida lya hegwe na kukudita uleche kuponda na lida lya hegwe litutume.’ Na heye mdala kokwidichila, ‘Ena, Ena.’<verse eid="NUM 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23"/>“Hamba mtambika kokwandika kupanjilwa aku kuli igozi na kuhovuga maandiko ago kuli mazi gausungu, <verse eid="NUM 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24"/>na heye komnweza mdala mazi ago galingigala kupanjilwa na kumigalila usungu lukami, <verse eid="NUM 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25"/>hamba mtambika kohola yila nhambiko ya nyhule ya fihi mmoko mwa mlume wa ayo mdala na kwinula kuchanya hali Mkulu Nguluwi na kuigala honhu ha kulavila nhambiko. <verse eid="NUM 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26"/>Hamba mtambika kohola honhu ha nhambiko ayo ya nyhule kwa kukumbuchila na kuilakaza hali honhu ha kulavila nhambiko. Hamba komnweza ayo mdala ago mazi gausungu. <verse eid="NUM 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27"/>Wone yanwe, wone yeditile yakokomoche, na kumdita yawe hambe yakundigwe kwa mlume wa heye, mazi ago galingigala kupanjilwa gomgalila usungu ung'hang'hale ng'hatu, lida lya heye lyotutuma na kowa mhende. Mdala ayo kowa yapanjilwe kuli wanhu wa heye. <verse eid="NUM 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28"/>Ila wone mdala ayo heditile yakokomoche na kela, lelo hokwabuka na koweza kuponda wana.<verse eid="NUM 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29"/>“Lelo aga ndo malajizo kuwala kutagusa fihi, wone mdala ka hali ludali lwa mlume wa heye, kopaluka na kidita yakokomoche, <verse eid="NUM 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30"/>ama mhela mlume hoyokona fihi, na kangijesa kota mchewake nakawasa na mlume yunji. Komwimiza mdala ayo hali Mkulu Nguluwi na mtambika kodita mbuli zeng'ha za malajizo aga. <verse eid="NUM 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31"/>Mlume wa heye kowa hela nongwa yoneche, ila mdala kogazigwa kwa nongwa ya heye.”<verse eid="NUM 5:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6"/>
  <para style="s">Malajizo galinguwala Mnazili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2"/>“Uwape Waisilaeli malajizo gondonjile, wone mlume ama mdala kochilaha chilaho cha Mnazili kwa chiwalo cha kiwika chiuyeng'ha kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, <verse eid="NUM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3"/>lelo, yaleche kunwa divai ama ujimbi ama chakunwa choneche cha zabibu ama kunwa mazi ga zabibu ne kulya zabibu zipile ama zikalile. <verse eid="NUM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4"/>Mhela weng'ha hoyowa mchilaho, yaleche kulya chinhu choneche chilingulawa kuli zabibu, kulawila ipeche mbaka ibanzi.<verse eid="NUM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5"/>“Zuwa lyeng'ha lya chilaho cha heye cha kibagula, hobeya hebu mnvili za heye mbaka mhela wa chilaho cha heye hali Mkulu Nguluwi hochimala. Kowa yelile na kozileka mnvili za heye zikule. <verse eid="NUM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6"/>Zuwa lyeng'ha lyoyowa yebagule kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, munhu ayo yaleche kuwa habehi na mtufi, <verse eid="NUM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7"/>hanga uwe wa mhaza ama wa mamo na lumbu ama kalumbu wa heye, hochidita yakokomoche kwa kibagula kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa kilaha. <verse eid="NUM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8"/>Mhela weng'ha hoyowa Mnazili kowa yelile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="NUM 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9"/>“Wone munhu wa habehi na Mnazili yabagame baho du na wone yamhejelele, Mnazili kowa yakokomoche. Zuwa lya saba hoyokwelizwa, kobeya mnvili za heye. <verse eid="NUM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10"/>Kuli zuwa lya nane kohilika ng'hunda mbili za kufujigwa ama ng'hunda mbili za kisolo kwa mtambika hawele na lwizi lwa ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11"/>Mtambika kolavya ng'hunda imwe iwe nhambiko ya gehile na ng'hunda iyage iwe kwa nhambiko ya kulakazwa, na heye komditila uhanyisi, kwa vila nakadita gehile kwa chiwalo cha kuhejelela mtufi. Zuwa lilyo du, koudita mutwi wa heye uwe welile <verse eid="NUM 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12"/>na kibagula kwa Mkulu Nguluwi na kwaluka chilaho kahi. Kolavya ing'holo ilume lya mwaka umwe liwe nhambiko ya nongwa. Mazuwa ago ga mwaluko hagowazigwa kwa vila nayali yakokomoche.<verse eid="NUM 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13"/>“Aga ndo malajizo ga Mnazili hoyosinda mhela wa heye wa kibagula. Kochigaligwa hali lwizi lwa ihema lya Nguluwi, <verse eid="NUM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14"/>na kumlavila Mkulu Nguluwi nhambiko za heye, ing'holo ilume limwe lya mwaka umwe lilihela nongwa kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kulakazwa, ing'holo idala limwe lya mwaka umwe lilihela nongwa kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya gehile, na ing'holo ilume limwe lilihela nongwa kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kikala goya. <verse eid="NUM 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15"/>Kahi kolavya chidoto cha mibumunda jilihela usaso, kuwika goya kwa utimbo unojile na mafuta na mibumunda mizisili jibakalizwe mafuta hamwe na nhambiko za nyhule na za kunwa.<verse eid="NUM 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16"/>“Mtambika komlavila Mkulu Nguluwi vinhu vyeng'ha avi hamwe na nhambiko ya heye ya gehile na nhambiko ya heye ya kulakazwa. <verse eid="NUM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17"/>Mtambika komlavila Mkulu Nguluwi alyo ing'holo ilume kota nhambiko ya kikala goya, komlavya hamwe na chidoto cha mibumunda jilihela usaso na nhambiko ya nyhule na nhambiko ya kunwa. <verse eid="NUM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18"/>Aho hali lwizi lwa ihema lya Nguluwi Mnazili ayo kobeya mnvili za mutwi wa heye za kibagula na kuziwika kuli chiluli chiwele hasi ha nhambiko ya kikala goya.<verse eid="NUM 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19"/>“Baho du mtambika kohola iyega lya lila ing'holo ilume liwele lihemsigwe hamwe na ibumunda limwe lyohaliwichigwe usaso kulawa kuli chidoto na ibumunda limwe lizisili na kahi haliwichigwe usaso na kumha Mnazili mmoko naloyabeyile mnvili za heye. <verse eid="NUM 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20"/>Hamba mtambika kolavya vinhu avyo kota nhambiko ya kwinula kuchanya hali Mkulu Nguluwi, vyeng'ha avi ndo honhu helile ha mtambika, hamwe na mhambaga yinuligwe kuchanya na chima chilavigwe kota ndolendole. Hamba, Mnazili koweza kunwa divai.<verse eid="NUM 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21"/>“Alyo ndo ilajizo kuwala Mnazili. Ila wone nakelaha kulavya mzidi wa malajizo ga Mnazili, koganigwa kudita kota vyoyalagane.”<verse eid="NUM 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Watambika wanguwatambichiza Waisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23"/>“Mlonjele Aluni na wanage kota ahyo ndo vyomuwatambichiza Waisilaeli. Mowalonjela,<verse eid="NUM 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24"/>“ ‘Mkulu Nguluwi nayawatambichize na kuwamila,<verse eid="NUM 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nayawalole kwa isungu na kwa uganililo,<verse eid="NUM 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nayawalajile kunoga kwa heye na kuwapani kikala goya.’<verse eid="NUM 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27"/>“Ahyo ndo vyowolonga itagwa lya heni hali Waisilaeli, nani ndowatambichiza.”<verse eid="NUM 6:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7"/>
  <para style="s">Nhambiko za vilongozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1"/>Zuwa Musa loyasindile kwimiza ihema lya Nguluwi na kulibakaliza mafuta na kulidita liwe lyelile hamwe na vinhu vyake vyeng'ha na kubakaliza mafuta na kuhadita hawe helile honhu ha kulavila nhambiko na vinhu vyake vyeng'ha, <verse eid="NUM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2"/>vilongozi wa Isilaeli na wakulu wa lukolo na vilongozi wa nhanzi iwele wawalolele na wanhu wala wawazigwe, <verse eid="NUM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3"/>nawamigalila Mkulu Nguluwi nhambiko za hewo, mutuka imwe kwa chila vilongozi weli na isenga lilume kwa chila chilongozi. Nawavilavya vinhu avyo hali ihema lya Nguluwi, <verse eid="NUM 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5"/>“Ubochele nhambiko azi leka zikole mijito kwa chiwalo cha ihema lya Nguluwi, uwape Walawi, chila yumwe kota mijito ja heye joyakolile.” <verse eid="NUM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6"/>Lelo Musa nakahola mituka na misenga milume nakawapa Walawi. <verse eid="NUM 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7"/>Wagelishoni nawapegwa mituka mili na misenga milume jine, kwa mijito ja kupika vinhu vya ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8"/>Wamelali nawapegwa mituka jine na misenga milume nane kwa mijito ja kupika vinhu vya ihema lya Nguluwi, hali ulongozi wa Itamali mwana wa mtambika Aluni. <verse eid="NUM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9"/>Ila Musa hawapele choneche Wakohati kwa vila hewo nawali na mijito ja kulolela goya vinhu vyelile viwele naviganigwa kupichigwa mmayega.<verse eid="NUM 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10"/>Vilongozi awo wolavya nhambiko kwa chiwalo cha kuhawika honhu ha kulavila nhambiko kwa mijito yelile, zuwa lila navyohabakalizwe mafuta, nawalavya nhambiko za hewo hali honhu ha kulavila nhambiko. <verse eid="NUM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, “Chila zuwa chilongozi yumwe kolavya nhambiko ya heye kwa chiwalo cha kuhawika honhu ha kulavila nhambiko kwa mijito yelile.”<verse eid="NUM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12"/>Lelo yula yalavile nhambiko zuwa lya mwaluko, nayali Nashoni mwana wa Aminadabu, wa nhanzi ya Yuda. <verse eid="NUM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13"/>Nhambiko ya heye nayali luhelo lumwe lugongomanyigwe kwa sendi na luwele na itunyo lya kilo imwe na nusu na chisaye chimwe chigongomanyigwe kwa sendi chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya nane kwa kuwinza chipimilo cha ihema lya Nguluwi. Luhelo na chisaye navyali vimemezwe utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya nyhule. <verse eid="NUM 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14"/>Kahi nakegala chisaye chimwe cha zahabu chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya imwe na kumi chiwele chimemezwe ubani <verse eid="NUM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15"/>na ilogota ilume limwe na ing'holo lilume limwe na ing'holo lyana lilume limwe lya mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kulakazwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16"/>na ipongo limwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya gehile, <verse eid="NUM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17"/>na misenga milume mili na ming'holo milume jihano na mipongo jihano na ming'holo myana milume jihano ja mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kikala goya. Ayo ndo nayali nhambiko ya Nashoni, mwana wa Aminadabu.<verse eid="NUM 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18"/>Zuwa lya keli nayali Netaneli mwana wa Suali, chilongozi wa nhanzi ya Isakali. <verse eid="NUM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19"/>Nhambiko ya heye nayali luhelo lumwe lugongomanyigwe kwa sendi na luwele na itunyo lya kilo imwe na nusu na chisaye chimwe chigongomanyigwe kwa sendi chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya nane kwa kuwinza chipimilo cha ihema lya Nguluwi. Luhelo na chisaye navyali vimemezwe utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya nyhule. <verse eid="NUM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20"/>Kahi nakegala chisaye chimwe cha zahabu chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya imwe na kumi chiwele chimemezwe ubani <verse eid="NUM 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21"/>na ilogota ilume limwe na ing'holo lilume limwe na ing'holo lyana lilume limwe lya mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kulakazwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22"/>na ipongo limwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya gehile, <verse eid="NUM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23"/>na misenga milume mili na ming'holo milume jihano na mipongo jihano na ming'holo myana milume jihano ja mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kikala goya. Ayo ndo iwele nhambiko ya Netaneli, mwana wa Suali.<verse eid="NUM 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24"/>Zuwa lya kadatu nayali Eliabu mwana wa Heloni, chilongozi wa nhanzi ya Sebuluni. <verse eid="NUM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25"/>Nhambiko ya heye nayali luhelo lumwe lugongomanyigwe kwa sendi na luwele na itunyo lya kilo imwe na nusu na chisaye chimwe chigongomanyigwe kwa sendi chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya nane kwa kuwinza chipimilo cha ihema lya Nguluwi. Luhelo na chisaye navyali vimemezwe utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya nyhule. <verse eid="NUM 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26"/>Kahi nakegala chisaye chimwe cha zahabu chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya imwe na kumi chiwele chimemezwe ubani <verse eid="NUM 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27"/>na ilogota ilume limwe na ing'holo lilume limwe na ing'holo lyana lilume limwe lya mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kulakazwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28"/>na ipongo limwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya gehile, <verse eid="NUM 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29"/>na misenga milume mili na ming'holo milume jihano na mipongo jihano na ming'holo myana milume jihano ja mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kikala goya. Ayo ndo iwele nhambiko ya Eliabu, mwana wa Heloni.<verse eid="NUM 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30"/>Zuwa lya kane nayali Elisuli mwana wa Shedeuli, chilongozi wa nhanzi ya Lubeni. <verse eid="NUM 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31"/>Nhambiko ya heye nayali luhelo lumwe lugongomanyigwe kwa sendi na luwele na itunyo lya kilo imwe na nusu na chisaye chimwe chigongomanyigwe kwa sendi chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya nane kwa kuwinza chipimilo cha ihema lya Nguluwi. Luhelo na chisaye navyali vimemezwe utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya nyhule. <verse eid="NUM 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32"/>Kahi nakegala chisaye chimwe cha zahabu chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya imwe na kumi chiwele chimemezwe ubani <verse eid="NUM 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33"/>na ilogota ilume limwe na ing'holo lilume limwe na ing'holo lyana lilume limwe lya mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kulakazwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34"/>na ipongo limwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya gehile, <verse eid="NUM 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35"/>na misenga milume mili na ming'holo milume jihano na mipongo jihano na ming'holo myana milume jihano ja mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kikala goya. Ayo ndo iwele nhambiko ya Elisuli, mwana wa Shedeuli.<verse eid="NUM 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36"/>Zuwa lya kahano nayali Shelumieli mwana wa Suli-shadai, chilongozi wa nhanzi ya Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37"/>Nhambiko ya heye nayali luhelo lumwe lugongomanyigwe kwa sendi na luwele na itunyo lya kilo imwe na nusu na chisaye chimwe chigongomanyigwe kwa sendi chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya nane kwa kuwinza chipimilo cha ihema lya Nguluwi. Luhelo na chisaye navyali vimemezwe utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya nyhule. <verse eid="NUM 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38"/>Kahi nakegala chisaye chimwe cha zahabu chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya imwe na kumi chiwele chimemezwe ubani <verse eid="NUM 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39"/>na ilogota ilume limwe na ing'holo lilume limwe na ing'holo lyana lilume limwe lya mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kulakazwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40"/>na ipongo limwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya gehile, <verse eid="NUM 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41"/>na misenga milume mili na ming'holo milume jihano na mipongo jihano na ming'holo myana milume jihano ja mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kikala goya. Ayo ndo iwele nhambiko ya Shelumieli, mwana wa Suli-shadai.<verse eid="NUM 7:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42"/>Zuwa lya sita nayali Eliasafu mwana wa Deueli, chilongozi wa nhanzi ya Gadi. <verse eid="NUM 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43"/>Nhambiko ya heye nayali luhelo lumwe lugongomanyigwe kwa sendi na luwele na itunyo lya kilo imwe na nusu na chisaye chimwe chigongomanyigwe kwa sendi chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya nane kwa kuwinza chipimilo cha ihema lya Nguluwi. Luhelo na chisaye navyali vimemezwe utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya nyhule. <verse eid="NUM 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44"/>Kahi nakegala chisaye chimwe cha zahabu chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya imwe na kumi chiwele chimemezwe ubani <verse eid="NUM 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45"/>na ilogota ilume limwe na ing'holo lilume limwe na ing'holo lyana lilume limwe lya mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kulakazwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46"/>na ipongo limwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya gehile, <verse eid="NUM 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47"/>na misenga milume mili na ming'holo milume jihano na mipongo jihano na ming'holo myana milume jihano ja mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kikala goya. Ayo ndo iwele nhambiko ya Eliasafu, mwana wa Deueli.<verse eid="NUM 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48"/>Zuwa lya saba nayali Elishama mwana wa Amihudi, chilongozi wa nhanzi ya Efulaimu. <verse eid="NUM 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49"/>Nhambiko ya heye nayali luhelo lumwe lugongomanyigwe kwa sendi na luwele na itunyo lya kilo imwe na nusu na chisaye chimwe chigongomanyigwe kwa sendi chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya nane kwa kuwinza chipimilo cha ihema lya Nguluwi. Luhelo na chisaye navyali vimemezwe utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya nyhule. <verse eid="NUM 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50"/>Kahi nakegala chisaye chimwe cha zahabu chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya imwe na kumi chiwele chimemezwe ubani <verse eid="NUM 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51"/>na ilogota ilume limwe na ing'holo lilume limwe na ing'holo lyana lilume limwe lya mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kulakazwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52"/>na ipongo limwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya gehile, <verse eid="NUM 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53"/>na misenga milume mili na ming'holo milume jihano na mipongo jihano na ming'holo myana milume jihano ja mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kikala goya. Ayo ndo iwele nhambiko ya Elishama, mwana wa Amihudi.<verse eid="NUM 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54"/>Zuwa lya nane nayali Gamalieli mwana wa Pedasuli, chilongozi wa nhanzi ya Manase. <verse eid="NUM 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55"/>Nhambiko ya heye nayali luhelo lumwe lugongomanyigwe kwa sendi na luwele na itunyo lya kilo imwe na nusu na chisaye chimwe chigongomanyigwe kwa sendi chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya nane kwa kuwinza chipimilo cha ihema lya Nguluwi. Luhelo na chisaye navyali vimemezwe utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya nyhule. <verse eid="NUM 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56"/>Kahi nakegala chisaye chimwe cha zahabu chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya imwe na kumi chiwele chimemezwe ubani <verse eid="NUM 7:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57"/>na ilogota ilume limwe na ing'holo lilume limwe na ing'holo lyana lilume limwe lya mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kulakazwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58"/>na ipongo limwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya gehile, <verse eid="NUM 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59"/>na misenga milume mili na ming'holo milume jihano na mipongo jihano na ming'holo myana milume jihano ja mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kikala goya. Ayo ndo iwele nhambiko ya Gamalieli, mwana wa Pedasuli.<verse eid="NUM 7:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60"/>Zuwa lya tisa nayali Abidani mwana wa Gideoni, chilongozi wa nhanzi ya Benjamini. <verse eid="NUM 7:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61"/>Nhambiko ya heye nayali luhelo lumwe lugongomanyigwe kwa sendi na luwele na itunyo lya kilo imwe na nusu na chisaye chimwe chigongomanyigwe kwa sendi chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya nane kwa kuwinza chipimilo cha ihema lya Nguluwi. Luhelo na chisaye navyali vimemezwe utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya nyhule. <verse eid="NUM 7:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62"/>Kahi nakegala chisaye chimwe cha zahabu chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya imwe na kumi chiwele chimemezwe ubani <verse eid="NUM 7:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63"/>na ilogota ilume limwe na ing'holo lilume limwe na ing'holo lyana lilume limwe lya mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kulakazwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64"/>na ipongo limwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya gehile, <verse eid="NUM 7:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65"/>na misenga milume mili na ming'holo milume jihano na mipongo jihano na ming'holo myana milume jihano ja mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kikala goya. Ayo ndo iwele nhambiko ya Abidani, mwana wa Gideoni.<verse eid="NUM 7:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66"/>Zuwa lya kumi nayali Ahieseli mwana wa Amishadai, chilongozi wa nhanzi ya Dani. <verse eid="NUM 7:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67"/>Nhambiko ya heye nayali luhelo lumwe lugongomanyigwe kwa sendi na luwele na itunyo lya kilo imwe na nusu na chisaye chimwe chigongomanyigwe kwa sendi chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya nane kwa kuwinza chipimilo cha ihema lya Nguluwi. Luhelo na chisaye navyali vimemezwe utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya nyhule. <verse eid="NUM 7:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68"/>Kahi nakegala chisaye chimwe cha zahabu chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya imwe na kumi chiwele chimemezwe ubani <verse eid="NUM 7:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69"/>na ilogota ilume limwe na ing'holo lilume limwe na ing'holo lyana lilume limwe lya mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kulakazwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70"/>na ipongo limwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya gehile, <verse eid="NUM 7:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71"/>na misenga milume mili na ming'holo milume jihano na mipongo jihano na ming'holo myana milume jihano ja mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kikala goya. Ayo ndo iwele nhambiko ya Ahieseli, mwana wa Amishadai.<verse eid="NUM 7:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72"/>Zuwa lya kumi na imwe nayali Pagieli mwana wa Okilani, chilongozi wa nhanzi ya Asheli. <verse eid="NUM 7:72"/><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73"/>Nhambiko ya heye nayali luhelo lumwe lugongomanyigwe kwa sendi na luwele na itunyo lya kilo imwe na nusu na chisaye chimwe chigongomanyigwe kwa sendi chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya nane kwa kuwinza chipimilo cha ihema lya Nguluwi. Luhelo na chisaye navyali vimemezwe utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya nyhule. <verse eid="NUM 7:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74"/>Kahi nakegala chisaye chimwe cha zahabu chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya imwe na kumi chiwele chimemezwe ubani <verse eid="NUM 7:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75"/>na ilogota ilume limwe na ing'holo lilume limwe na ing'holo lyana lilume limwe lya mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kulakazwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:75"/><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76"/>na ipongo limwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya gehile, <verse eid="NUM 7:76"/><verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77"/>na misenga milume mili na ming'holo milume jihano na mipongo jihano na ming'holo myana milume jihano ja mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kikala goya. Ayo ndo iwele nhambiko ya Pagieli, mwana wa Okilani.<verse eid="NUM 7:77"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78"/>Zuwa lya kumi na mbili nayali Ahila mwana wa Enani, chilongozi wa nhanzi ya Nafutali. <verse eid="NUM 7:78"/><verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79"/>Nhambiko ya heye nayali luhelo lumwe lugongomanyigwe kwa sendi na luwele na itunyo lya kilo imwe na nusu na chisaye chimwe chigongomanyigwe kwa sendi chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya nane kwa kuwinza chipimilo cha ihema lya Nguluwi. Luhelo na chisaye navyali vimemezwe utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya nyhule. <verse eid="NUM 7:79"/><verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80"/>Kahi nakegala chisaye chimwe cha zahabu chiwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya imwe na kumi chiwele chimemezwe ubani <verse eid="NUM 7:80"/><verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81"/>na ilogota ilume limwe na ing'holo lilume limwe na ing'holo lyana lilume limwe lya mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kulakazwa, <verse eid="NUM 7:81"/><verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82"/>na ipongo limwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya gehile, <verse eid="NUM 7:82"/><verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83"/>na misenga milume mili na ming'holo milume jihano na mipongo jihano na ming'holo myana milume jihano ja mwaka umwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kikala goya. Ayo ndo iwele nhambiko ya Ahila, mwana wa Enani.<verse eid="NUM 7:83"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84"/>Ndolendole zeng'ha za nhambiko za vilongozi wa Isilaeli kwa chiwalo cha honhu ha kulavila nhambiko kuli zuwa lya kubakalizwa mafuta, nyhelo kumi na mbili zigongomanyigwe kwa sendi nyinji na visaye kumi na vili vigongomanyigwe kwa sendi nyinji na visaye vya zahabu kumi na vili. <verse eid="NUM 7:84"/><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85"/>Chila chisaye chigongomanyigwe kwa sendi, nachali na itunyo lya kilo imwe na nusu na chila chisaye nachali na itunyo lya gilamu miya nane. Avyo vinhu vyeng'ha navyali na itunyo lya kilo makumi meli na saba na gilamu miya sita kwa kuwinza chipimilo cha ihema lya Nguluwi.<verse eid="NUM 7:85"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86"/>Zila nyhelo zigongomanyigwe kwa zahabu kumi na mbili ziwele zimemile ubani, chila imwe iwele na itunyo lya gilamu miya imwe na kumi kwa kuwinza chipimilo cha ihema lya Nguluwi, vyeng'ha navyali na itunyo lya kilo imwe na gilamu miya zidatu na makumi meli. <verse eid="NUM 7:86"/><verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87"/>Migongolo jeng'ha ja nhambiko ya kulakazwa najali milogota milume kumi na mili na ming'holo milume kumi na mili hamwe na nhambiko ya nyhule na mipongo kumi na mili kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya gehile, <verse eid="NUM 7:87"/><verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88"/>na kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kikala goya. Migongolo jilavigwe najali mibuguma makumi meli na jine na ming'holo milume makumi sita na mibebelu makumi sita na ming'holo myana milume ja mwaka umwe, makumi sita. Ayo ndo nayali nhambiko ilavigwe kwa chiwalo cha honhu ha kulavila nhambiko nalohamalile kubakalizwa mafuta.<verse eid="NUM 7:88"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89"/>Mhela Musa vyoyenjile mgati mwa ihema lya Nguluwi leka yadawale na Mkulu Nguluwi, nakahulika lizi lilawila kuchanya kwa chigubiko cha uhanyisi, chiwele mchanya mwa isanduku lya ilagano, kulawila hagati mwa vila vilumbigwe vili vifandile kota wahilisi. Lelo, nakadawala na heye.<verse eid="NUM 7:89"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8"/>
  <para style="s">Kuwichigwa kwa vyenje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2"/>“Mlonjele Aluni kota mhela hoyowika vila vyenje saba kuli chinhu cha kuwichila vyenje, yaviwiche goya leka vimwemwesele ubanzi wa kumwando.” <verse eid="NUM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3"/>Aluni nakadita ago, nakaviwika vyenje avyo leka vimwemwesele ubanzi wa kumwando mwa chinhu cha kuwichila vyenje, kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4"/>Chinhu acho cha kuwichila vyenje nachali chigongomanyigwe kwa uwanzi ukulu kwa zahabu, ipondigwe kulawila kuli chikalilo mbaka kuli uluwa, kota Mkulu Nguluwi navyoyamlajize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wanguwichigwa chiuyeng'ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5"/>Kahi Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6"/>“Wabagule Walawi kulawila Waisilaeli, uwelize. <verse eid="NUM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7"/>Ahi ndo vyouweliza, wamizile mazi ga kuwelizila na uwalonjele webeye mnvili lukuli lweng'ha na wahovuje mivalo ja hewo leka welizwe. <verse eid="NUM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8"/>Hamba wolavya ilogota ilume limwe hamwe na nhambiko ya heye ya nyhule, iwele ndo utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta, nagwe kolavya ilogota ilume liyage kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya gehile. <verse eid="NUM 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9"/>Hamba kokungajiza Waisilaeli weng'ha na kuwegala Walawi hali ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10"/>Houwegala Walawi hali heni Mkulu Nguluwi, Waisilaeli wowawichila moko Walawi, <verse eid="NUM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11"/>hamba Aluni kowalavya awo Walawi hali heni Mkulu Nguluwi kota ndolendole ya chiuyeng'ha kulawila kwa Waisilaeli wang'holele mijito. <verse eid="NUM 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12"/>Hamba Walawi wowika moko ga hewo mchanya mwa mitwi ja mibuguma ajo, limwe kolilavya liwe nhambiko ya gehile na alyo liyage kolilavya liwe nhambiko ya kulakazwa ilavigwe kwa heni Mkulu Nguluwi, leka kuwaditila uhanyisi Walawi.<verse eid="NUM 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13"/>“Hamba, kowemiza Walawi hali Aluni na wanage na kuwalavya hali heni Mkulu Nguluwi kota ndolendole ya chiuyeng'ha. <verse eid="NUM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14"/>Ahi ndo vyouwabagula Walawi hali Waisilaeli leka wawe wa heni. <verse eid="NUM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15"/>Housinda kuweliza Walawi na kuwalavya kota ndolendole ya chiuyeng'ha, wokwinjila mli ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16"/>Hewo wawichigwa wawe wa heni ng'hatu, ndiwahola hewo honhu ha walelwa wa mwaluko wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17"/>Mina walelwa weng'ha wa mwaluko kuli wanhu wa Isilaeli ndo wa heni, wanhu na migongolo, kwa vila kuli mazuwa ga mwaluko londiwakopole walelwa weng'ha wa mwaluko kuli isi ya Misili, nandiwawika chiuyeng'ha kwa chiwalo cha heni. <verse eid="NUM 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18"/>Sambi ndanguwahola Walawi honhu ha walelwa wa mwaluko wa Isilaeli, <verse eid="NUM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19"/>na ndimha awo Walawi, Aluni na wanage kota ndolendole kulawila kwa Waisilaeli, leka wakole mijito kuli ihema lya Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha Waisilaeli na kuwamila leka haleche kulawila igayo hali wanhu wa Isilaeli wone wohahejelela honhu helile.”<verse eid="NUM 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20"/>Ahyo, Musa na Aluni na Waisilaeli weng'ha, wowawika Walawi wawe wa chiuyeng'ha, kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21"/>Walawi naweweliza gehile ga hewo na kuhovuga nguwo za hewo, na heye Aluni nakawalavya kota ndolendole ya chiuyeng'ha hali Mkulu Nguluwi. Aluni kahi, nakadita uhanyisi kwa chiwalo cha kuweliza hewo. <verse eid="NUM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22"/>Hamba Walawi nawenjila na kukola mijito ja hewo kuli ihema lya Nguluwi hali Aluni na wanage, kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Musa kuwala awo Walawi, na ndo vyowawaditile.<verse eid="NUM 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24"/>“Chila Mlawi yawele na miyaka makumi meli na gahano na mzidi, kokola mijito ja uchitumagwa kuli ihema lya Nguluwi <verse eid="NUM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25"/>na koleka mijito ajo loyowa na miyaka makumi gahano. <verse eid="NUM 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26"/>Hamba kahi, koweza kuwatanza Walawi wayage kuli ihema lya Nguluwi kwa kulyamila, ila hambe yakundigwe kukola mijito yoneche. Ahyo ndo vyouwalajiza Walawi kukola mijito.”<verse eid="NUM 8:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9"/>
  <para style="s">Pasaka ya keli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1"/>Hamba, loufichile mwezi wa mwaluko wa mwaka wa keli hala Waisilaeli lowalawile Misili. Mkulu Nguluwi nakalongasa na Musa kuchiwala ako Sinai. Nakamlonjela, <verse eid="NUM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2"/>“Waisilaeli wanguganigwa waidite mnvina ya Pasaka kuli mhela uwichigwe. <verse eid="NUM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3"/>Ayi yowa zuwa lya kumi na kane lya mwezi awu, mhela wa kuzinga kwa isanya wodita ahyo kwa kuwinza mizilo na malajizo geng'ha.” <verse eid="NUM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4"/>Ahyo, Musa nakawalonjela wanhu wa Isilaeli kota wangulapigwa kudita mnvina ya Pasaka. <verse eid="NUM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5"/>Lelo nawaidita mnvina ya Pasaka mhela wa kuzinga kwa isanya, zuwa lya kumi na kane lya mwezi wa mwaluko kuchiwala ako Sinai. Waisilaeli nawadita geng'ha kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6"/>Ila wanhu wamwe nawawele hala nawalemwela kulya chilyo cha Pasaka ayo kwa vila nawali wadolize mtufi, nawawa wakokomoche. Awo nawawalutila Musa na Aluni, <verse eid="NUM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7"/>Wawalonjela, “Hetwe twa wanhu wakokomoche kwa vila natudoliza mtufi, lelo lekachoni tulemezwe kumlavila Mkulu Nguluwi nhambiko za heye kwa mhela uwichigwe hamwe na Waisilaeli wanji?”<verse eid="NUM 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8"/>Musa nakawedichila, “Mbeteze mbaka hala hondipegwa malajizo ga kuwawala hemwe kulawila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.”<verse eid="NUM 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9"/>Na heye Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10"/>“Yumwe wa hemwe ama yumwe wa walelwa wa hemwe wone yawe yokokomoche kwa kudoliza mtufi ama yawe kutali mmajendo, ila yoweza kuidita mnvina ya Pasaka kwa Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11"/>Munhu kota ayo kokundizwa kudita ahyo mwezi umwe hamba, mhela wa kuzinga kwa isanya kuli zuwa lya kumi na kane lya mwezi wa keli. Koidita kwa kulya mibumunda jilihela usaso na mboga ziwele usungu. <verse eid="NUM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12"/>Waleche kusigaza chilyo choneche mbaka lufuku, kahi waleche kubena izeje ne limwe lya migongolo ja Pasaka. Woidita mnvina ayi ya pasaka kwa kuwinza malajizo galinguganigwa. <verse eid="NUM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13"/>Ila yula munhu yoneche yelizwe ama hawele mmajendo, wone haiditile mnvina ya Pasaka, kobaguligwa na wanhu wa heye kwa vila handavile nhambiko Mkulu Nguluwi kwa mhela uganigwe. Koganigwa yagazigwe kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga heye.<verse eid="NUM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14"/>“Wone hana mjenzi yalingikala behi na hemwe na kangugana kuidita mnvina ya Pasaka kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, munhu ayo koganigwa yadite ahyo kwa kuwinza malajizo geng'ha ga Pasaka. Chila munhu kowinza malajizo gagala galinguganigwa, yawe mjenzi ama mwenyeng'haye.”<verse eid="NUM 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'hungugu mchanya mwa ihema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 40:34-38">Kulawa 40:34-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15"/>Zuwa lila ihema lya Nguluwi loliwichigwe, ng'hungugu naidulika na kugubika ihema lya Nguluwi. Mhela wa kuzinga kwa isanya mbaka lufuku ng'hungugu ayo nayoneka kota chiluli. <verse eid="NUM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16"/>Ahyo ndo vyonaiwele chila zuwa, ng'hungugu naigubika ihema nemisi, na nechilo nayoneka kota chiluli. <verse eid="NUM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17"/>Chila mhela ng'hungugu yila chila loyinuligwe mchanya mwa ihema, Waisilaeli nawoka na kuza kuwika kambi honhu hanji yila ng'hungugu hoigwile. <verse eid="NUM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18"/>Nawaheluka mmajendo kwa kulajizwa na Mkulu Nguluwi, wanhu wa Isilaeli nawawika kambi kahi kwa kulajizwa na Mkulu Nguluwi. Mhela weng'ha ng'hungugu ayo loyali mchanya mwa ihema, wanhu nawekala honhu aho. <verse eid="NUM 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19"/>Hanga yila ng'hungugu iwe yikale mchanya mwa ihema kwa mazuwa menji, Waisilaeli nawamhulichiza Mkulu Nguluwi, na hewo hawochile. <verse eid="NUM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20"/>Mhela wunji ng'hungugu naikala mchanya mwa ihema lya Nguluwi kwa mhela wa mazuwa mado hela, ila chila mhela Waisilaeli nawapona bahala kuli kambi, nawoka hala Mkulu Nguluwi navyoyawalajize. <verse eid="NUM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21"/>Mala yinji ng'hungugu naiwa mchanya mwa ihema lya Nguluwi kulawa matinazo mbaka mitondo. Ng'hungugu yila loyinuligwe nawenula majendo, hanga naiwele mchanya nemisi na nechilo, ng'hungugu loyinuligwe, nawenula majendo. <verse eid="NUM 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22"/>Wone iwe mazuwa meli ama mwezi ama mwaka ama mzidi, mhela weng'ha ng'hungugu loiwele mchanya mwa ihema lya Nguluwi, Waisilaeli hawochile, ila loyinuligwe na hewo nawoka. <verse eid="NUM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23"/>Kwa kulajizwa na Mkulu Nguluwi nawawika kambi na kwa kulajizwa na Mkulu Nguluwi nawaheluka mmajendo. Nawebatilila ilajizo lya Mkulu Nguluwi kota navyoyalajize kwa kukolela Musa.<verse eid="NUM 9:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10"/>
  <para style="s">Mhalamhanda zigongomanyigwe kwa sendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2"/>“Ugongomanye mhalamhanda mbili kwa sendi, ziwele zipondigwe. Mhalamhanda azo mozikolela mijito ja kuwachema Waisilaeli weng'ha na kwa chiwalo cha kuka homuwichile kambi. <verse eid="NUM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3"/>Mhalamhanda zeng'ha mbili wone zipembigwe hamwe, Waisilaeli weng'ha wochikungajiza hali hegwe hali lwizi lwa ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4"/>Ila wone ipembigwe mhalamhanda imwe, aho vilongozi wa nhanzi ya Isilaeli yeka ndo wowa wolapigwa kikungajiza behi na hegwe. <verse eid="NUM 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5"/>Ulajilo awo wone ulavigwe kwa kupemba mhalamhanda hado hado kwa kulutilila, wenyeng'haye wa kambi za kolilawila isanya wokwaluka majendo. <verse eid="NUM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6"/>Wone ulajilo awo utowigwe lwa keli, wala wawele kuli kambi za kusini wokwaluka kuka. Ulajilo awo wa mhalamhanda wotowigwa chila mhela wa kwaluka majendo. <verse eid="NUM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7"/>Ila mhela wa kuwachema Waisilaeli weng'ha weting'hane hamwe, mhalamhanda zopembigwa kwa kulutilila lukami kota vyowazowele, ila zileche kupembigwa hado hado. <verse eid="NUM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8"/>Walelwa walume wa Aluni, watambika, ndo wopemba mhalamhanda azo. Ilajizo ali moliwinza kuli lulelo wa hemwe weng'ha mazuwa gose.<verse eid="NUM 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9"/>“Mhela wa kitowa ngondo muisi ya hemwe na wang'honyo, molavya ulajilo kwa kupemba mhalamhanda azi hado hado leka Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe yawakumbuche na kuwalohola na wala wang'honyo wa hemwe. <verse eid="NUM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10"/>Hihila na mazuwa ga hemwe ga kusangalala, kota hila mnvina za kulawa kwa nyelezi na mnvina zinji, mopemba mhalamhanda azi mhela lomlavya nhambiko za hemwe za kulakaza na nhambiko za hemwe za kikala goya. Aho heni Mkulu Nguluwi wa hemwe ndowakumbukani. Heni nda Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe.”<verse eid="NUM 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Waisilaeli wangubena kambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11"/>Loifichile zuwa lya makumi meli lya mwezi wa keli, mwaka wa keli kulawila Waisilaeli lowochile Misili, ng'hungugu iwele mchanya kuli ihema lya Nguluwi nayinuka, <verse eid="NUM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12"/>na hewo Waisilaeli waluka majendo ga hewo kulawila kuli chiwala ako Sinai. Ng'hungugu ayo nayidulika kuli chiwala ako Palani.<verse eid="NUM 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13"/>Aho mwaluko Waisilaeli nawaluka majendo kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14"/>Wala wawele hali bendela ya chilundo cha nhanzi ya Yuda, nawalongola, chilundo chimwe hamba chiyage. Chilongozi wa hewo nayali Nashoni mwana wa Aminadabu. <verse eid="NUM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15"/>Netaneli mwana wa Suali, nayali chilongozi wa chilundo cha nhanzi ya Isakali. <verse eid="NUM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16"/>Na heye Eliabu mwana wa Heloni, nayali chilongozi wa chilundo cha nhanzi ya Sebuluni.<verse eid="NUM 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17"/>Hamba, ihema lya Nguluwi naliduliswa, na wanhu wa ng'holo za Gelishoni na za Melali ndo nawalipapile, nawaluka kuka.<verse eid="NUM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18"/>Hamba, wanhu wonawali hali bendela ya chilundo chilongozwe na nhanzi ya Lubeni, nawawinza chilundo chimwe mbaka chiyage. Chilongozi wa hewo nayali Elisuli mwana wa Shedeuli. <verse eid="NUM 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19"/>Shelumieli mwana wa Suli-shadai, nakailongoza nhanzi ya Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20"/>Eliasafu mwana wa Deueli, nakailongoza nhanzi ya Gadi.<verse eid="NUM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21"/>Hamba nawawawinza wanhu wa lukolo lwa Kohati, nawali wapapile vinhu vyelile. Lowafichile, ihema lya Nguluwi nalyali liwichigwe goya.<verse eid="NUM 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22"/>Kumbele kwa hewo, nawawinza wanhu wawele hali bendela ya chilundo chilongozwe na nhanzi ya Efulaimu, chilundo chimwe kumbele kwa chiyage. Chilongozi wa hewo nayali Elishama, mwana wa Amihudi. <verse eid="NUM 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23"/>Gamalieli mwana wa Pedasuli nakailongoza nhanzi ya Manase, <verse eid="NUM 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24"/>na heye Abidani mwana wa Gideoni, nakailongoza nhanzi ya Benjamini.<verse eid="NUM 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25"/>Mwiso, wala wawele hali bendela ya chilundo chilongozwe na nhanzi ya Dani, wawele wokwamila kumbele mwa vilundo vyeng'ha, nawaluka majendo, chilundo chimwe kumbele kwa chiyage. Awa nawalongozwa na Ahieseli mwana wa Amishadai. <verse eid="NUM 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26"/>Pagieli, mwana wa Okilani, nakailongoza nhanzi ya Asheli. <verse eid="NUM 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27"/>Ahila mwana wa Enani, nakailongoza nhanzi ya Nafutali. <verse eid="NUM 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28"/>Ahi lelo, ndo Waisilaeli navyowawele mmajendo na ndo vyowewichile goya kuli vilundo vya hewo, chila mhela lowaluche majendo.<verse eid="NUM 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29"/>Musa nakamlonjela Hobabu mwana wa Leueli, mgosi wa heye Mmidiani, “Hetwe twangwaluka majendo kuluta honhu hawele Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga, ‘Ndowapani hemwe honhu aho.’ Lelo tulute hamwe, natwe tokuditila ganojile, mina Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga kotupa hetwe Waisilaeli utambichizo.” <verse eid="NUM 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30"/>Ila Hobabu nakalonga, “Heni hatuchiwinza na hemwe, ila ndohiluka kuli isi ya heni na kwa nhanzi ya heni.” <verse eid="NUM 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31"/>Musa nakamlonjela, “Ndangulanda uleche kutuleka, mina hegwe kuvizela honhu hotuweza kuwasa hagunuche, na koweza kutulongoza nzila. <verse eid="NUM 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32"/>Wone koluta hamwe na hetwe, choneche chinojile choyotuditila Mkulu Nguluwi, ndo chicho tokuditila na hegwe nagwe.”<verse eid="NUM 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Majendo gangwaluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33"/>Lelo wanhu nawaluka majendo kulawila Sinai, chidunda cha Mkulu Nguluwi, majendo ga mazuwa gadatu. Isanduku lya ilagano lya Mkulu Nguluwi naliwalongola leka kuwapalila honhu ha kuwasa. <verse eid="NUM 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34"/>Chila lowaluche majendo kulawa kowawichile kambi imwe mbaka iyage, ng'hungugu ya Mkulu Nguluwi nayali mchanya mwa hewo nemisi.<verse eid="NUM 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35"/>Chila mhela isanduku holyaluche majendo kuluta kumwando, Musa nakalonga, “Winuche, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, wang'honyo wa hegwe wasambaluche, na awo walingukuzudila wakubilime kulawa hali hegwe.” <verse eid="NUM 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36"/>Chila mhela vyolimile, Musa nakalonga, “Uwahiluchile, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, wano maelufu na maelufu ga Isilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 10:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11"/>
  <para style="s">Kung'ung'uta ako kuchiwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1"/>Wanhu nawaluka kumng'ung'utila Mkulu Nguluwi kwa gala magazo ga hewo. Mkulu Nguluwi navyoyahuliche, nayali yazudile, nakawahilichila chiluli. Chiluli acho nachali chikwaka hali hewo na kuwifya nzingo imwe ya yila kambi. <verse eid="NUM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2"/>Wanhu nawamlilila Musa, na heye nakamlanda Mkulu Nguluwi na chiluli acho nachizima. <verse eid="NUM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3"/>Lelo honhu aho hochemigwa Tabela, kwa vila acho chiluli cha Mkulu Nguluwi nachali chikwaka hali wanhu wamwe.<verse eid="NUM 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kanguhagula vilongozi makumi saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4"/>Hali Waisilaeli nakwali na chilundo chiyage chihanzile na hewo, nachali na maya lukami. Waisilaeli kwa mala iyage nawalila, wolonga. “Wone natwahawele na miwunde ja kulya! <verse eid="NUM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5"/>Twangukumbuchila somba zotudile kula Misili ne kugula, matango na mitikiti na mboga na vitunguu na vitunguu saumu. <verse eid="NUM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6"/>Ila sambi ludali lumala na kuduhu ndiya iyage ila ayi mana hela!”<verse eid="NUM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7"/>Mana nayali kota nyhule za uhemba, lanji yake nayali nzelu hado. <verse eid="NUM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8"/>Wanhu nawazunguluta zunguluta na kukungajiza, hamba nawazibalasa kwa maganga ga kubalasila ama kuzitwanga kwa ituli, hamba nawatogosa mchiya na kugongomanya mibumunda. Unojenoje wake nawali kota wa mibumunda jikalanjigwe kwa mafuta. <verse eid="NUM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9"/>Nhungwi vyoyigwile kuli kambi mhela wa nechilo, mana kahi nayigwa hamwe na ayo nhungwi.<verse eid="NUM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10"/>Musa nakahulika wanhu wolila kuli ng'holo zeng'ha, chila munhu hali lwizi lwa ihema lya heye. Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi nakazudila ng'hatu na heye Musa nakagaya mnhumbula ya heye. <verse eid="NUM 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11"/>Aho ndo Musa navyoyamlonjele Mkulu Nguluwi, “Lekachoni ulingunditila vibi heni chitumagwa wa hegwe? Lekachoni hambe umhe heni uganililo ila kumha heni itunyo lya kuwalolela wanhu weng'ha wano? <verse eid="NUM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12"/>Ndaze, ndo heni ndiwapondile, na kundonjela ndiwapape mmhambaga ya heni kota mamo yalingupapa chali cha heye na kuwegala mbaka kuli isi youwalahile kuwapa wasekulu wa hewo? <verse eid="NUM 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13"/>Ndopata kohi miunde ja kuwalisa wanhu awa weng'ha? Mina wangulila hali heni wolonga, ‘Utugalile miwunde tulye!’ <verse eid="NUM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14"/>Siweza hebu kuwalolela wanhu awa weng'ha ndiliyeka, alyo ndo itunyo likulu ng'hatu kwa heni. <verse eid="NUM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15"/>Wone iwe ahyo ndo vyoulingundita, fola ung'hopole hela. Wone mhegwe uganililo hali hegwe, lelo undavile magazo aga.”<verse eid="NUM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16"/>Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, “Muwakungajize wasekulu makumi saba wa Isilaeli, wawele hegwe kuwazela kota wangukundigwa na wanhu wawe vilongozi, uwegale kuli ihema lya Nguluwi, weme habehi na hegwe. <verse eid="NUM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17"/>Ndodulika ako na kulongasa na hegwe, ndohola honhu ha muhe wondikupele, ndiwape wanhu awo. Na hewo wopapa itunyo lya kuwalolela wanhu awo hamwe na hegwe, leka uleche kupapa itunyo alyo uliyeka. <verse eid="NUM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18"/>Lelo uwalonjele wanhu kota wewelize kwa vila hamitondo molya miwunde. Mkulu Nguluwi nakahulika mlila na kulonga kota haduhuli wa kuwapa miwunde, na kota hemwe namwali mulya vinojile ng'hatu lomwali Misili. Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi kowapani miwunde, na hemwe yanguwalapani mulye. <verse eid="NUM 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19"/>Molya miwunde haiwele kwa zuwa limwe hela ama mazuwa meli ama gahano ama kuli mazuwa makumi meli, <verse eid="NUM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20"/>ila kwa mhela wa mwezi umwe. Molya mbaka jowalawila kumhenyhelo na kujizudila. Geng'ha ago ndo kwa vila mumlema Mkulu Nguluwi yawele bahano hali hemwe, na kulila hali heye mlonga, ‘Lekachoni natulawa Misili?’ ”<verse eid="NUM 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21"/>Ila Musa nakamlonjela Mkulu Nguluwi, “Winji wa wanhu ndilinguwalongoza hano ndo lachi sita walingujenda kwa magulu, na hegwe kwangulonga, ‘Ndowapani miwunde ja kuhega mwezi weng'ha!’ <verse eid="NUM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22"/>Ndaze, kudumuligwa singo ing'holo na isenga johega? Ndaze, somba zeng'ha mbahali zilowigwe kwa chiwalo cha hewo?” <verse eid="NUM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamwidichila Musa, “Ndaze, ludali lwa heni lupunguka? Kokona lelo ulonzi wa heni wowa wa kukomya kwa hegwe ama hebu.”<verse eid="NUM 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24"/>Lelo Musa nakaluta na kuwalonjela wanhu gala goyalonjile Mkulu Nguluwi. Hamba, nakawakungajiza wasekulu makumi saba kulawila kuli wala wasekulu vilongozi wa hewo, nakawawika hafungo kuzunguluta ihema. <verse eid="NUM 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25"/>Aho, Mkulu Nguluwi nakadulika kuli ng'hungugu na kulongasa na heye. Hamba nakalavya honhu ha muhe wonayampele Musa, nakamha chila yumwe wa wala wasekulu makumi saba. Lowenjilwe na muhe awo, wasekulu awo nawaluka kulonga kota waloli, ila hawahiluchile kudita ahyo.<verse eid="NUM 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26"/>Wasekulu weli hali wala makumi saba wahaguligwe, Elidadi na Medadi, nawali waponile kuli kambi, wayawo nalowalutile kuli ihema. Muhe nauwoyela mumo kuli ihema, nawaluka kulonga kota waloli honhu howawele. <verse eid="NUM 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27"/>Msongolo yumwe nakalawa yobilima na kumlonjela Musa, “Elidadi na Medadi wangulonga kota waloli kuli kambi.” <verse eid="NUM 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28"/>Aho, Yoshua, mwana wa Nuni, nayawele yomtanza Musa kulawila usongolo wa heye, nakamlonjela Musa, “Mkulu wa heni, walemeze.” <verse eid="NUM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29"/>Ila Musa nakamlonjela, “Ndaze, kwangona fihi kwa chiwalo cha heni? Ila ndahaganile wone Mkulu Nguluwi nayawapele wanhu wa heye weng'ha muhe wa heye na hewo nawalonga kota waloli.” <verse eid="NUM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30"/>Hamba Musa nakahiluka kuli kambi hamwe na wala wasekulu wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi kanguhilika ng'wale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31"/>Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nekegala mbeho baho du, naigala ng'wale kulawa mbahali na kuwadita wagwe hafungo ha yila kambi, majendo ga zuwa imwe ahi chila ubanzi kuzunguluta kambi, nawelunda hasi habehi mita imwe ahi kuluta kuchanya. <verse eid="NUM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32"/>Lelo zuwa alyo lyeng'ha, na zuwa lilinguya wanhu nawakola mijito ja kukungajiza ng'wale, kuduhuli munhu yakungajize hasi ha kilo elufu imwe. Nawaziwika hali isanya chila honhu hafungo mwa kambi leka zikale. <verse eid="NUM 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33"/>Lokuwele kung'hali na miwunde kwa winji wanhu nawawele wang'hali kusinda kulya, Mkulu Nguluwi nakawazudila wanhu, nakawatowa kwa igayo ikulu ng'hatu. <verse eid="NUM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34"/>Ahyo honhu aho nahapegwa itagwa Kibuloti-hataava, kwa vila ako ndo kowawatilile wanhu wawele na maya lukami.<verse eid="NUM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35"/>Kulawila ako Kibuloti-hataava, wanhu nawaluka majendo mbaka Haseloti, nawawika kambi na kikala ako.<verse eid="NUM 11:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12"/>
  <para style="s">Miliamu kangugazigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1"/>Hamba Miliamu na Aluni nawaluka kumlonga vibi Musa kwa chiwalo cha mdala Mkushi yonayali yamhesile. <verse eid="NUM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2"/>Nawalonga, “Hambi Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga kwa kukolela Musa yaliyeka? Ndaze, halonjile kwa kukolela hetwe tweng'ha?” Mkulu Nguluwi nakahulika ulonzi awo. <verse eid="NUM 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3"/>Musa nayali munhu yaholondale lukami kusinda wanhu wanji wawele muisi. <verse eid="NUM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4"/>Baho du, Mkulu Nguluwi nakawalonjela Musa na Aluni na Miliamu, “Mlawe, muye hali ihema lya Nguluwi, hemwe wadatu.” Lelo weng'ha wadatu nawaluta kuli ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5"/>Aho Mkulu Nguluwi nakadulika kuli izengo lya ng'hungugu, nakema hali lwizi lwa ihema, nakawachema Aluni na Miliamu. Weng'ha weli nawahejela kumwando. <verse eid="NUM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6"/>Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakawalonjela, “Muhulichize ulonzi wa heni. Wone hana mloli hali hemwe, heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndizelesaga kwa heye kuli uloli na kulongasa na heye kuli kulota. <verse eid="NUM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7"/>Ila kwa chitumagwa wa heni Musa, haiwa ahyo kwa vila heye ndo wa kukundigwa kuli ng'handa ya heni yeng'ha. <verse eid="NUM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8"/>Heni ndangulonga na heye hazelu ne uviso. Heye kangumbona vyondili heni Mkulu Nguluwi. Lekachoni, lelo hamdumbile kumlonga vibi Musa, chitumagwa wa heni?”<verse eid="NUM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9"/>Aho Mkulu Nguluwi nayali na ng'halazi kwa chiwalo cha hewo, nakoka. <verse eid="NUM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10"/>Ng'hungugu vyoyuchile mchanya mwa ihema lya Nguluwi, Miliamu nakoneka kana utamwa wa ngozi wa lanji nzelu chwee. Aluni loyahinduche na kumlola Miliamu, nakabubuwala kona kota kana utamwa wa ngozi. <verse eid="NUM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11"/>Aho Aluni nakamlonjela Musa, “Gwa mkulu wa heni, uleche kutugaza kwa vila natudita mbuli ya chipoka na kudita gehile. <verse eid="NUM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12"/>Uleche kumdita Miliamu yawe kota mwana yapondigwe kuno yabagame, yawele nusu ya lukuli lwa heye lolile.” <verse eid="NUM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13"/>Musa nakamlilila Mkulu Nguluwi yolonga, “Ndangukulonjela, gwa Nguluwi, umlohole!” <verse eid="NUM 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14"/>Ila Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, “Hanji wone mhaza wa heye nayamtemele mite kumeho, ndaze, halingona soni kwa mazuwa saba? Lelo mlavye kunze mwa kambi yekale ako kwa mhela wa mazuwa saba, hamba komkundiza yahiluche kuli ihema.” <verse eid="NUM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15"/>Ahyo, Miliamu nakawinjigwa kunze mwa kambi kwa mhela wa mazuwa saba. Wanhu hawaluche kahi majendo mbaka Miliamu hoyahilulwe kahi kuli kambi. <verse eid="NUM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16"/>Hamba, wanhu nawaluka majendo kulawila Haseloti, nawawika kambi kuli chiwala ako Palani.<verse eid="NUM 12:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13"/>
  <para style="s">Wapugajizi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:19-33">Kukumbuchila 1:19-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2"/>“Uwalajize walume walute kuipugajiza isi ya Kanaani iwele yondiwapa wanhu wa Isilaeli. Komlajiza mlume yumwe kulawila chila nhanzi, yawele chilongozi kuli nhanzi ya heye.”<verse eid="NUM 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3"/>Lelo kwa chiwalo cha ilajizo lya Mkulu Nguluwi, Musa nakawatuma walume kulawila kuchiwala ako Palani. Walume weng'ha watumigwe nawali vilongozi wa nhanzi zilivinji za wanhu wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4"/>Aga ndo matagwa ga wanhu awo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 13:4">Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Lubeni, nayali Shamuwa mwana wa Sakuli.<verse eid="NUM 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5"/>Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Simeoni, nayali Shafati mwana wa Holi.<verse eid="NUM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6"/>Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Yuda, nayali Kalebu, mwana wa Yefune.<verse eid="NUM 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7"/>Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Isakali, nayali Igali mwana wa Yusufu.<verse eid="NUM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8"/>Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Efulaimu, nayali Hoshea mwana wa Nuni.<verse eid="NUM 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9"/>Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Benjamini, nayali Paliti mwana wa Lafu.<verse eid="NUM 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10"/>Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Sebuluni, nayali Gadieli mwana wa Sodi.<verse eid="NUM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11"/>Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Manase, iwele nailawile kuli nhanzi ya Yusufu, nayali Gadi mwana wa Susi.<verse eid="NUM 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12"/>Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Dani, nayali Amieli mwana wa Gemali.<verse eid="NUM 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13"/>Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Asheli, nayali Setuli mwana wa Mikaeli.<verse eid="NUM 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14"/>Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Nafutali, nayali Nabi mwana wa Wofusi.<verse eid="NUM 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15"/>Kulawa kuli nhanzi ya Gadi, nayali Geueli mwana wa Maki.<verse eid="NUM 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16"/>Ago ndo matagwa ga wanhu wawele Musa nakawalajiza kuluta kuipugajiza isi ya Kanaani. Musa nakamha Hoshea mwana wa Nuni itagwa linyale, nakamchema Yoshua.<verse eid="NUM 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17"/>Vyoyawalajize kuza kuipugajiza isi ya Kanaani, Musa nakawalonjela, “Mlute kula kumwambu Negebu, mbaka kuli isi ya vidunda, <verse eid="NUM 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18"/>mkailole isi vyoili. Mlole kahi wone wanhu walingikala amo ndo wawele na mong'ho ama ng'hochele ama wenji ama wado. <verse eid="NUM 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19"/>Mpugajize kota isi ayo inoga ama yiha, miji jowalingikala ndo kambi ama ndo ng'handa zizungulutwe na lukanzi. <verse eid="NUM 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20"/>Mpugajize kahi isi ayo kota ina lufufu ama yahela lufufu, ina migodi ama yahela. Muwe msindamala na vyomuhiluka muhole mafuza gamwe ga isi ayo.” Awo nawali mhela wa kwaluka kupya kwa zabibu.<verse eid="NUM 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21"/>Lelo wanhu awo nawaluta na kuipugajiza isi kulawila kuli chiwala ako Sini mbaka Lehobu, habehi na nzila ya kwinjilila Hamati. <verse eid="NUM 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22"/>Nawaluta mbaka Negebu nawakola mbaka muji wa Hebuloni. Amo nawawafika Waahimani na Washeshai na Watalimai, walelwa wa Anaki. Muji wa Hebuloni nawali uzenjigwe miyaka saba loung'hali kuzenjigwa muji wa Soani uwele muisi ya Misili. <verse eid="NUM 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23"/>Lowafichile kuli ibindi lya Eshikoli, wanhu awo nawadumula chizabala cha zabibu chiwele na mafuza menji na acho nachiholigwa na wanhu weli mzegamzega. Nawahola kahi makomamanga ganji na tini. <verse eid="NUM 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24"/>Honhu aho nahachemigwa ibindi lya Eshikoli kwa chiwalo cha chizabala cha zabibu chiwele wanhu awa wa Isilaeli nawachihola kulawila honhu aho.<verse eid="NUM 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25"/>Lowasindile kuipugajiza isi kwa mhela wa mazuwa makumi gane, wanhu awo nawahiluka. <verse eid="NUM 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26"/>Nawawalutila Musa na Aluni na Waisilaeli weng'ha ako Kadeshi, kuli chiwala ako Palani, nawalonga mbuli zowaziwene na kuwalajila mafuza ga isi. <verse eid="NUM 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27"/>Nawamlonjela Musa, “Natufika isi youtulajize tuipugajize, ayo ndo isi iwele na mboto, na ali ndo ifuza lyake. <verse eid="NUM 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28"/>Ila wenyeng'haye wa isi ayo ndo wawele na mong'ho lukami, na miji ja hewo ndo mikulu ng'hatu na jina lukanzi lukulu. Natuwona kuko kahi walelwa wa Anaki, wawele ng'wemang'wema lukami. <verse eid="NUM 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29"/>Waamaleki wangikala kuli honhu ha Negebu, Wahiti na Wayebusi na Waamoli wangikala kuli honhu ha vidunda, na Wakanaani wangikala habehi na bahali ya Mediteleniyani na habehi na hafungo ha lwanda lwa Yolodani.”<verse eid="NUM 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30"/>Ila Kalebu nakawadita wanhu wenyamalile tulu hali Musa, nakalonga, “Tuche himahima tukaihole isi ayo. Kwa vila twanalo ludali lwa kuhega ng'hatu kwa kuwasumya.” <verse eid="NUM 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31"/>Ila wanhu wowawele welongoze na heye kuipugajiza isi nawalonga, “Hatuweza kitowa na wanhu awo, hewo wana mong'ho lukami kusinda hetwe.” <verse eid="NUM 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32"/>Ahyo naweneza mbuli zihile hali Waisilaeli kuwala isi yowaipugajize, wolonga, “Isi ayo yotuipugajize yanguwakopola wanhu wake. Kahi wanhu weng'ha wotuwawene ako ndo wang'wemang'wema ng'hatu. <verse eid="NUM 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33"/>Ako natuwona wanhu wawele ng'wemang'wema, walelwa wa Anaki. Hetwe natiwona kota ndede hali hewo, hanji hihyo du vyowatuwene hetwe.”<verse eid="NUM 13:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14"/>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wangung'ung'uta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1"/>Waisilaeli weng'ha nawaluka kulila ng'hatu, wanhu nawalila nechilo yila. <verse eid="NUM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2"/>Waisilaeli weng'ha nawawang'ung'utila Musa na Aluni kuno wolonga, “Fola natwahabagame Misili. Fola natwahabagame bahano kuchiwala. <verse eid="NUM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3"/>Lekachoni Mkulu Nguluwi kangutuhilika kuli isi ayo? Tobagama kuli ngondo, na wadala wa hetwe na wana wa hetwe woholigwa na wang'honyo wa hetwe. Fola tuhiluche Misili!” <verse eid="NUM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4"/>Lelo nawaluka kilonjela wawo, “Tuhagule chilongozi na tuhiluche ako Misili.”<verse eid="NUM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5"/>Lelo Musa na Aluni nawagwa chifunama hali Waisilaeli weng'ha. <verse eid="NUM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6"/>Yoshua mwana wa Nuni na Kalebu mwana wa Yefune, nawawele hali wala wanhu wowalutile kuipugajiza isi ayo, nawadega mivalo ja hewo kwa masinzo <verse eid="NUM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7"/>na kuwalonjela Waisilaeli weng'ha, “Isi yotulutile kuipugajiza ndo inoga lukami. <verse eid="NUM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8"/>Wone Mkulu Nguluwi nakanojezwa na hetwe, kotuhilika ako na kotukundiza kikala kuli isi iwele na mboto. <verse eid="NUM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9"/>Ila mleche kumhinduka Mkulu Nguluwi ne kuwadumba wenyeng'haye wa isi ayo. Kwa vila hewo ndo chinhu chido hela kwa hetwe, hawokwamilwa hebu, na heye Mkulu Nguluwi ka hamwe na hetwe, mleche kuwadumba.” <verse eid="NUM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10"/>Ila Waisilaeli weng'ha nawagana kujeza kuwatowa na maganga. Baho du, ukulu wa Mkulu Nguluwi naulawila mchanya mwa ihema lya Nguluwi, hali Waisilaeli weng'ha.<verse eid="NUM 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kanguwalandila wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11"/>Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, “Wanhu wano wombeza mbaka nili? Na woleka kung'hunda heni mbaka nili, hanga ndita vinduzanduza hali hewo? <verse eid="NUM 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12"/>Ndowagaza kwa matamwa gehile na hawowa wanhu wa heni, ila ndokudita uwe nhanzi yinji ng'hulu, iwele na mong'ho kusinda weng'ha.”<verse eid="NUM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13"/>Ila Musa nakamlonjela Mkulu Nguluwi, “Aho ndo Wamisili wohulika mbuli ayo kota hegwe nakuwegala wanhu wa hegwe kwa ludali lwa hegwe hali hewo, <verse eid="NUM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14"/>wowalonjela wanhu wa isi ayi. Mina wanhu wano nawahulika kota hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa hamwe na hetwe, mina hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwangoneka hazelu hala ng'hungugu ya hegwe hoyikwima mchanya mwa hetwe, na kota hegwe kulongolaga nemisi kwa izengo lya ng'hungugu na nechilo kwa izengo lya chiluli. <verse eid="NUM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15"/>Lelo wone uwakopole wanhu wa hegwe weng'ha kwa mhela umwe, isi ziwele nazihulika lutogo lwa hegwe zolonga, <verse eid="NUM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16"/>‘Mkulu Nguluwi nakawakopola wanhu wa heye kula kuchiwala kwa vila nakalemwela kuwahilika kuli isi yoyelahile kota kowapa.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17"/>Lelo ndangukudedeza, Mkulu, utulajile ludali lwa hegwe kwa kudita kota navyoulagane na hetwe vila vyoulonjile, <verse eid="NUM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18"/>‘Heni Mkulu Nguluwi silinguzudila himahima, ndo yawele na igano lya kwimilila, na ndangulechela wihe na nongwa. Ila sileka hebu kuwagaza wawele na nongwa, wana na wazukulu wa wehile mbaka lulelo lwa kadatu na lwa kane kwa gehile ga wahaza wa hewo.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19"/>Ndangukudedeza uwalechele gehile ga wanhu wano, kwa igano lya hegwe lya kwimilila kota navyouwalechele kulawa vyowalawile Misili mbaka sambi.”<verse eid="NUM 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakedichila, “Nandiwalechela kota vyoulandile. <verse eid="NUM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21"/>Ila ndangukomya, kota vyombele mkomu na kota isi yeng'ha hoimema ukulu wa heni Mkulu Nguluwi, <verse eid="NUM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22"/>haduhu ne yumwe wa hewo yawezile kuwona ukulu wa heni na vinduzanduza vya heni vyonditile Misili na kuchiwala hamba yolutilila kunjeza mala azi zeng'ha ne kuhulichiza lizi lya heni, <verse eid="NUM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23"/>koyona isi yila yondiwalahile wasekulu wa hewo. Na kahi wala walingumbeza heni kahi hawoyona. <verse eid="NUM 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24"/>Ila kwa vila chitumagwa wa heni Kalebu ka vinji, na nakanyhulichiza vinojile, ndomfichiza kuli isi ayo na yenjile na walelwa wa heye woihalila isi ayo. <verse eid="NUM 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25"/>Kwa vila Waamaleki na Wakanaani wangikala kuli ibindi lya isi ayo, mitondo mgaluche kumbele mlute kuchiwala kukolela nzila ya hafungo mwa Bahali ya Shamu.”<verse eid="NUM 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26"/>Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakawauza Musa na Aluni, <verse eid="NUM 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27"/>“Waisilaeli weng'ha wehile wolutilila kung'ung'utila heni mbaka nili? Nhoka na kung'ung'utilwa na Waisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28"/>Lelo wedichile ahi. Kota vyondili mkomu, ndangulonga heni Mkulu Nguluwi, ndowaditila gagala gondihuliche mlonga. <verse eid="NUM 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29"/>Mobagama na mitufi ja hemwe jotozigwa mumu kuchiwala. Kwa vila na mng'ung'utila heni, haduhu ne yumwe yawazigwe hali hemwe yawele na miyaka kwaluchila miyaka makumi meli na kulutilila, <verse eid="NUM 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30"/>yokwinjila kuli isi ayo yondilahile kota mochikala ako, ila Kalebu mwana wa Yefune na Yoshua mwana wa Nuni. <verse eid="NUM 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31"/>Hemwe namlonga kota wana wa hemwe woholigwa kuli upogozi, ila heni ndowahilika wana wa hemwe kuli isi yomuibezile, leka waizele na hawe haluga hawo. <verse eid="NUM 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32"/>Ila hemwe mobagama mumu kuchiwala. <verse eid="NUM 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33"/>Wana wa hemwe wowa wadimi na kugazika amu kuchiwala kwa mhela wa miyaka makumi gane kwa chiwalo cha hemwe kuleka kukunda mbaka munhu wa hemwe wa mwiso hoyobagama kuchiwala. <verse eid="NUM 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34"/>Kwa chiwalo cha nongwa za hemwe, mogazika kwa mhela wa miyaka makumi gane, kota gala mazuwa makumi gane gompugajize isi yila, mwaka umwe kwa chila zuwa limwe, movizela kota heni nzudila. <verse eid="NUM 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35"/>Heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndonga. Ndangukomya, ndowadita hihyo Waisilaeli weng'ha wating'hane hano kundeuza. Kuli chiwala achi, wobagama weng'ha.”<verse eid="NUM 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36"/>Wala wanhu wawele Musa yawalajize kuza kuipugajiza isi yila, wawele wahiluche na kwambuza Waisilaeli weng'ha wamng'ung'utile Mkulu Nguluwi kwa kigala mbuli yihile ilinguwala isi, <verse eid="NUM 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37"/>nawabagama kwa igayo hali Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38"/>Ila Yoshua mwana wa Nuni na Kalebu mwana wa Yefune, nawapona wawele wakomu hali wala wanhu wowalutile kuipugajiza isi.<verse eid="NUM 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kujeza kwa mwaluko kuivaba isi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:41-46">Kukumbuchila 1:41-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39"/>Na heye Musa nakawalonjela Waisilaeli weng'ha na hewo nawamlilila kwa usungu lukami. <verse eid="NUM 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40"/>Nawalilimka lufuku, nawaluta kuli chinhembenhembe cha isi ya vidunda, wolonga, “Tukomya kota natudita gehile. Lelo twa goya ng'hatu kuza honhu hawele Mkulu Nguluwi nayalagane na hetwe.”<verse eid="NUM 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41"/>Ila Musa nakalonga, “Lelo lekachoni mwangubena ilajizo lya Mkulu Nguluwi? Ahyo hamsinda hebu! <verse eid="NUM 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42"/>Mleche kuka ako kuchidunda leka mleche kutowigwa na wang'honyo wa hemwe, mina Mkulu Nguluwi kahaduhu hali hemwe. <verse eid="NUM 14:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43"/>Homchitowa na Waamaleki na Wakanaani, mobagama kuli ngondo, kwa vila namleka kumuwinza Mkulu Nguluwi, heye nahawele hamwe na hemwe.”<verse eid="NUM 14:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44"/>Lelo hewo nawaluta kuli isi ya vidunda, ila isanduku lya ilagano lya Mkulu Nguluwi na hambe lilawe kuli kambi, ne Musa nahochile kuli kambi. <verse eid="NUM 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45"/>Ahyo Waamaleki na Wakanaani, nawawele wochikala kuli isi ayo ya vidunda, nawadulika, nawawatowa na kuwasumya. Nawawawinga mbaka kuli muji wa Holima.<verse eid="NUM 14:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15"/>
  <para style="s">Malajizo ga kuwala nhambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2"/>“Walonjele Waisilaeli kota lomfika kuli isi yondilinguwapa iwele mochikala, <verse eid="NUM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3"/>mondavila nhambiko heni Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiluli kulawa kuli migongolo ja hemwe, nhambiko ya kulakazwa ama nhambiko yinji, leka munhu yetawize kilaha kwa heye nakoyalahile ama kulavya nhambiko ya kunuwila kwa heye ama nhambiko ya mnvina za hemwe kuli mhela uwichigwe, na kudita unhunyhililo unojile wa kunojeza heni Mkulu Nguluwi, <verse eid="NUM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4"/>lelo, yula yalingulavya nhambiko ya heye, komigalila kahi Mkulu Nguluwi nhambiko ya nyhule ya kilo imwe ya utimbo unojile na uhanzigwe na lita imwe ya mafuta, <verse eid="NUM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5"/>hamwe na divai ya nhambiko ya chakunwa, lita imwe na vinhu vyowa hamwe na chila ing'holo lyana lya nhambiko ya kulakazwa ama nhambiko yinji. <verse eid="NUM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6"/>Mhela wa kulavya nhambiko ya ing'holo ilume, kilo mbili za utimbo unojile na lita imwe na nusu ya mafuta vyolavigwa kota nhambiko ya nyhule, <verse eid="NUM 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7"/>hamwe na nhambiko ya chakunwa lita imwe na nusu ya divai na kudita kunhunyhilila kunojile kwa nhambiko, kumnojeza Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8"/>Mhela lomumlavila Mkulu Nguluwi ilogota ilume kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kulakazwa ama nhambiko yinji leka kutawiza chilaho ama kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko za kikala goya, <verse eid="NUM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9"/>hamwe na ibuguma, munhu ayo kolavya nhambiko ya nyhule ya utimbo unojile wa kilo zidatu na lita mbili za mafuta, <verse eid="NUM 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10"/>hamwe na nhambiko ya chakunwa lita mbili za divai na kudita kunhunyhilila kunojile kwa nhambiko yalingulavilwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiluli.<verse eid="NUM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11"/>“Kodita kota ahi kwa chila ibuguma ama ing'holo ilume na ing'holo lyana ilume ama chinyehe. <verse eid="NUM 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12"/>Udite hino kwa chila chimwe kota vyovilingulavigwa. <verse eid="NUM 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13"/>Chila munhu Muisilaeli kowinza malajizo ago mhela hoyolavya nhambiko yalingulavilwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiluli, kunhunyhilila kulingumnojeza Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14"/>Wone hana mjenzi yoneche yalingikala hamwe na hemwe kwa mhela ama kwa mazuwa gose, hoyogana kulavya nhambiko ya heye kwa chiluli, kunhunyhilila kumnojeze Mkulu Nguluwi, munhu ayo kodita kota vyomlingudita hemwe. <verse eid="NUM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15"/>Kuli lulelo lweng'ha lulinguya, malajizo gagala gomlinguwinza, ndo gago goyalinguganigwa kuwinza mjenzi yoneche yalingikala na hemwe na Waisilaeli weng'ha mazuwa gose, hali Mkulu Nguluwi mowa chinhu chimwe, <verse eid="NUM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16"/>hemwe na heye mowa hali malajizo gagala.”<verse eid="NUM 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18"/>“Walonjele Waisilaeli kota homkwinjila kuli isi yondilinguwahilika, <verse eid="NUM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19"/>chila homulya chilyo cha isi ayo, mobagula chasi chimwenga na kumha heni Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20"/>Homteleka mibumunda ja utimbo wa mwaluko, jolavigwa kota ndolendole kulawa kuli honhu ha kuyugululila nyhule. <verse eid="NUM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21"/>Mondavila heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndolendole ayi ya mibumunda ja nyhule za mwaluko kuli lulelo lwa hemwe lweng'ha lulinguya.<verse eid="NUM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22"/>“Ila wone moleka kuwinza mizilo ajo jeng'ha ne kunuwila, jiwele heni Mkulu Nguluwi jondiwapele hemwe kwa kukolela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23"/>na wone kuli mazuwa galinguya walelwa wa hemwe woleka kuwinza geng'ha gawele heni Mkulu Nguluwi gondimlajize Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24"/>lelo nongwa ayo yowa naiditigwa ne kunuwila na ne nhanzi ya wanhu kuvizela, Waisilaeli weng'ha wolavya ilogota ilume leka liwe nhambiko ya kulakazwa, kunhunyhilila kunojile kwa kumnojeza Mkulu Nguluwi, hamwe na nhambiko ya heye ya nyhule na ya chakunwa kota malajizo ga heye vyogalingulonga. Hihyo du wanhu wolavya ipongo limwe liwe nhambiko ya gehile. <verse eid="NUM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25"/>Mtambika kodita uhanyisi kwa chiwalo cha Waisilaeli weng'ha, na hewo wolechelwa kwa vila haiwele nongwa iditigwe kwa kunuwila, na wegala nhambiko ya hewo, nhambiko yalingulavilwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiluli, kota nhambiko na nhambiko ya gehile kwa chiwalo cha nongwa ya hewo. <verse eid="NUM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26"/>Waisilaeli weng'ha hamwe na wajenzi wowalingikala na hewo, wolechelwa kwa vila weng'ha nawali kuli nongwa ayo.<verse eid="NUM 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27"/>“Wone munhu yumwe yodita gehile ne kunuwila, kolavya mhene ndala ya mwaka umwe leka iwe nhambiko ya gehile. <verse eid="NUM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28"/>Mtambika kodita uhanyisi hali Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa chiwalo cha ayo munhu yaditile gehile ne kunuwila, na heye kulechelwa nongwa ya heye. <verse eid="NUM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29"/>Mowinza ilajizo lilyo limwe kwa chila munhu wone yodita gehile ne kunuwila, yawe mwenyeng'haye Muisilaeli ama mjenzi yalingikala hamwe na hemwe.<verse eid="NUM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30"/>“Ila munhu yoneche yodita gehile kwa kunuwila yuye, kangumbeza Mkulu Nguluwi, yawe mwenyeng'haye ama mjenzi, kanguganigwa yabaguligwe kutali na wanhu wa heye. <verse eid="NUM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31"/>Mina nakalema gala goyalonjile Mkulu Nguluwi na kubena mizilo jake. Munhu ayo kobaguligwa kutali ng'hatu, na kogazigwa kwa chiwalo cha nongwa ya heye.”<verse eid="NUM 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Magazo kwa chiwalo cha kubena ilajizo lya Zuwa lya Kwesela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32"/>Zuwa limwe Waisilaeli lowawele kuchiwala, nawamona munhu yumwe yolokota ngodi kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela. <verse eid="NUM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33"/>Lelo munhu ayo nakegaligwa hali Musa na Aluni na Waisilaeli weng'ha. <verse eid="NUM 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34"/>Hewo nawamuwika hali wamizi kwa vila nahailonjigwe hazelu ndaze vyoyalinguganigwa kuditilwa munhu kota ayo. <verse eid="NUM 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35"/>Ahyo, Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, “Munhu ayo imgana yabagame, Waisilaeli weng'ha womtowa kwa maganga hanze ha kambi.” <verse eid="NUM 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36"/>Lelo Waisilaeli weng'ha nawamlavya hanze ha kambi, nawamtowa kwa maganga mbaka nakabagama, kota Mkulu Nguluwi navyoyamlajize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Usabuli kuli lupembo lwa nguwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37"/>Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38"/>“Walonjele wanhu wa Isilaeli, uwalajize weditile usabuli kuli lupembo lwa nguwo za hewo, na kuwika ng'weso za buluu mchanya mwa chila usabuli. Walonjele wadite ahyo kuli chila lulelo lwawo lweng'ha. <verse eid="NUM 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39"/>Usabuli awo wowa chinhu cha kukumbuchila kwa hemwe. Chila homuwona, mokumbuchila mizilo jeng'ha ja heni Mkulu Nguluwi na kujiwinza leka mleche kuwinza maya ga meho na nhumbula za hemwe gomzowele kugadita, kota ung'hondwa. <verse eid="NUM 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40"/>Usabuli awo wowakumbusa mizilo ja heni jeng'ha na mojiwinza jeng'ha ne kuleka, namwe mowa welile kwa heni Nguluwi wa hemwe. <verse eid="NUM 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41"/>Heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe, ndiwalavile hemwe kulawa isi ya Misili ndiwe Nguluwi wa hemwe. Heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe.”<verse eid="NUM 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16"/>
  <para style="s">Kuhinduka kwa Kola na Datani na Abilamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1"/>Hamba Kola mwana wa Ishali, mwana wa Kohati, mwana wa Lawi, nakawahola wanhu hamwe na wanhu wadatu wa lukolo lwa Lubeni, Datani na Abilamu, mwana wa Eliabu na Oni, mwana wa Peleti, <verse eid="NUM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2"/>awo weng'ha nawelumbile na vilongozi wang'hangala miya mbili na makumi gahano wahaguligwe na Waisilaeli weng'ha, nawamlema Musa. <verse eid="NUM 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3"/>Nawekungajiza hali Musa na Aluni, wawalonjela, “Hemwe ihega! Wanhu weng'ha ndo welile na chila munhu kuli Waisilaeli weng'ha wano ndo welile, na Mkulu Nguluwi kahamwe na hetwe. Lelo lekachoni mwangidita mwa wang'hangala wa wanhu wa Mkulu Nguluwi?”<verse eid="NUM 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4"/>Musa loyahuliche ago, naketoza hanyi chifunama. <verse eid="NUM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5"/>Hamba nakamlonjela Kola na wanhu weng'ha walingumuwinza heye, “Mitondo, Mkulu Nguluwi kolajila yalihi yawele wa heye na yalihi yawele yelile, na heye yomhagula. Munhu yohaguligwa kohejezwa habehi na Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6"/>Lelo mdite ahi. Hegwe na wanhu weng'ha walingukuwinza hegwe, mohola vifunyizi, <verse eid="NUM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7"/>muwiche chiluli na ubani mgati, hamba movihilika hali Mkulu Nguluwi. Hamba tokona yalihi yahaguligwe na Mkulu Nguluwi kowa yelile. Hemwe Walawi ihega!”<verse eid="NUM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8"/>Musa nakalutilila kumlonjela Kola, “Mhulichize, hemwe Walawi. <verse eid="NUM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9"/>Ndaze, mwangona ndo mbuli nyindo kwa hemwe kota Nguluwi wa Isilaeli nakawabagula hemwe hali Waisilaeli weng'ha, leka muwe habehi na heye, mkole mijito kuli ihema lya Mkulu Nguluwi na kukola mijito na kuwakolela mijito Waisilaeli weng'ha? <verse eid="NUM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10"/>Nakawapa mijito ja chiuyeng'ha habehi na heye, hemwe hamwe na Walawi wang'holozenu weng'ha. Lelo mwangugana kuhola na utambika kahi? <verse eid="NUM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11"/>Ahyo hegwe na wanhu weng'ha mwangumbelenhuka Mkulu Nguluwi. Hemwe mlingumng'ung'utila Aluni, ila ndangukomya kota mwangumng'ung'utila Nguluwi.”<verse eid="NUM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12"/>Musa nakalajiza usenga kwa Datani na Abilamu wana wa Eliabu leka wachemigwe, ila hewo nawalonga, “Hatukuya hebu! <verse eid="NUM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13"/>Ndaze, ndo mbuli nyindo kota kutulavya Misili, isi iwele na mboto, leka uye utukopole aku kuchiwala? Kahi, kwangidita kota kwa mng'hangala wa hetwe! <verse eid="NUM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14"/>Mzidi wa ago, hambe utugale kuli isi iwele na mboto, na kahi hambe utugalile uhalizi wa migunda na migunda ja mizabibu. Vyoulingijesa koweza kutuhada? Hatukuya hebu!”<verse eid="NUM 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15"/>Musa nakazudila ng'hatu, nakamlonjela Mkulu Nguluwi “Uleche kukunda nhambiko za wanhu wano. Heni siholile idogowi lya munhu yoneche, ne kumlumiza munhu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16"/>Musa nakamlonjela Kola, “Mitondo uye na wanhu weng'ha walingukuwinza hegwe hali Mkulu Nguluwi. Aluni naye kowa baha. <verse eid="NUM 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17"/>Chila yumwe wa hemwe yahole chifunyizi cha heye, na kuwika ubani, hamba kochihilika hali Mkulu Nguluwi, vifunyizi avyo vyowa miya mbili na makumi gahano, hegwe nagwe na Aluni, chila yumwe kowa na chifunyizi cha heye.”<verse eid="NUM 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18"/>Lelo chila yumwe wa hewo nakahola chifunyizi cha heye, nakawika chiluli na ubani, hamba nawaluta kwima hali lwizi lwa ihema lya Nguluwi, hamwe na Musa na Aluni. <verse eid="NUM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19"/>Na heye Kola nakawakungajiza wanhu weng'ha hamwe, nawawabelenhuka Musa na Aluni, nawema hali Musa na Aluni hali lwizi lwa ihema lya Nguluwi. Ndo ukulu wa Mkulu Nguluwi naulawila hali Waisilaeli weng'ha. <verse eid="NUM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20"/>Aho Mkulu Nguluwi nakawalonjela Musa na Aluni, <verse eid="NUM 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21"/>“Mibagule na Waisilaeli weng'ha wano, leka ndiwadumye sambi baha.”<verse eid="NUM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22"/>Ila Musa na Aluni nawetoza hanyi chifunama kuno wolonga, “Hegwe Nguluwi, Nguluwi uwapele ukomu wanhu weng'ha. Ndaze, wone munhu yumwe nakadita gehile, kowazudila Waisilaeli weng'ha?” <verse eid="NUM 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24"/>“Walonjele Waisilaeli weng'ha woche habehi na mihema ja Kola na Datani na Abilamu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25"/>Lelo Musa nakaluta kwa Datani na Abilamu, yowinzigwa na wasekulu wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26"/>Loyafichile, nakawalonjela Waisilaeli weng'ha, “Dedede, muche hali ihema lya wanhu wawele na wihe na mleche kudoliza chinhu cha hewo choneche, wone muye modumigwa hamwe na hewo kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga hewo geng'ha.” <verse eid="NUM 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27"/>Wanhu nawoka kuli mihema ja Kola na Datani na Abilamu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:27">Datani na Abilamu nawalawa kuli mihema ja hewo na kwima hali lwizi lwa mihema ja hewo wawele na wachewawo na wana wa hewo weng'ha mbaka wala walingong'a. <verse eid="NUM 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28"/>Aho Musa nakawalonjela wanhu, “Ahyo ndo vyomvizela kota Mkulu Nguluwi ndo yandajize kudita mbuli ayi yeng'ha, na haiwele kwa kunuwila kwa heni. <verse eid="NUM 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29"/>Wone wanhu wano wobagama kota wanhu wanji weng'ha, ne kugazigwa na Mkulu Nguluwi, lelo mvizele kota Mkulu Nguluwi handajize. <verse eid="NUM 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30"/>Ila wone Mkulu Nguluwi yadite mbuli iwele hainaditigwa, misanga jigubuche na kumela wanhu awa hamwe na chila chinhu cha hewo, walute kuli isi ya wabagame wawele wakomu, lelo movizela kota wanhu wano nawambeza Mkulu Nguluwi.”<verse eid="NUM 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31"/>Baho du vyoyasindile kulonga mbuli ayo yeng'ha, hasi howemile Datani na Abilamu nahagubuka <verse eid="NUM 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32"/>na kuwamela wanhu awo na wanhu wa ivyazi lya hewo, hamwe na wanhu weng'ha walinguwawinza Kola na lufufu lwa hewo lweng'ha. <verse eid="NUM 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33"/>Lelo hewo hamwe na vyeng'ha viwele vya hewo nawadulika kuli isi ya wabagame kuno wawele wang'hali wakomu. Misanga najiwagubika, wanhu weng'ha nawabagama. <verse eid="NUM 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34"/>Waisilaeli wawele habehi vyowahuliche wala walingudulika vyowotowa iyowe, nawadwina wolonga, “Tubilime, leka misanga jileche kutumela na hetwe natwe.”<verse eid="NUM 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35"/>Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakahilika chiluli nakawalakaza wala wanhu miya mbili na makumi gahano walutile kufunyiza ubani.<verse eid="NUM 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vifunyizi vyelile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36"/>Vyogapulute ago, Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37"/>“Mlonjele Eleasali mwana wa mtambika Aluni yavilavye avyo vifunyizi hali chiluli, yakabohole kutali chiluli chiwele mgati, mina vifunyizi avyo ndo vyelile. <verse eid="NUM 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38"/>Naviwa vyelile kwa vila wanhu awa nawavigala hali honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ha Mkulu Nguluwi. Lelo vihole vifunyizi vya wanhu awo wabagame kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga hewo, vipondigwe na viwe vizisili leka viwe chigubiko cha honhu ha kulavila nhambiko. Ali ndo nalyali ikanyo kwa Waisilaeli weng'ha.” <verse eid="NUM 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39"/>Lelo mtambika Eleasali nakahola vifunyizi avyo vya shaba kulawa kwa wala wanhu walakazwe, nakaviponda na viwa chigubiko cha honhu ha kulavila nhambiko. <verse eid="NUM 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40"/>Ali nalyali ikanyo kwa Waisilaeli weng'ha kota munhu yoneche yohawele mtambika, mina hawele wa lukolo lwa Aluni, yaleche kuluta honhu ha kulavila nhambiko na kumfunyizila Mkulu Nguluwi ubani. Wone yoluta kobagama kota Kola na walingumuwinza heye. Aga geng'ha nagaditigwa kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Eleasali kwa kukolela Musa.<verse eid="NUM 16:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aluni kanguwalohola wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41"/>Hamitondo, Waisilaeli weng'ha nawawang'ung'utila Musa na Aluni kuno wolonga, “Muwakopola wanhu wa Mkulu Nguluwi.” <verse eid="NUM 16:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:42"/>Waisilaeli weng'ha vyowekungajize hali Musa na Aluni leka walavye kung'ung'uta kwa hewo, nawagaluchila ihema lya Nguluwi, nawona ng'hungugu igubiche ihema lya Nguluwi na ukulu wa Mkulu Nguluwi nawali ulawile aho. <verse eid="NUM 16:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43"/>Musa na Aluni nawaluta, nawema hali ihema lya Nguluwi, <verse eid="NUM 16:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44"/>na Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45"/>“Wibagule na Waisilaeli weng'ha wano, leka ndiwakopole sambi baha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:45">Ila hewo nawetoza hanyi chifunama. <verse eid="NUM 16:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46"/>Musa nakamlonjela Aluni, “Uhole chifunyizi cha hegwe, uwiche chiluli kulawa kuli honhu ha kulavila nhambiko, hamba uwiche ubani na kahi ulute nacho himahima kuli Waisilaeli weng'ha kuwaditila uhanyisi. Kuzudila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi mina nakuwafichila na igayo nalyaluka kuwagaza.” <verse eid="NUM 16:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47"/>Lelo Aluni nakadita kota vyoyalajizwe na Musa. Nakahola chifunyizi cha heye na kubilima mbaka hagati ha wanhu wawele wekungajize hamwe. Vyoyawene kota igayo mina nalyaluka, nakawika ubani mli chifunyizi na kuwaditila uhanyisi wanhu weng'ha. <verse eid="NUM 16:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:48"/>Navyoyaditile ahyo, igayo alyo nalileka, na heye nakasigala hagati kwa wala wabagame na wawele wakomu. <verse eid="NUM 16:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49"/>Wanhu wabagame kwa igayo alyo nawali elufu kumi na gane na miya saba (14,700), ne kuwawaza wala nawabagame kwa chiwalo cha kuhinduka kwa Kola. <verse eid="NUM 16:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50"/>Vyolimalile igayo alyo, Aluni nakahiluka kwa Musa hali lwizi lwa ihema lya Nguluwi.<verse eid="NUM 16:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17"/>
  <para style="s">Ng'weku ya Aluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1"/>Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2"/>“Walonjele Waisilaeli wakigalile ng'hweku kumi na mbili, chilongozi yumwe wa chila nhanzi, ng'hweku imwe. Wandiche itagwa lya chila yumwe wa hewo kuli ng'hweku ya heye, <verse eid="NUM 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3"/>na itagwa lya Aluni wandiche mchanya mwa ng'hweku ya nhanzi ya Lawi. Howa na ng'hweku imwe kwa chila chilongozi wa nhanzi. <verse eid="NUM 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4"/>Zihiliche ng'hweku azo kuli ihema lya Nguluwi na kuziwika hali isanduku lya ilagano, honhu hawele heni nditing'hanaga na hegwe. <verse eid="NUM 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5"/>Ng'weku ya munhu yondimhagula yozuka. Kwa nzila ayi, kung'ung'uta kwa Waisilaeli kwa chiwalo cha hemwe, ndokudita kumale.”<verse eid="NUM 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6"/>Musa nakadawala na wanhu wa Isilaeli. Vilongozi wa hewo weng'ha nawamha chila yumwe ng'hweku ya heye kota vyoiwele nhanzi ya heye, ahyo nazali ng'hweku kumi na mbili, na ng'hweku ya Aluni nayali hali azo. <verse eid="NUM 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7"/>Musa nakaziwika ng'hweku azo hali Mkulu Nguluwi kuli ihema lya Nguluwi.<verse eid="NUM 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8"/>Hamitondo kung'hali lufuku, Musa nakaluta kuli ihema lya Nguluwi. Amo, nakaifika ng'hweku ya Aluni wa nhanzi ya Lawi, izuka na kulavya mitumba jibahule uluwa na kulela mafunza gapile ga igodi lilinguchemigwa mlozi. <verse eid="NUM 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9"/>Hamba Musa nakazilavya ng'hweku zeng'ha aho, kulawila hali Mkulu Nguluwi, nakawalajila Waisilaeli weng'ha, na chila chilongozi nakahola ng'hweku ya heye yuye. <verse eid="NUM 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, “Ihilule ng'hweku ya Aluni hali isanduku lya ilagano. Ayo yowichigwa goya honhu aho, na ndo chinhu cha kukanya kwa wala wahinduche wone hawalechile kung'ung'uta, wobagama.” <verse eid="NUM 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11"/>Musa kadita kota vyoyalajizwe na Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="NUM 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12"/>Waisilaeli nawamlonjela Musa, “Ulole lelo! Twangubagama! Tumala! Weng'ha tumala. <verse eid="NUM 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13"/>Chila munhu yolihejelela ihema lya Nguluwi, kobagama. Ndaze, tobagama tweng'ha?”<verse eid="NUM 17:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18"/>
  <para style="s">Mijito ja watambika na Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1"/>Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Aluni, “Nongwa zeng'ha zilinguwala mijito ja ihema lya Nguluwi, zowa za hegwe na wanago na lukolo lwa hegwe lwa Kohati, na nongwa zeng'ha zilinguwala utambika zowa za hegwe gwegwe na wanago. <verse eid="NUM 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2"/>Hegwe na wang'holozo, nhanzi ya Walawi, nhanzi ya mhaza wa hegwe, uwegale behi na hegwe leka welumbe na hegwe na kukola mijito kota watambika, ila hegwe na wanago mowa hali ihema lya Nguluwi lya ulolezi. <verse eid="NUM 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3"/>Awo wokola mijito jowopegwa kulawa kwa hegwe na kweneza gowalonjelwe hewo galingulapa ihema lya Nguluwi. Ila hambe wakundizwe kuvihejelela vinhu vya ihema lya Nguluwi na waleche kuhahejelela honhu ha kulavila nhambiko, leka waleche kubagama, na hegwe kahi kobagama. <verse eid="NUM 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4"/>Hewo wochilumba na hegwe na kweneza goya mijito ja hewo jowalinguganigwa ilinguwala mijito jeng'ha ja ihema lya Nguluwi, na haleche kuwa na munhu yunji yohejelela honhu aho. <verse eid="NUM 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5"/>Hemwe mokola mijito ja ihema lya Nguluwi na honhu ha kulavila nhambiko, leka ng'halazi ya heni ileche kuwalawila kahi Waisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6"/>Heni ndiwahagule wang'holozenu Walawi hali Waisilaeli kota ndolendole kwa hemwe. Hewo nawabaguligwa kwa chiwalo cha heni Mkulu Nguluwi, leka wakole mijito ja ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7"/>Ila hegwe uliyeka na wana wa hegwe mokola mijito jeng'ha ja utambika kwa chiwalo cha honhu ha kulavila nhambiko na vyeng'ha viwele kuli kumbele kwa ipaziya lya honhu helile. Ajo ndo mijito ja hemwe, kwa vila ndiwapa ndolendole ya utambika. Munhu yunji yoneche wone yovihejelela vinhu vya ihema lya Nguluwi, kobagama.”<verse eid="NUM 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Honhu ha watambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Aluni, “Ndanguwika kwa hegwe ndolendole azi zowamhele Waisilaeli, vinhu vyeng'ha vyelile vyowamhele. Vinhu vyeng'ha viwichigwe chiuyeng'ha na Waisilaeli. Ndanguwika vinhu vyeng'ha kwa hegwe na walelwa wa hegwe kwa honhu ha hemwe, na ayo ndo hachi ya hemwe mazuwa gose. <verse eid="NUM 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9"/>Kuli vinhu vyelile ng'hatu vyohambe vilakazwe kwa chiluli, avi vyowa vya hemwe. Nhambiko za nyhule na nhambiko za gehile na nhambiko za nongwa, chila chinhu chowondavila wanhu kota nhambiko yelile chowa cha hegwe na wanago. <verse eid="NUM 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10"/>Molya vinhu avyo kota vinhu vyelile ng'hatu, na ndo walume hela ndo wolya, vinhu avyo ndo vyelile kwa hemwe.<verse eid="NUM 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11"/>“Kahi, vinhu viyage vyeng'ha vyowondavila Waisilaeli kota nhambiko za kwinula kuchanya, vyowa vya hegwe. Ndokupa hegwe na wanago na wahinza wa hegwe viwe vya hemwe mazuwa gose. Munhu yoneche yelizwe kuli nhanzi ya hegwe koweza kulya vinhu avyo.<verse eid="NUM 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12"/>“Ndangukupa vinhu vyeng'ha vinojile vilingulawila kuli mbena ya mwaluko iwele Waisilaeli hundavila heni Mkulu Nguluwi. Mafuta ganojile na divai na nyhule. <verse eid="NUM 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13"/>Mbena zeng'ha za mwaluko za mafuza gapile ga migunda ja hewo gawele wongalila heni Mkulu Nguluwi, gowa ga hegwe. Chila munhu yelizwe kuli ivyazi lya hegwe koweza kulya. <verse eid="NUM 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14"/>Chila chinhu chibaguligwe kwa chiwalo cha Nguluwi kuli isi ya Isilaeli chowa cha hemwe.<verse eid="NUM 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15"/>“Chila mlelwa wa mwaluko yawele Waisilaeli wondavila heni Mkulu Nguluwi, wone yowa mlelwa wa mwaluko wa munhu ama igongolo, yowa wa hegwe. Ila kwanguganigwa kuwagombola walelwa wa mwaluko weng'ha wa wanhu, na chila mlelwa wa mwaluko wa igongolo likokomoche yanguganigwa ligomboligwe. <verse eid="NUM 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16"/>Walelwa awo wa mwaluko wawele wa mwezi umwe kwa kulavigwa sendi vihande vihano, kwa kuwinza chipimilo cha ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17"/>Ila walelwa wa mwaluko wa misenga ama ming'holo myana ama mhene, hewo huwagombola hebu kwa vila hewo ndo welile. Danda ya hewo koimizila kuli honhu ha kulavila nhambiko na mafuta gawo kogalakaza gawe nhambiko yalingulavilwa kwa chiluli gawele ndo kunhunyhilila kunojile kulingumnojeza Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18"/>Miwunde ja hewo koweza kulya kota hila vyoudile mhambaga yinuligwe kuchanya na chima cha kudilo.<verse eid="NUM 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19"/>“Ndanguwika kwa hegwe Mkulu Nguluwi na wana wa hegwe na wahinza wa hegwe, vinhu vyeng'ha viwele wanhu wa Isilaeli nawandavilaga, avyo ndo vya hemwe mazuwa gose. Ali ndo ilagano lya mazuwa gose na halibenigwa hali heni, liwele ndo kwa chiwalo cha hegwe na walelwa wa hegwe.”<verse eid="NUM 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Aluni, “Hegwe hauwa na uhalizi woneche kuli isi ayo, ne kuwa na honhu ha hegwe hali hewo. Heni ndo honhu ha hegwe na uhalizi wa hegwe hali Waisilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Honhu ha Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga, “Kwa Walawi, hewo nandiwapa zaka zeng'ha ziwele Waisilaeli nawandavilaga ziwe uhalizi wa hewo. Aga ndo gowa kuhilusila kwa hewo kwa chiwalo cha mijito jowalingukola kwa kulilolela ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22"/>Kulawila sambi, wanhu wanji wa Isilaeli waleche kuhejela habehi na ihema lya Nguluwi leka waleche kutagusigwa kwa gehile ga hewo na kigalila kubagama. <verse eid="NUM 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23"/>Ila Walawi waliyeka ndo wokola mijito kuli ihema lya Nguluwi na nongwa zeng'ha zilingulapa ihema lya Nguluwi, zowa za hewo. Alyo ndo ilajizo lya mhela weng'ha kuli lulelo lwa hemwe lweng'ha. Walawi hawowa na uhalizi kuli isi ya Isilaeli, <verse eid="NUM 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24"/>kwa vila zaka ziwele Waisilaeli zowalingundavila heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndiwapa hewo Walawi ziwe uhalizi wa hewo. Ndo mina ndilonga kota hewo hawowa na uhalizi hali Waisilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zaka za Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25"/>Hamba, Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26"/>“Kowalonjela Walawi malajizo aga. Hombochela zaka ziwele Mkulu Nguluwi nakawapa kulawa kwa Waisilaeli iwe ndo uhalizi wa hemwe, mondavila heni Mkulu Nguluwi honhu hamwe ha kumi ha zaka ayo. <verse eid="NUM 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27"/>Nhambiko ya hemwe yokundigwa iwe kota mbena ya mwaluko ama kota zabibu zoyalingundavila mlimi. <verse eid="NUM 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28"/>Lelo ahyo ndo vyomundavila heni Mkulu Nguluwi nhambiko za zaka zombochela kulawa kwa Waisilaeli. Zaka azo zomndavila heni Mkulu Nguluwi momha mtambika Aluni. <verse eid="NUM 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29"/>Nhambiko yila yomuilavile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, iwe inojile kusinda zeng'ha kulawa kuli zaka zombochela. <verse eid="NUM 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30"/>Ahyo, kowalonjela kota, homsinda kundavila honhu hanojile kusinda heng'ha, honhu hohosigala howa ha hemwe Walawi, kota vyoiwele kwa mlimi yawele nakaholaga chisigale hoyasindile kulavya zaka za heye za nyhule na za zabibu. <verse eid="NUM 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31"/>Na hemwe moweza kulya chilavigwe honhu honeche hala hamwe na ivyazi lya hemwe mina ndo ndolendole za hemwe kwa chiwalo cha mijito ja hemwe ja ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32"/>Mowahela nongwa yoneche wone mulye vinhu avyo, wone mumlavila Mkulu Nguluwi honhu hanojile kusinda heng'ha, namwe hamzibeza zaka zelile za Isilaeli ama mobagama.”<verse eid="NUM 18:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19"/>
  <para style="s">Mivu ja isenga idung'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakawalonjela Musa na Aluni, <verse eid="NUM 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2"/>“Aji ndo mizilo ja malajizo gawele heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndangugalavya. Walonjele Waisilaeli wawegalile isenga idala idung'hu liwele hela nongwa, na hambe yakoweligwe ngwamo ne hado. <verse eid="NUM 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3"/>Hemwe momha mtambika Eleasali isenga alyo. Lyolavigwa hanze ha kambi na kudumuligwa singo hali mtambika ayo.<verse eid="NUM 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4"/>“Hamba mtambika Eleasali kohola chasi cha danda na kumiza kwa chidole mala saba, kuno yolola kuli ubanzi wa kumwando mwa ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5"/>Isenga alyo lyeng'ha lyolakazwa hali mtambika. Chila chinhu cholakazwa, igozi na miwunde na danda na mitumbu. <verse eid="NUM 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6"/>Hamba mtambika kohola igodi lilinguchemigwa mwelezi na nhagala ya isopolo na sufu ndung'hu na kuviwika kuli chiluli acho. <verse eid="NUM 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7"/>Hamba kahi, mtambika kohovuga mivalo ja heye na koga, hamba koweza kwinjila kuli kambi, ila kowa yakokomoche mbaka matinazo. <verse eid="NUM 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8"/>Munhu yolilakaza isenga alyo kahi kohovuga mivalo ja heye na koga, ila na heye kahi kowa yakokomoche mbaka matinazo. <verse eid="NUM 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9"/>Munhu yawele yelizwe kohola mivu ja isenga alyo na kugahilika kuli honhu helizwe kunze mwa kambi. Gowichigwa goya kwa Waisilaeli weng'ha kugongomanya mazi ga kusa kukokomoka, leka kusa gehile. <verse eid="NUM 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10"/>Munhu yoyokusa mivu ja isenga alyo imgana yahovuje mivalo ja heye, ila kowa yakokomoche mbaka matinazo. Ilajizo ali ndo lya mazuwa gose na lyowawala Waisilaeli na wajenzi wowochikala hamwe na hewo.<verse eid="NUM 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malajizo galinguwala kwelizwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11"/>“Wone munhu kodoliza itufi lya munhu yoneche, kowa yakokomoche kwa mazuwa saba. <verse eid="NUM 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12"/>Zuwa lya kadatu na lya saba munhu ayo kochiyeliza kwa gala mazi ga kweliza, na heye kokwelizwa. Ila wone yoleka kiyeliza kuli zuwa lya kadatu na lya saba, munhu ayo kopona yawele yakokomoche. <verse eid="NUM 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13"/>Yalingudoliza mtufi, wone yoleka kiyeliza, kolidita liwe likokomoche ihema lya Mkulu Nguluwi, na heye kobaguligwa na wanhu wa Isilaeli. Munhu ayo kopona yawele yakokomoche kwa vila hambe yamizilwe mazi ga kweliza.<verse eid="NUM 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14"/>“Na ali ndo ilajizo lya kuwinzigwa wone wanhu wobagama mgati mwa ihema. Chila munhu hoyokwinjila mgati mwa ihema alyo ama yawele mgati mwa ihema alyo, kowa yakokomoche kwa mazuwa saba. <verse eid="NUM 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15"/>Chila chisaye na chijilo chiwele mwanzi chilihela chigubiko mchanya mwake, chowa chikokomoche. <verse eid="NUM 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16"/>Munhu yoneche yodoliza lukuli lwa yakopoligwe ama yabagame hela hanze ha ng'handa, ama yodoliza izeje lya munhu ama chilaga, kowa yakokomoche kwa mazuwa saba.<verse eid="NUM 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17"/>“Kwa chiwalo cha wala weditile wakokomoche wohola mivu ja isenga idung'hu liwele ndo nhambiko ya kusa gehile ilakazwe, mivu ajo johanzanyigwa na mazi ga kulwanda kuli chiya. <verse eid="NUM 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18"/>Munhu yunji yohawele yakokomoche, kohola nhagala ya isopolo, hamba koiwika kuli mazi ago, hamba kahi kolimizila ihema na vinhu vyeng'ha viwele mgati mwa ihema na wanhu wawele mgati. Kommizila kahi munhu yoyadolize izeje lya munhu ama lukuli lwa munhu yakopoligwe ama yabagame hela ama yoyadolize chilaga. <verse eid="NUM 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19"/>Kuli zuwa lya kadatu na lya saba, munhu yula yohawele yakokomoche kommizila munhu yakokomoche mazi ago, ahyo kuli zuwa lya saba, komweliza munhu ayo yakokomoche. Yula yawele yakokomoche kohovuga mivalo ja heye na koga, na matinazo kowa yelizwe hali Nguluwi.<verse eid="NUM 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20"/>“Ila wone munhu yawe yakokomoche na hambe yelizwe, munhu ayo kobaguligwa kuli Waisilaeli weng'ha, kwa vila kangulidita ihema lya Mkulu Nguluwi liwe likokomoche. Kwa vila hambe yamizilwe mazi ga kweliza, ka yakokomoche. <verse eid="NUM 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21"/>Wanhu woliwinza ilajizo ali kulawila sambi na mhela weng'ha. Munhu yomizila mazi ga kweliza kohovuga mivalo ja heye, na heye yalingudoliza mazi ago kowa yakokomoche mbaka matinazo. <verse eid="NUM 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22"/>Choneche choyodoliza munhu yakokomoche chowa chikokomoche, na yoneche yalingudoliza chinhu acho kowa yakokomoche mbaka matinazo.”<verse eid="NUM 19:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20"/>
  <para style="s">Mazi ga Meliba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Kulawa 17:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1"/>Waisilaeli weng'ha nawafika kuchiwala ako Sini mwezi wa mwaluko, nawawika kambi ako Kadeshi. Lowawele ako Miliamu nakabagama, nakatiligwa.<verse eid="NUM 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2"/>Honhu aho nahali haduhu mazi. Ahyo, Waisilaeli weng'ha nawekungajiza kuwabelenhuka Musa na Aluni. <verse eid="NUM 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3"/>Nawetwanza weng'ha wolonga, “Fola twahabagame hamwe na wang'holozetu hali ihema lya Mkulu Nguluwi! <verse eid="NUM 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4"/>Lekachoni mtugala aku kuchiwala hetwe wanhu wa Mkulu Nguluwi? Ndaze, mtugala aku leka tubagame hetwe na migongolo ja hetwe? <verse eid="NUM 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5"/>Lekachoni kahi namtulavya kula Misili na kutugala hano honhu hehile hino? Hano hakuwele honhu ha nyhule ne tini ne zabibu ne makomamanga. Na mazi ga kunwa kahi haduhu!” <verse eid="NUM 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6"/>Aho, Musa na Aluni nawoka kuli nhing'hano ayo ya wanhu, nawaluta kwima kuli lwizi lwa ihema lya Nguluwi, nawagwa chifunama. Lelo ukulu wa Mkulu Nguluwi nauwalawila, <verse eid="NUM 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7"/>na heye Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8"/>“Uhole yila ng'hweku ya hegwe, hamba hegwe na Aluni mng'holozo, muwakungajize Waisilaeli weng'ha. Hamba, ulilonjele italawe liwele kumwando kwa hewo lilavye mazi. Ena, kolidita italawe lilavye mazi, leka nhanzi yeng'ha ya wanhu na migongolo ja hewo jinwe mazi.” <verse eid="NUM 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9"/>Musa nakaihola yila ng'hweku hali Mkulu Nguluwi kota navyoyalajizwe.<verse eid="NUM 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10"/>Hamba Musa na Aluni nawaikungajiza nhanzi ya wanhu weng'ha hali italawe, Musa nakawalonjela, “Mhulichize ng'hatu hemwe mlingubelenhuka. Ndaze, tuwalavile mazi kulawa kuli italawe ali?” <verse eid="NUM 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11"/>Hamba Musa nakenula moko wa heye, nakalitowa lila italawe mala mbili kwa ng'hweku ya heye. Mazi nagalawa kwa winji, Waisilaeli weng'ha nawanwa hamwe na migongolo ja hewo. <verse eid="NUM 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12"/>Ila Mkulu Nguluwi nakawalonjela Musa na Aluni, “Kwa vila hemwe namwali hambe mng'hunde ne kumha ukulu hali meho ga Waisilaeli, kwa chiwalo acho hamuwenjiza wanhu weng'ha wano kuli isi yila yondiwapele.” <verse eid="NUM 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13"/>Ago ndo mazi ga Meliba, honhu hawele Waisilaeli nawawele womng'ung'utila Mkulu Nguluwi, na heye nakelajila kota ka yelile hali hewo.<verse eid="NUM 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa wa Edomu kanguwalemeza Waisilaeli kukola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14"/>Musa nakahilika wasenga kulawa Kadeshi kwa Mndewa wa Edomu, nakawalonjela, “Wang'holozo, Waisilaeli, wangulonga hino, ‘Hegwe kuvizela ndaze vyotugaziche. <verse eid="NUM 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15"/>Vila wasekulu wa hetwe navyowalutile Misili, kuwele natikala ako kwa mhela winji na vila Wamisili navyowawagazile wasekulu wa hetwe na vyowatugazile hetwe. <verse eid="NUM 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16"/>Natumlilila Mkulu Nguluwi, na heye nakahulika kulila kwa hetwe, nakatugalila mhilisi yatulavile Misili. Lelo twa hano Kadeshi, muji uwele behi ng'hatu na isi ya hegwe. <verse eid="NUM 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17"/>Dedede utukundize tukole kuli isi ya hegwe. Hatubiga hebu migunda ja hemwe ne jila ja mizabibu ne kunwa mazi ga mizimbo ja hemwe. Tokola kuli nzila ng'hulu ya mndewa na kuka ne kuhinduka kumoso ne kudilo, mbaka hotulawa kuli isi ya hegwe.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18"/>Ila mndewa wa Edomu nakawedichila, “Hebu! Hamkola hebu kuli isi ya heni, wone mkole tolawa na kuwatowa kwa ipanga.” <verse eid="NUM 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19"/>Waisilaeli nawamlonjela, “Hetwe towinza nzila ng'hulu, wone hetwe na migongolo ja hetwe tonwa mazi ga hemwe tohilula. Chotulingulanda dedede utukundize hela, tukole kwa magulu hambe tugane choneche chinji.”<verse eid="NUM 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20"/>Ila mndewa wa Edomu nakalema ng'hatu na kulonga kahi, “Hamkola hebu.” Hamba Waedomu wawele na mong'ho nawalawa kitowa na hewo. <verse eid="NUM 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21"/>Lelo mndewa wa Edomu nakalema kuwakundiza Waisilaeli kukola kuli mbaka ja heye. Waisilaeli nawagaluka na kukola nzila yinji.<verse eid="NUM 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubagama kwa Aluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22"/>Waisilaeli weng'ha nawali mmajendo kulawa Kadeshi, nawafika kuli chidunda cha Holi. <verse eid="NUM 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23"/>Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi nakawalonjela Musa na Aluni ako kuli chidunda cha Holi, kuli mbaka mwa isi ya Edomu, <verse eid="NUM 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24"/>“Aluni kobagama, hambe yenjile kuli isi yondiwapele wanhu wa Isilaeli, kwa vila hemwe weli namuubelenhuka mzilo wa heni kula Meliba. <verse eid="NUM 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25"/>Uwahole Aluni na mwanage Eleasali, uwegale kuchanya kuli chidunda cha Holi. <verse eid="NUM 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26"/>Hamba, umvule Aluni mivalo ja heye ja utambika, umvalize mwanage Eleasali. Aluni kobagama yawele ako kuli chidunda.” <verse eid="NUM 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27"/>Musa nakadita kota navyoyalajizwe na Mkulu Nguluwi. Weng'ha wadatu nawakwina kuli chidunda cha Holi hali Waisilaeli weng'ha. <verse eid="NUM 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28"/>Hamba Musa nakamvula Aluni mivalo ja heye ja utambika, nakamvaliza mwanage Eleasali. Na heye Aluni nakabagama bahala kuchidunda acho. Hamba Musa na Eleasali nawadulika kulawa kuchidunda acho. <verse eid="NUM 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29"/>Waisilaeli weng'ha vyowahuliche kota Aluni nakabagama, nawawasiliza matanga kwa mhela wa mazuwa makumi gadatu.<verse eid="NUM 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21"/>
  <para style="s">Kusumya ako Holima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1"/>Mndewa yumwe Mkanaani wa Aladi nayawele yochikala ako Negebu, navyoyahuliche mbuli ayi kota Waisilaeli nawali wokuya kwa nzila ya Atalimu, nakaluta kuwatowa, nakawahola wamwe wa hewo. <verse eid="NUM 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2"/>Aho Waisilaeli nawamlahila Mkulu Nguluwi wolonga, “Wone kowawika wanhu wano kuli moko ga hetwe, lelo tojidumya ng'hatu miji ja hewo.” <verse eid="NUM 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakahulika kulanda kwa hewo, nakawadita wawasumye Wakanaani. Waisilaeli nawawadumya ng'hatu Wakanaani hamwe na miji ja hewo. Ahyo honhu aho nahachemigwa Holima<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Holima </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya yanguzeleka kota kubagamiza.</char></note>.<verse eid="NUM 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izoka lya shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4"/>Waisilaeli nawaluka majendo kulawa chidunda cha Holi, nawakola nzila ilingulutila Bahali ya Shamu leka waizungulute isi ya Edomu. Ila lowawele mnzila, wanhu nawagozola. <verse eid="NUM 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5"/>Lelo nawaluka kuwang'ung'utila Nguluwi na Musa, wolonga, “Lekachoni namtulavya kula Misili leka tubagame aku kuchiwala? Aku kwa haduhu mazi ne chilyo, natwe natutoka kwa mana ayi chakachaka.”<verse eid="NUM 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6"/>Aho Mkulu Nguluwi nakegala mizoka jiwele na dunga hali wanhu, najiwaluma wanhu wenji mbaka Waisilaeli wenji kahi nawabagama. <verse eid="NUM 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7"/>Lelo wanhu nawamlutila Musa, nawamlonjela, “Natudita gehile kwa kuwang'ung'utila hegwe na Mkulu Nguluwi. Mlande Mkulu Nguluwi yatusile mizoka aji.” Ahyo, Musa nakawalandila wanhu. <verse eid="NUM 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8"/>Ahyo, na heye Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, “Gongomanya izoka lya shaba, lininize mchanya mwa igodi. Munhu yoneche yolumigwa na izoka, yolilola izoka alyo lya shaba, kowa mkomu.” <verse eid="NUM 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9"/>Lelo Musa nakagongomanya izoka lya shaba, nakalininiza kuli izengo. Chila munhu yoyalumigwe na izoka loyalilolile izoka alyo lya shaba, nakawa mkomu.<verse eid="NUM 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Majendo kuza ibindi lya Wamoabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10"/>Waisilaeli nawalutilila na majendo ga hewo, nawawika kambi ako Oboti. <verse eid="NUM 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11"/>Kulawa ako Oboti, nawali mmajendo mbaka nawafika Iye-Abalimu, kuli kuchiwala ubanzi wa kolilawilaga isanya mwa Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12"/>Kulawa ako nawaluta na kuwika kambi ya hewo kuli ibindi lya Seledi. <verse eid="NUM 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13"/>Kulawa ako nawaluta mbaka kasikazini mwa lwanda lwa Alinoni, nawawika kambi ya hewo, kuwele mazi nagabubujikaga kulawa isi ya Waamoli na kukola kuli kuchiwala. Lwanda lwa Alinoni nalwali ndo mbaka hali Wamoabu na Waamoli. <verse eid="NUM 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14"/>Kwa chiwalo acho, nayandichigwa kuli chitabu cha ngondo ya Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:14">“Muji wa Wahebu kuli isi ya Sufa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:14">na mibindi ja Alinoni<verse eid="NUM 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15"/>na kuli viduliko vya mibindi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:15">ulingifika mbaka kuli muji wa Ali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:15">na kulutila kuli mbaka mwa Moabu.”<verse eid="NUM 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16"/>Kulawa ako, Waisilaeli nawali mmajendo mbaka Beeli, mina ndo izimbo liwele Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, “Wakungajize wanhu hamwe na heni ndowapa mazi.” <verse eid="NUM 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17"/>Aho Waisilaeli nawemba lwimbo alu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">“Bogome mazi gwa izimbo! Muyimbile!<verse eid="NUM 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18"/>Izimbo lyolibawigwe na wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">libawigwe ng'hatu na vilongozi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">kwa ng'hweku za hewo na mikongojo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 21:18">Kulawa kuchiwala, nawali mmajendo mbaka ako Matana, <verse eid="NUM 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19"/>kulawa Matana nawaluta mbaka Nahalieli na kulawa Nahalieli nawaluta mbaka Bamoti, <verse eid="NUM 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20"/>na kulawa Bamoti nawaluta mbaka kuli ibindi lilingwinjila isi ya Moabu, kuli chinhembenhembe cha chidunda cha Pisiga, chilingulola kuli kuchiwala.<verse eid="NUM 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Waisilaeli wanguwasumya wandewa Sihoni na Ogu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 2:26-3:1">Kukumbuchila 2:26-3:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21"/>Waisilaeli nawamhilichila usenga mndewa wa Waamoli yalinguchemigwa Sihoni, usenga awu, <verse eid="NUM 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22"/>“Utukundize tukole kuli isi ya hegwe, hatuluta hebu kula kufungo na kwinjila kuli migunda ama kuli migunda ja mizabibu ne kunwa mazi ga mizimbo ja hemwe. Tokola kuli nzila ng'hulu hela ya mndewa mbaka hotuloka isi ya hegwe.” <verse eid="NUM 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23"/>Ila Sihoni hambe yawakundize wanhu wa Isilaeli wakole kuli isi ya heye. Nakawakungajiza wanhu wa heye, nakaluta Yahasi kuchiwala kuwatowa Waisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24"/>Ila Waisilaeli nawamkopola, nawaihola isi ya heye kulawa lwanda lwa Alinoni mbaka Yaboki, mina mbaka wa isi ya Waamoni nawali ukwamililwa ng'hatu. <verse eid="NUM 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25"/>Waisilaeli nawajihola miji aji jeng'ha na hewo nawekala kuli miji ja Waamoli hamwe na muji wa Heshiboni na vijiji vyake vyeng'ha. <verse eid="NUM 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26"/>Heshiboni nawali muji wa Sihoni, yawele mndewa wa Waamoli, yetowile na mndewa wa Moabu iwele aho hamwande, Sihoni nakaihola isi ya heye yeng'ha mbaka kuli lwanda lwa Alinoni. <verse eid="NUM 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27"/>Ndo mina walingwimba wa hetwe wangwimba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">“Muye Heshiboni na kuzenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">Muji wa Sihoni nauzenjigwe na kwimizwa nzinzili.<verse eid="NUM 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28"/>Mina chiluli nachilawa Heshiboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">milapi ja chiluli najilawa kuli muji wa Sihoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">nakuudumya muji wa Ali wa Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">na kuvidumya vidunda vya lwanda lwa Alinoni.<verse eid="NUM 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29"/>Mochona wanhu wa Moabu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Namdumigwa, hemwe wanhu wa mlungu Kemoshi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Nakuwadita wana wa hegwe walume wawe wajenzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">wahinza wa hegwe nakuwaleka waholigwe wapogozi wa ngondo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">kwa Sihoni, mndewa wa Amoli.<verse eid="NUM 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30"/>Ila lelo walelwa wa hewo nawadumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">kulawa Heshiboni mbaka Diboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">kulawa Nashimu mbaka Nofa, behi na Medeba.”<verse eid="NUM 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31"/>Lelo Waisilaeli nawekala kuli isi ya Waamoli. <verse eid="NUM 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32"/>Hamba Musa nakalajiza wanhu kuupugajiza muji wa Yaseli, nawauhola hamwe na vijiji vyake vyeng'ha, nawawawinga Waamoli nawawele wochikala amo.<verse eid="NUM 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33"/>Waisilaeli nawahinduka na kuluta kuli nzila ya kuluta Bashani. Mndewa Ogu wa Bashani nakalawa na wanhu wa heye kuwatowa ako Edileyi. <verse eid="NUM 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34"/>Ila Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, “Uleche kumdumba mina ndimuwika mmoko mwako hamwe na wanhu wa heye weng'ha na isi ya heye yeng'ha. Komditila kota vyoumditile Sihoni, mndewa wa Waamoli, yawele yochikala ako Heshiboni.” <verse eid="NUM 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35"/>Lelo Waisilaeli nawamkopola Ogu na wana wa heye weng'ha na wanhu wa heye weng'ha na kuwadumya, haponile ne munhu yoneche. Hamba nawaihola isi ya heye.<verse eid="NUM 21:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22"/>
  <para style="s">Balaamu kanguchemigwa na mndewa wa Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1"/>Waisilaeli nawaluka majendo kahi, nawaluta kuwika kambi ya hewo kuli ibalalika lya Moabu, kolilawilaga isanya mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani, lichilola na muji wa Yeliko.<verse eid="NUM 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2"/>Mndewa Balaki mwana wa Sipoli, nakazona mbuli zeng'ha ziwele Waisilaeli zowawaditile Waamoli. <verse eid="NUM 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3"/>Heye hamwe na Wamoabu nawawadumba ng'hatu Waisilaeli. Nawawadumba kwa chiwalo cha winji wa hewo. <verse eid="NUM 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4"/>Lelo Wamoabu nawawalonjela vilongozi wa Midiani, “Lung'hongola alu lyowifya chila chinhu hafungo mwa hetwe kota ibuguma vyolilingulya misolo kumgunda.” Ahyo, Balaki mwana wa Sipoli, nayawele mndewa wa Moabu mhela awo, <verse eid="NUM 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5"/>nakahilika usenga kwa Balaamu mwana wa Beoli, ako Petoli kota kuwele hafungo mwa lwanda mbaka kuli isi ya wanhu wa heye, yolonga, “Hana wanhu walawile Misili, nawo nawenela chila honhu hano muisi, na kahi wangikala behi na heni. <verse eid="NUM 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6"/>Uye lelo uwapanjile wanhu wano kwa chiwalo cha heni, mina wana mong'ho kusinda heni. Wone uwapanjile, hanji ndoweza kuwasumya na kuwawinga waleche kwinjila kuli isi ya heni, kwa vila ndivizela wone hegwe umtambichize munhu nakatambichizagwa na wone umpanjile munhu nakapanjilagwa.”<verse eid="NUM 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7"/>Lelo wakulu wa Moabu na Midiani nawahola sendi na kumha mlaguzi, nawoka kuluta kwa Balaamu. Nalowafichile, nawamha Balaamu usenga wa Balaki. <verse eid="NUM 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8"/>Balaamu nakawalonjela, “Muwase kuno nechilo ayi, nani ndowalonjela choyondonjela Mkulu Nguluwi.” Lelo wala vilongozi wa Moabu nawawasa kwa Balaamu.<verse eid="NUM 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9"/>Hamba Nguluwi nakamuyila Balaamu, nakamuuza, “Wanhu wachi wano nawekale na hegwe?” <verse eid="NUM 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10"/>Balaamu nakamwidichila Nguluwi, “Balaki, mndewa wa ako Moabu, mwana wa Sipoli, nakangalila usenga kota <verse eid="NUM 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11"/>hana wanhu walingulawa Misili, nawenela chila honhu hano muisi. Nakandanda ndikawapanjile wala wanhu leka hanji koweza kitowa na hewo na kuwawinga.”<verse eid="NUM 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12"/>Nguluwi nakamlonjela Balaamu, “Uleche kuka hamwe na wanhu wano ne kuwapanjila, mina nawatambichizwa.”<verse eid="NUM 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13"/>Lelo hamitondo Balaamu nakenuka, nakawalonjela wakulu wa Balaki, “Mhiluche kuli isi ya hemwe, kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi hambe yagane kung'hundiza kuka hamwe na hemwe.” <verse eid="NUM 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14"/>Lelo wakulu wa Moabu nawoka, nawahiluka kwa Balaki, nawamlonjela, “Balaamu nakalema kuya hamwe na hetwe.”<verse eid="NUM 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15"/>Hamba, Balaki nakalajiza wakulu wanji, wenji lukami na wakulu ng'hatu kusinda wala wa mwaluko. <verse eid="NUM 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16"/>Na hewo nawafika kwa Balaamu, nawamlonjela, “Balaki mwana wa Sipoli, nakalonga hino, ‘Uleche kukunda kulemezwa na chinhu choneche na kulema kuya kwa heni. <verse eid="NUM 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17"/>Ndokulipa vinojile ng'hatu na choneche choundanda ndokuditila goya. Uye uwapanjile wanhu wano.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18"/>Ila Balaamu nakawedichila, “Hanga Balaki komha heni ng'handa ya heye imemile sendi na zahabu, heni siweza kuleka kuhulichiza ilajizo lya Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa heni, kwa mbuli yoneche, ndodo ama ng'hulu. <verse eid="NUM 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19"/>Ila dedede, muwase hano nechilo ayi kota wala wayenu, nani ndovizela kahi choyondonjela Mkulu Nguluwi.”<verse eid="NUM 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20"/>Lelo Nguluwi nakamuyila Balaamu nechilo ayo, nakamlonjela, “Wone wanhu wano nawoya kukuchema, uche hamwe na hewo, ila udite chila chondikulonjela hela.” <verse eid="NUM 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21"/>Balaamu nakalilimka mitondo, nakaliwika goya idogowi lya heye, nakoka hamwe na hewo wakulu wa Moabu.<verse eid="NUM 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Idogowi lya Balaamu na mhilisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22"/>Nguluwi nakazudila ng'hatu kwa vila Balaamu nayali yoluta, ahyo mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nayali yatatamale mnzila kumlemeza kukola. Mhela awo Balaamu nayali yakwinile idogowi lya heye yawele na vitumagwa wa heye weli. <verse eid="NUM 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23"/>Lelo idogowi nalimona mhilisi ayo wa Mkulu Nguluwi yemile mnzila, yebatile ipanga lisomoligwe kuli yala yake. Ahyo nalileka nzila, naliluta hafungo. Balaamu nakalitowa idogowi alyo na kumhilula mnzila. <verse eid="NUM 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24"/>Hamba mhilisi ayo wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakalongola kumwando, nakema honhu hawele na nzila nzisili, hagati mwa migunda ja zabibu na lukanzi banzi zeng'ha mbili. <verse eid="NUM 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25"/>Lila idogowi lolimuwene yula mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi, nalikundujiza lilyo mlukanzi na kumlumiza mgulu wa Balaamu baho. Lelo Balaamu nakalitowa kahi alyo idogowi. <verse eid="NUM 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26"/>Hamba mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakalongola kahi na kwima hali honhu hazisili halihela honhu ha kukola, ne kumoso ne kudilo. <verse eid="NUM 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27"/>Idogowi lila lolimuwene yula mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi, naliwasa hanyi. Balaamu nakazudila ng'hatu, nakalitowa na ng'hweku ya heye. <verse eid="NUM 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28"/>Aho, Mkulu Nguluwi nakalidita lila idogowi lilonje, idogowi nalimlonjela Balaamu, “Nandikuditila choni mbaka kunhowa heni mala zidatu azi?” <verse eid="NUM 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29"/>Balaamu nakalilonjela lila idogowi, “Hegwe nakumbeza heni. Wone nandali ndibatile ipanga, ndahawele ndikukopole sambi baha.” <verse eid="NUM 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30"/>Idogowi lila nalimlonjela Balaamu, “Ndaze, heni ndahawele idogowi lya hegwe likupapile kuli mhela weng'ha wa kikala kwa hegwe mbaka zuwa lya lehano? Ndaze, nanjeza kukuditila kota ahi aho hamwande?” Balaamu nakalidichila, “Hebu.”<verse eid="NUM 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31"/>Aho, Mkulu Nguluwi nakamdita Balaamu yalole, na heye nakamona mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi yemile mnzila, yebatile ipanga lisomoligwe kuli yala yake. Balaamu naketoza hanyi chifunama. <verse eid="NUM 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32"/>Mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Balaamu, “Lekachoni nakulitowa idogowi lya hegwe mala zidatu azi? Mbuya kukulemeza, kwa vila kulutilila na majendo ndo kwajilila. <verse eid="NUM 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33"/>Idogowi lya hegwe limbona heni mala azi zidatu nalikola hafungo mwa heni. Wone nahalikolile kutali na heni, ndahawele ndikukopola hegwe na kulileka idogowi ali.”<verse eid="NUM 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34"/>Balaamu nakamlonjela mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi, “Ndita gehile mina hambe ndivizele kota nakwima mnzila kundemeza heni. Lelo wone hauganile heni ndutilile na majendo ago, ndohiluka haluga.” <verse eid="NUM 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35"/>Ila mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Balaamu, “Ulute na wanhu wano, ila kolonga chila chondikulonjela hela,” Lelo Balaamu nakalutilila na majendo hamwe na wala vilongozi wa Balaki.<verse eid="NUM 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36"/>Balaki naloyahuliche kota Balaamu kanguya, nakalawa kuka kumbochela kuli muji wa Ali, muji nalouwele hafungo mwa lwanda lwa Alinoni kuli mbaka wa Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37"/>Balaki nakamlonjela Balaamu, “Lekachoni nahuyile kwa heni mala imwe hala hondikuchemile? Ndaze, nakujesa kota siweza kukulipa vinojile?” <verse eid="NUM 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38"/>Balaamu nakamwidichila Balaki, “Lelo mbuya. Ila, ndaze, ndina ludali lwa kulonga choneche chila? Mbuli yondonjela Mkulu Nguluwi ndo yoganigwa kulonga.” <verse eid="NUM 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39"/>Lelo Balaamu nakaluta hamwe na Balaki, nawafika kuli muji wa Kiliati-husoti. <verse eid="NUM 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40"/>Balaki nakalavya nhambiko ya isenga na ing'holo ako, nakawapa miwunde ajo Balaamu hamwe na vilongozi wawele hamwe na heye.<verse eid="NUM 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Balaamu kanguwatambichiza Waisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41"/>Hamitondo hake, Balaki nakamhola Balaamu, nakoka na heye mbaka Bamoti-baali, nalowawele ako, Balaamu nakawona Waisilaeli wamwe.<verse eid="NUM 22:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1"/>Balaamu nakamlonjela Balaki, “Nzenjele honhu saba ha kulavila nhambiko hamba ungalile mibuguma saba na ming'holo milume saba.” <verse eid="NUM 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2"/>Balaki nakadita kota Balaamu navyoyalonjile. Lelo nawalavya mchanya mwa chila honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ibuguma limwe na ing'holo ilume limwe. <verse eid="NUM 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3"/>Hamba Balaamu nakamlonjela Balaki, “Upone hano behi na nhambiko ya hegwe ya kulakazwa, nani ndute. Hanji Mkulu Nguluwi koting'hana na heni. Choneche choyondajila ndokuya kukulonjela.” Lelo Balaamu nakaluta yaliyeka mchanya mwa chinhembenhembe cha chidunda. <verse eid="NUM 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4"/>Nguluwi nakating'hana na heye. Balaamu nakamlonjela, “Mbika goya honhu saba ha kulavila nhambiko na kulavya nhambiko ya ibuguma limwe na ing'holo ilume limwe mchanya mwa honhu ha kulavila nhambiko.”<verse eid="NUM 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamha Balaamu ulonzi woyalinguganigwa kulonga na kumlonjela yahiluche kwa Balaki. <verse eid="NUM 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6"/>Balaamu nakahiluka na nakamfika yemile bahala habehi na nhambiko ya heye ya kulakazwa, hamwe na vilongozi weng'ha wa Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7"/>Balaamu nakamha Balaki ulonzi wa heye, nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">“Balaki nakengala hano kulawa Alamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">ena, mndewa wa Moabu nakengala kulawa vidunda vya kolilawilaga isanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">‘Uye uwapanjile wanhu wa Yakobo kwa chiwalo cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">ena, uye uwalonje vibi Waisilaeli!’<verse eid="NUM 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8"/>Ila ndompanjila ndaze munhu yawele Mkulu Nguluwi hambe yampanjile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:8">Ndowalonga ndaze vibi wanhu wawele Mkulu Nguluwi hambe yawalonje vibi?<verse eid="NUM 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9"/>Kulawa kuli vinhembenhembe vya mitalawe nandiwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">kulawa mchanya mwa vidunda ndanguwasunjilila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">Awo wanhu walingikala waliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">hawalingilola kota wanhu wa isi zinji.<verse eid="NUM 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10"/>Yalihi yoweza kuwawaza wanhu wa Yakobo kwa ndaze navyowawele wenji lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">ama yoweza kuwaza honhu ha kane ha Waisilaeli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">Hondibagama ndiwe kota munhu yatanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">kota Waisilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11"/>Aho Balaki nakamlonjela Balaamu, “Nakunditila choni? Ndikugala hano leka uwapanjile wang'honyo wa heni, ila hegwe kwanguwatambichiza!” <verse eid="NUM 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12"/>Balaamu nakamlonjela Balaki, “Ndanguganigwa kulonga ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi hela.”<verse eid="NUM 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uloli wa keli wa Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13"/>Hamba Balaki nakamlonjela Balaamu, “Tulute honhu hanji hawele koweza kuwona, ila kowona wamwenga wa hewo hela, howeza kuwona weng'ha. Hamba, aho kowapanjila kwa chiwalo cha heni.” <verse eid="NUM 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14"/>Ahyo Balaki nakamhola Balaamu kuli mgunda wa Sofimu, mchanya mwa chinhembenhembe cha chidunda cha Pisiga. Aho nakazenga honhu saba ha kulavila nhambiko na kulavya nhambiko mchanya mwake, nhambiko ya ibuguma limwe na ing'holo ilume limwe.<verse eid="NUM 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15"/>Balaamu nakamlonjela Balaki, “Upone hano behi na nhambiko ya hegwe ya kulakazwa, nani ndute kula kumwambu kiting'hana na Mkulu Nguluwi.” <verse eid="NUM 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakating'hana na Balaamu, nakamha ulonzi woyolonga, na kumlonjela yahiluche kwa Balaki. <verse eid="NUM 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17"/>Lelo Balaamu nakahiluka, nakamfika Balaki yemile habehi na nhambiko ya heye ya kulakazwa hamwe na vilongozi weng'ha wa Moabu. Balaki nakamuuza, “Mkulu Nguluwi nakakulonjela choni?” <verse eid="NUM 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18"/>Aho, Balaamu nakamlavila Balaki ulonzi wa heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">“Wime Balaki, uhuliche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">unyhulichize gwa mwana wa Sipoli.<verse eid="NUM 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19"/>Nguluwi hawele munhu, yalonje udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">ne munhu yagaluse kijesa kwa heye!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">Ndaze, kolagana na wanhu chinhu na yaleche kudita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">ama yalonje chinhu na yaleche kweneza?<verse eid="NUM 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20"/>Ulole, mhegwa mzilo wa kutambichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:20">na heye nakatambichiza, heni siweza hebu kugalusa.<verse eid="NUM 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21"/>“Mkulu Nguluwi hawonile wihe wa wana wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">ne kulema kwa hewo wana wa Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hewo ka hamwe na hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">heye nakabochelaga lutogo lwa wandewa.<verse eid="NUM 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22"/>Nguluwi nayawaholile kulawa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:22">naketwanza na wang'honyo wa hewo kota ibogo.<verse eid="NUM 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23"/>Ndangukomya, uhawi hauweza hebu kuwasumya wanhu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">ne upanjilo kwa wanhu wa Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">Lelo wanhu wolonga, kuwala Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">‘Mlole vinduzanduza vyoyaditile Nguluwi!’<verse eid="NUM 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24"/>Ulole, kota isimba idala nawenuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">kota isimba ilume wangwima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">Waisilaeli hawokwesela mbaka webate chila chowalinguwinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">na kunwa danda ya chila chowalinguwinga.”<verse eid="NUM 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25"/>Aho Balaki nakamlonjela Balaamu, “Lelo uleche kuwapanjila ne kuwatambichiza!” <verse eid="NUM 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26"/>Ila Balaamu nakamwidichila Balaki, “Ndaze, sikulonjele heni kota nachoyalonjile Mkulu Nguluwi ndo chondiganigwa kudita?”<verse eid="NUM 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uloli wa kadatu wa Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27"/>Balaki nakamlonjela Balaamu, “Uye, ndokuhilika honhu hanji. Hanji Nguluwi konojezwa leka uwapanjile wanhu awo kulawa ako kwa chiwalo cha heni.” <verse eid="NUM 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28"/>Ahyo, Balaki nakamhola Balaamu mbaka kuli chinhembenhembe cha chidunda cha Peoli, hawele wone munhu yeme aho, koweza kuchona chiwala. <verse eid="NUM 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29"/>Balaamu nakamlonjela Balaki, “Nzenjele hano honhu saba ha kulavila nhambiko, umbichile goya mibuguma saba na ming'holo milume saba.” <verse eid="NUM 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30"/>Balaki nakadita kota navyoyalonjelwe na Balaamu, hamba nakalavya nhambiko ya ibuguma limwe na ing'holo ilume limwe mchanya mwa chila honhu ha kulavila nhambiko.<verse eid="NUM 23:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1"/>Lelo Balaamu nakavizela kota Mkulu Nguluwi nakagana kuwatambichiza Waisilaeli, ahyo nahalutile kulagula kahi, nayali yolola kuchiwala. <verse eid="NUM 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2"/>Balaamu nakalola, nakawona Waisilaeli wawichile kambi, chila nhanzi hali honhu hake. Hamba muhe wa Nguluwi naumuyila, <verse eid="NUM 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3"/>na heye nakadamla ulonzi awu wa chiuloli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">“Ulonzi wa heni Balaamu mwana wa Peoli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">ulonzi wa munhu yagubuligwe meho,<verse eid="NUM 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4"/>ulonzi wa munhu yahuliche ulonzi wa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">munhu yalolile ulaguzi wa Nguluwi yawele na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">munhu yalingufugama na kona hazelu.<verse eid="NUM 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5"/>“Mihema ja hegwe jinoga ndaze hemwe wanhu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:5">ena, kambi za hemwe zinoga ndaze hemwe wanhu wa Isilaeli!<verse eid="NUM 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6"/>“Avi ndo kota mibindi jilingubogoma mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">kota kagunda hafungo mwa lwanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">kota mitembwe joyanyalile Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">kota igodi lya mwelezi hafungo mwa mazi.<verse eid="NUM 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7"/>Viya vya hewo vyowa na mazi menji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">nyhadikwa ya hewo yonyaligwa hali honhu hawele na mazi ga kuhega.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">Mndewa wa hewo kowa mkulu kusinda Agagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">na undewa wa heye wowa ukulu ng'hatu.<verse eid="NUM 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8"/>“Nguluwi nakawahola kulawa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">na heye naketwanza ng'hatu na wang'honyo wa hewo, kota ibogo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">Kozidumya nhanzi zoziwele wang'honyo wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">kobenanga mizeje ja hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">kowahoma kwa misale ja heye.<verse eid="NUM 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9"/>Kowasa hasi kota isimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">yalihi yojeza kumlilimla?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 24:9"/>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">“Yoneche yokutambichiza, kotambichizwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">yoneche yokupanjila, kopanjilwa.”<verse eid="NUM 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10"/>Balaki nakazudila ng'hatu kwa chiwalo cha Balaamu, nakafumbata moko ga heye kwa kuzudila na kumlonjela, “Ndikuchema leka uwapanjile wang'honyo wa heni, ila mala zidatu zeng'ha azi kwanguwatambichiza! <verse eid="NUM 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11"/>Lelo lute hali honhu ha hegwe. Nangana ndikupe ndolendole nyinji, ila Mkulu Nguluwi nakakulemeza kubochela ndolendole azo.”<verse eid="NUM 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12"/>Balaamu nakamwidichila Balaki, “Ndaze, siwalonjela hebu wala wasenga wouwalajize kwa heni <verse eid="NUM 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13"/>kota hanga naumhe ng'handa ya hegwe imemile sendi na zahabu, heni siweza kubelenhuka ilajizo lya Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa kudita mbuli yoneche, ihile ama inojile kwa kunuwila nene baha. Nandonga kota choyolonga Mkulu Nguluwi ndo chondilonga heni.<verse eid="NUM 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14"/>“Lelo ndanguhiluka kwa wanhu wa heni, ila nding'hali kuka, leka ndikulonjele mbuli ziwele wanhu wano vyowowaditila wanhu wa hegwe mazuwa galinguya.”<verse eid="NUM 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uloli wa kane wa Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15"/>Lelo Balaamu nakalonga ulonzi awu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">“Ulonzi wa heni Balaamu mwana wa Beoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">ulonzi wa munhu yagubuligwe meho,<verse eid="NUM 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16"/>ulonzi wa munhu yoyahuliche ulonzi wa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">na munhu yavizelele uwanzi wa Nguluwi yawele kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">munhu yalingona ulaguzi wa Nguluwi yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">munhu yalingufugama na kona hazelu.<verse eid="NUM 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17"/>“Ndangumona, ila haiwele sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">ndangumlola, ila ka kutali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Nhondwe yolawila kwa walelwa wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">kolawila mndewa hali Waisilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Kwa ng'hweku ya heye kowasubula vilongozi wa Wamoabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">kowadumya walelwa weng'ha wa Seti.<verse eid="NUM 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18"/>Edomu yowa ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">Seili yowa ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">Isilaeli yowa na kusumya kukulu.<verse eid="NUM 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19"/>Yumwe wa walelwa wa Yakobo kolongoza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:19">na heye kowadumya wawele wopona kuli muji.”<verse eid="NUM 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20"/>Hamba Balaamu nakawalola Waamaleki, nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">“Waamaleki ndo wanhu wa isi ya mwaluko wawele na mong'ho kusinda weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">ila mwiso wodumigwa ng'hatu.”<verse eid="NUM 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21"/>Hamba Balaamu nakawalola Wakeni, nakalavya ulonzi awu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">“Ng'handa za hemwe za goya, hemwe Wakeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">kota chimvulila mchanya ng'hatu mwa italawe.<verse eid="NUM 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22"/>Ila modumigwa, hemwe Wakeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:22">Mbaka Ashulu hoyowahola hemwe kuwa wapogozi wa ngondo.”<verse eid="NUM 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23"/>Balaamu nakalavya ulonzi kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:23">“Hambi! Yalihi yochikala, hala Mkulu Nguluwi hoyodita mbuli azo?<verse eid="NUM 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24"/>Meli zofika kulawa Kitimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">wozitowa Ashulu na Ebeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">na hewo kahi wodumigwa.”<verse eid="NUM 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25"/>Ahyo, Balaamu nakoka, nakahiluka haluga ha heye, Balaki kahi nakoka.<verse eid="NUM 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25"/>
  <para style="s">Gehile ga Waisilaeli ako Peoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1"/>Waisilaeli nalowawele ako Shitimu, walume nawaluka kudita ung'hondwa na wadala wa Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2"/>Wadala awo nawawalalika Waisilaeli wehanze kuli nhambiko yowaiwichile kwa chiwalo cha milungu ja hewo, na hewo Waisilaeli nawalya na kujifugamila milungu ja hewo. <verse eid="NUM 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3"/>Ahyo ndo Waisilaeli navyowehanzile na mlungu Baali wa Peoli, na Mkulu Nguluwi nakawazudila ng'hatu. <verse eid="NUM 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4"/>Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, “Wahole vilongozi weng'ha wa wanhu, uwakopole hali heni hali isanya, leka ng'halazi ya heni kwa hemwe ikole.” <verse eid="NUM 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5"/>Musa nakawalonjela walamuzi wa Isilaeli, “Chila yumwe wa hemwe yamkopole munhu yoneche hali hemwe yehanzile na mlungu Baali wa Peoli.”<verse eid="NUM 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6"/>Mhela wuwo munhu yumwe Muisilaeli nakamigala mdala yumwe Mmidiani haluga ha heye, hali Musa na Waisilaeli weng'ha, lowawele wolombocheza hali lwizi lwa ihema lya Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7"/>Lelo Finehasi mwana wa Eleasali, mwana wa mtambika Aluni, naloyawene mbuli ayo, nakenuka na kulawa kuli Waisilaeli weng'ha, nakahola umbaji <verse eid="NUM 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8"/>na kumuwinza yula Muisilaeli mbaka kuli ihema, nakawahoma umbaji weng'ha weli kuli munda. Utamwa wihile louwagazile nauwadumya Waisilaeli nausumigwa. <verse eid="NUM 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9"/>Wanhu wabagame kwa chiwalo cha utamwa ula nawali elufu makumi meli na gane (24,000).<verse eid="NUM 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11"/>“Finehasi mwana wa Eleasali, mwana wa mtambika Aluni, nakalemeza ng'halazi ya heni kwa chiwalo cha Waisilaeli hali hemwe, ndo heye yawele na fihi kota yondiwelenayo heni. Ndo mina hambe ndiwadumye hebu Waisilaeli weng'ha kwa ng'halazi ya heni. <verse eid="NUM 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12"/>Lelo mlonjele kota ndangudita ilagano lya kikala goya na heye. <verse eid="NUM 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13"/>Ndangulagana na heye na walelwa wa heye wowa watambika mazuwa gose kwa vila nakona fihi kwa chiwalo cha heni, Nguluwi wa heye, nakawaditila uhanyisi Waisilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14"/>Ayo Muisilaeli nayabagame hamwe na mdala Mmidiani nayali yochemigwa Simuli mwana wa Salu, chilongozi wa ivyazi limwenga kuli nhanzi ya Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15"/>Na ayu mdala Mmidiani nayakopoligwe nayali yochemigwa Kosibi mhinza wa Suli, nayawele chilongozi wa nhanzi imwenga ako Midiani.<verse eid="NUM 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17"/>“Waditile Wamidiani kota wang'honyo na kuwadumya, <verse eid="NUM 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18"/>kwa vila nawawaditila hemwe kota wang'honyo kwa uhadi wa hewo, nawawahada kuwala mbuli ya Peoli, na kwa chiwalo cha Kosibi, mhinza wa chilongozi wa Midiani, nayakopoligwe mhela wa utamwa wihile naloulawile ako Peoli.”<verse eid="NUM 25:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26"/>
  <para style="s">Kuwazigwa lwa keli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1"/>Navyoumalile awo utamwa, Mkulu Nguluwi nakawalonjela Musa na Eleasali mwana wa mtambika Aluni, <verse eid="NUM 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2"/>“Muwawaze wanhu weng'ha wa Waisilaeli weng'ha, chila munhu kota navyoiwele ivyazi lya heye. Muwawaze wanhu weng'ha wawele na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi wawele woweza kuza kitowa ngondo.” <verse eid="NUM 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3"/>Musa na mtambika Eleasali nawalongasa na wanhu kuli isi iwele na ibalalika lya Moabu, kumwambu mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani ilingilola na Yeliko, nawawalonjela, <verse eid="NUM 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4"/>“Muwawaze wanhu wawele na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi, kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Musa.” Waisilaeli walawile Misili ndo awa.<verse eid="NUM 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5"/>Nhanzi ya Lubeni, mwana wa mwaluko kwa Yakobo, ng'holo za Hanoki na Palu <verse eid="NUM 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6"/>na Hesiloni na Kalimi. <verse eid="NUM 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7"/>Ng'holo za nhanzi ya Lubeni nawawazigwe, nawali walume elufu makumi gane na gadatu na miya saba na makumi gadatu (43,730). <verse eid="NUM 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8"/>Mlelwa wa Palu nayali Eliabu <verse eid="NUM 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9"/>na wana wa Eliabu, wawele ndo Nemueli na Datani na Abilamu. Awa weli, Datani na Abilamu ndo nawali wahaguligwe hali Waisilaeli weng'ha, ila nawawalema Musa na Aluni, na kihanza na wanhu walingumuwinza Kola mhela nalowambelenhuche Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10"/>Mhela awo misanga najigubuka najiwamela, nawabagama hamwe na Kola na wala wanhu weng'ha walingumuwinza heye. Chiluli navyochiwalakaze wanhu miya mbili na makumi gahano, nawali ulanguso kwa wanhu. <verse eid="NUM 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11"/>Ila walelwa wa Kola nahawabagame.<verse eid="NUM 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12"/>Nhanzi ya Simeoni ndo ng'holo za Nemueli na Yamini na Yakini <verse eid="NUM 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13"/>na Sela na Shauli. <verse eid="NUM 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14"/>Azo ndo ng'holo za nhanzi ya Simeoni, walume weng'ha nawali elufu makumi meli na mbili na miya mbili (22,200).<verse eid="NUM 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15"/>Nhanzi ya Gadi ndo ng'holo za Sefoni na Hagi na Shuni <verse eid="NUM 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16"/>na Osini na Eli <verse eid="NUM 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17"/>na Alodi na Aleli. <verse eid="NUM 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18"/>Azo ndo ng'holo za nhanzi ya Gadi, nawali walume elufu makumi gane na miya zihano (40,500).<verse eid="NUM 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19"/>Na wana wa Yuda nawali Eli na Onani. Awa nawabagama kuli isi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="NUM 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20"/>Nhanzi ya Yuda ndo ng'holo za Shela na Pelesi na Sela. <verse eid="NUM 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21"/>Walelwa wa Pelesi ndo ng'holo za Hesiloni na Hamuli. <verse eid="NUM 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22"/>Azo ndo ng'holo za Yuda, nawali walume elufu makumi saba na sita na miya zihano (76,500).<verse eid="NUM 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23"/>Nhanzi ya Isakali ndo ng'holo za Tola na Puva <verse eid="NUM 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24"/>na Yashubu na Shimuloni. <verse eid="NUM 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25"/>Azo ndo ng'holo za Isakali, nawali walume elufu makumi sita na gane na miya zidatu (64,300).<verse eid="NUM 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26"/>Nhanzi ya Sebuluni ndo ng'holo za Seledi na Eloni na Yaleeli. <verse eid="NUM 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27"/>Azo ndo ng'holo za Sebuluni, nawali walume elufu makumi sita na miya zihano (60,500).<verse eid="NUM 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28"/>Nhanzi ya Yusufu mhaza wa hewo Manase na Efulaimu.<verse eid="NUM 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29"/>Nhanzi ya Manase ndo ng'holo za Makili na Gileadi. Gileadi nayali mwana wa Makili. <verse eid="NUM 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30"/>Walelwa wa Gileadi ndo ng'holo za Yeseli na Heleki <verse eid="NUM 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31"/>na Asilieli na Shekemu <verse eid="NUM 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32"/>na Shemida na Hefeli. <verse eid="NUM 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33"/>Selofehadi, mwana wa Hefeli hapatile wana walume ila wadala hela, na hewo ndo Mala na Noa na Hogula na Milika na Tilisa. <verse eid="NUM 26:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34"/>Azo ndo ng'holo za Manase, nawali walume elufu makumi gahano na mbili na miya saba (52,700).<verse eid="NUM 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35"/>Nhanzi ya Efulaimu ndo ng'holo za Shutihela na Bekeli na Tahani. <verse eid="NUM 26:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36"/>Lukolo lwa Elani nalulawa kwa Shutihela. <verse eid="NUM 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37"/>Azo ndo ng'holo za Efulaimu, nawali walume elufu makumi gadatu na mbili na miya zihano (32,500). Zeng'ha azo nazilawila kwa Yusufu.<verse eid="NUM 26:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38"/>Nhanzi ya Benjamini ndo ng'holo za Bela na Ashibeli na Ahilamu <verse eid="NUM 26:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39"/>na Shefufamu na Hufamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40"/>Ng'holo za Alidi na Naamani, nazilawila kwa Bela. <verse eid="NUM 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41"/>Azo ndo ng'holo za Benjamini, nawali walume elufu makumi gane na zihano na miya sita (45,600).<verse eid="NUM 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42"/>Nhanzi ya Dani nayali ya lukolo lwa Shuhamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43"/>Lukolo nalwali na walume elufu makumi sita na gane na miya zine (64,400).<verse eid="NUM 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44"/>Nhanzi ya Asheli ndo ng'holo za Imuna na Ishivi na Belia. <verse eid="NUM 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45"/>Ng'holo za Hebeli na Malikieli nazilawila kwa Belia. <verse eid="NUM 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46"/>Asheli nayali na mhinza yalinguchemigwa Sela. <verse eid="NUM 26:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47"/>Azo ndo ng'holo za nhanzi ya Asheli, nawali walume elufu makumi gahano na zidatu na miya zine (53,400).<verse eid="NUM 26:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48"/>Nhanzi ya Nafutali ndo ng'holo za Yaseeli na Guni <verse eid="NUM 26:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49"/>na Yeseli na Shilemu. <verse eid="NUM 26:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50"/>Azi ndo ng'holo za nhanzi ya Nafutali, walume nawali elufu makumi gane na zihano na miya zine (45,400).<verse eid="NUM 26:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51"/>Walume Waisilaeli wawazigwe nawali lachi sita na elufu imwe na miya saba na makumi gadatu (601,730).<verse eid="NUM 26:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52"/>Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53"/>“Nhanzi azi zopegwa isi iwe uhalizi wa hewo wawo, kwa chiwalo cha winji wa matagwa ga hewo wawo. <verse eid="NUM 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54"/>Nhanzi ng'hulu yopegwa honhu hawo hakulu na nhanzi ndodo yopegwa honhu hawo hadodo. Chila nhanzi yopegwa honhu hake ha uhalizi kwa chiwalo cha winji wa wanhu vyowali. <verse eid="NUM 26:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55"/>Na ako kugawilwa kwa isi koditigwa kwa kutowa simbi. Chila nhanzi yohalila kwa chiwalo cha matagwa ga lukolo lwa hewo. <verse eid="NUM 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56"/>Uhalizi wa chila nhanzi woditigwa kwa kutowa simbi, chila nhanzi yopegwa kwa chiwalo cha ukulu ama udodo wake.”<verse eid="NUM 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57"/>Azi ndo ng'holo za Walawi ziwazigwe na walelwa wa hewo Gelishoni na Kohati na Melali. <verse eid="NUM 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58"/>Hamwe na ng'holo za Libuni na Hebuloni na Mahili na Mushi na Kola. Kohati nayali mhaza wa Amulamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59"/>Mchewake Amulamu nakachemigwa Yokebedi mwana wa heye Lawi, yavumbuche Misili. Ayu nakampondela Amulamu wana weli walume, Aluni na Musa, na mhinza yumwe, Miliamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60"/>Aluni nayali na wana walume wane, Nadabu na Abihu na Eleasali na Itamali. <verse eid="NUM 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61"/>Nadabu na Abihu nawabagama vyowamlavile Mkulu Nguluwi nhambiko ya chiluli, yohaikundigwe. <verse eid="NUM 26:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62"/>Walawi walume wawele na mwezi umwe na mzidi nawali elufu makumi meli na gadatu (23,000). Awa nahawawazigwe hamwe na Waisilaeli wanji kwa vila hewo nahawapeligwe isi kota uhalizi woneche hali hewo.<verse eid="NUM 26:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63"/>Awo ndo walume Waisilaeli wawazigwe na Musa na mtambika Eleasali kuli isi iwele na ibalalika lya Moabu, kumwambu mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani ilingilola na Yeliko. <verse eid="NUM 26:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64"/>Hali hewo hali haduhuli ne munhu yumwe hali wala wawazigwe na Musa na mtambika Aluni na ndo nawawazigwe aho mwaluko kuchiwala ako Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 26:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga kota weng'ha wobagama wawele ako kuchiwala, na kukomya, haduhu ne yumwe wa hewo yasigale yawele mkomu, ila Kalebu mwana wa Yefune na Yoshua mwana wa Nuni.<verse eid="NUM 26:65"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27"/>
  <para style="s">Uhalizi wa wadala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1"/>Mhela awo, Mala na Noa na Hogula na Milika na Tilisa, wahinza wa Selofehadi, nawahejela. Na heye Selofehadi nayali mwana wa Hefeli, mwana wa Gileadi, mwana wa Makili, mwana wa Manase mwana wa Yusufu. <verse eid="NUM 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2"/>Lelo wahinza weng'ha awo wahano nawamlutila Musa, nawema hali heye na mtambika Eleasali na vilongozi weng'ha wa Waisilaeli weng'ha, hali lwizi lwa ihema lya Nguluwi, nawalonga, <verse eid="NUM 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3"/>“Mhaza wa hetwe nakabagama kuchiwala, nahawele kuli wala wanhu weng'ha welumbile kumditila vibi Mkulu Nguluwi, kuli chilundo cha Kola, ila nakabagama kwa gehile ga heye yuye. Nahawele na mwana yoneche mlume. <verse eid="NUM 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4"/>Lelo lekachoni itagwa lya mhaza wa hetwe lyusigwe kuli lukolo lwa heye kwa vila haduhu mwana mlume? Twangugana uhalizi hamwe na wang'holoze mhaza wa hetwe.”<verse eid="NUM 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5"/>Musa nakegala mbuli ya hewo hali Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7"/>“Chowalingulonga wahinza wa Selofehadi ndo cha kukomya, wagawile uhalizi hamwe na wang'holoze mhaza wa hewo, wahole uhalizi wa heye. <verse eid="NUM 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8"/>Hamba walonjele Waisilaeli kota munhu yoneche wone yabagame ne kuleka mwana mlume, uhalizi wa heye kopegwa mwana wa heye mdala. <verse eid="NUM 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9"/>Ila wone kahela mhinza, uhalizi wa hewo wopegwa wang'holoze walume. <verse eid="NUM 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10"/>Na wone kahela wang'holoze walume, uhalizi wa heye woluta kwa wang'holoze wa mhaza wa heye, mkulu ama mdodo. <verse eid="NUM 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11"/>Na wone mhaza wa heye kahela wang'holoze walume, lelo uhalizi wa heye wowa wa wanhu wa nhanzi ya heye ya habehi, na wowa wa heye. Ali ndo lyowa ilajizo na mzilo kwa Waisilaeli, kota vila heni Mkulu Nguluwi vyondikulajize, hegwe Musa.”<verse eid="NUM 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshua kanguhaguligwa kuwalongoza Waisilaeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 31:1-8">Kukumbuchila 31:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, “Ukwine mchanya mwa chidunda achi cha vigongo vya Abalimu leka uilole isi yondiwapele Waisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13"/>Louyona, nagwe kobagama kota vila mng'holozo Aluni navyoyabagame, <verse eid="NUM 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14"/>kwa vila hambe mhulichize mzilo wa heni kula kuchiwala Sini. Mhela Waisilaeli weng'ha lowamng'ung'utile kwa chiwalo cha heni kula Meliba, humhele ukulu hali hewo lowaganile wapegwe mazi.” Meliba ndo nzasa ya mazi ako Kadeshi kuli kuchiwala ako Sini.<verse eid="NUM 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15"/>Na heye Musa nakamlanda Mkulu Nguluwi yolonga, <verse eid="NUM 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16"/>“Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi uwele mwaluko wa ukomu wa weng'ha, ndangukulanda umhagule munhu wa kuwalongoza Waisilaeli weng'ha, <verse eid="NUM 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17"/>yawele kowalongola kuwalongoza kuli mbuli za hewo zeng'ha, leka Waisilaeli weng'ha wa Mkulu Nguluwi waleche kuwa kota ming'holo jilihela mdimi.”<verse eid="NUM 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, “Mhole Yoshua mwana wa Nuni, munhu yawele muhe wa Mkulu Nguluwi ka mgati mwa heye, hamba umuwichile moko, <verse eid="NUM 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19"/>na kumwimiza hali mtambika Eleasali na Waisilaeli weng'ha, umhe mijito ajo. <verse eid="NUM 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20"/>Umhe honhu ha ludali lwa hegwe leka Waisilaeli weng'ha wamhulichize. <verse eid="NUM 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21"/>Heye komtumbila mtambika Eleasali yawele komlonjela choni chondilingugana kwa Ulimu na Sumimu. Kwa nzila ayi, Eleasali kowalongoza Yoshua na Waisilaeli weng'ha kuli mbuli za hewo zeng'ha” <verse eid="NUM 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22"/>Musa nakadita kota navyoyalajizwe na Mkulu Nguluwi. Nakamhola Yoshua na kumwimiza hali mtambika Eleasali na Waisilaeli weng'ha. <verse eid="NUM 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23"/>Hamba nakamuwichila moko kwa kumdita yawe chilongozi kota Musa navyoyalajizwe na Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="NUM 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28"/>
  <para style="s">Nhambiko za chila zuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2"/>“Walonjele Waisilaeli kota hemwe mondavila kwa mhela wa nhambiko zilinguganigwa, vilyo vya kulakazwa kwa chiluli, viwele na unhunyhililo unojile wa kunojeza heni. <verse eid="NUM 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3"/>Walonjele kota nhambiko yowondavila heni Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiluli, yowa ming'holo myana mili milume ja mwaka umwe jilihela nongwa yoneche, kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko ya kulakazwa ya chila zuwa. <verse eid="NUM 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4"/>Ing'holo lyana limwe lyolavigwa mitondo na lya keli lyolavigwa mhela wa kuzinga kwa isanya, <verse eid="NUM 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5"/>chila limwe lyolavigwa hamwe na nhambiko ya nyhule ya kilo imwe ya utimbo unojile uhanzigwe hamwe na lita imwe ya mafuta ganojile gahondigwe. <verse eid="NUM 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6"/>Ayi ndo nhambiko ya kulakazwa ilingulavigwa chila zuwa, iwele nailajizwe hala kuli chidunda cha Sinai kota unhunyhililo unojile, nhambiko yalingulavilwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiluli. <verse eid="NUM 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7"/>Nhambiko ya chakunwa yoilingulavigwa na chila ing'holo lyana, ndo lita imwe ya divai. Koijida nhambiko ayi ya chakunwa hali honhu helile ha Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8"/>Mhela wa kuzinga kwa isanya kolilavya lila ing'holo lyana liyage hamwe na nhambiko ya nyhule na ya chakunwa kota yoilavigwe mitondo, kolavya kota nhambiko yalingulavilwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiluli, nhambiko iwele na unhunyhililo unojile wa kumnojeza Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="NUM 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhambiko ya Zuwa lya Kwesela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9"/>“Zuwa lya Kwesela, molavya nhambiko ya ming'holo myana mili milume ja mwaka umwe jilihela nongwa, nhambiko ya nyhule ya kilo mbili za utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta, na nhambiko yake ya chakunwa. <verse eid="NUM 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10"/>Nhambiko ayi ya kulakazwa yolavigwa chila Zuwa lya Kwesela ne kuwaza yila nhambiko ya chila zuwa hamwe na nhambiko yake ya chakunwa.<verse eid="NUM 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhambiko ya chila mwezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11"/>“Kuli mwaluko wa chila mwezi, momlavila Mkulu Nguluwi nhambiko ya kulakazwa. Milogota milume mili, ing'holo ilume limwe na ming'holo myana saba milume ja mwaka umwe, jeng'ha jiwe jilihela nongwa. <verse eid="NUM 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12"/>Molavya nhambiko ya nyhule ya utimbo unojile kilo zidatu, uhanzigwe na mafuta kwa chila ilogota ilume na molavya kahi kilo mbili za utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta kwa chila ing'holo ilume, <verse eid="NUM 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13"/>na kilo imwe ya utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta kwa chila ing'holo lyana. Nhambiko azi za kulakazwa ziwele na unhunyhililo wa kumnojeza Mkulu Nguluwi, ndo nhambiko zilingulavigwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiluli. <verse eid="NUM 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14"/>Chipimilo cha nhambiko ya chakunwa chilinguganigwa ndo lita mbili za divai kwa chila ilogota ilume na lita imwe na nusu kwa chila ing'holo ilume na lita imwe kwa chila ing'holo lyana. Ayo ndo nhambiko ya kulakazwa ya chila mwezi kuli mwaka. <verse eid="NUM 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15"/>Kahi momlavila Mkulu Nguluwi nhambiko ya gehile, ipongo limwe, ne kuwaza yila nhambiko ya kulakazwa ya chila zuwa na nhambiko yake ya chakunwa.<verse eid="NUM 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhambiko ya mnvina ya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16"/>“Zuwa lya kumi na kane lya mwezi wa mwaluko ndo mnvina ya Pasaka ya Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17"/>Zuwa lya kumi na zihano lya mwezi wuwo ndo mnvina. Kwa mhela wa mazuwa saba, molya mibumunda jilihela usaso. <verse eid="NUM 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18"/>Kuli zuwa lya mwaluko kowa na nhing'hano yelile. Zuwa alyo hamkola mijito hebu. <verse eid="NUM 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19"/>Molavya nhambiko ya kulakazwa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiluli, milogota milume mili na ing'holo ilume limwe na ming'holo myana saba milume ja mwaka umwe, jeng'ha jiwe jilihela nongwa. <verse eid="NUM 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20"/>Nhambiko ya nyhule yoiwa hamwe na ayo, yowa ya utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta, kilo zidatu kwa chila ilogota ilume na kilo mbili kwa chila ing'holo ilume, <verse eid="NUM 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21"/>na kilo imwe kwa chila limwe lya jila ming'holo myana saba. <verse eid="NUM 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22"/>Molavya kahi ipongo limwe liwe nhambiko ya gehile leka kuwaditila uhanyisi. <verse eid="NUM 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23"/>Molavya vinhu avi ne kuwaza yila nhambiko ya kulakazwa ilingulavigwa mitondo ya chila zuwa. <verse eid="NUM 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24"/>Hihyo du, kwa mhela wa mazuwa saba, molavya nhambiko ya chilyo yalingulavilwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiluli, ndo iwele na unhunyhililo unojile wa kumnojeza Mkulu Nguluwi. Ayi moilavya ne kuwaza yila nhambiko ya kulakazwa ya chila zuwa na nhambiko yake ya chakunwa. <verse eid="NUM 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25"/>Kuli zuwa lya saba modita nhing'hano yelile na mleche kukola mijito.<verse eid="NUM 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhambiko ya mnvina ya mbena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:15-22">Walawi 23:15-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26"/>“Kuli zuwa lya mwaluko lya mnvina ya mbena lomumlavila Mkulu Nguluwi mbena za mwaluko za nyhule za hemwe, modita nhing'hano yelile na mleche kukola mijito. <verse eid="NUM 28:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27"/>Molavya nhambiko ya kulakazwa, unhunyhililo unojile wa kumnojeza Mkulu Nguluwi, milogota milume mili na ing'holo ilume limwe na ming'holo myana milume saba ja mwaka umwe. <verse eid="NUM 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28"/>Nhambiko ya nyhule yoiwa hamwe na ayo yowa ya utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta, kilo zidatu kwa chila ilogota ilume na kilo mbili kwa chila ing'holo ilume <verse eid="NUM 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29"/>na kilo imwe kwa chila ing'holo lyana. <verse eid="NUM 28:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30"/>Molavya kahi ipongo limwe kuwaditila uhanyisi. <verse eid="NUM 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31"/>Molavya vinhu avi ne kuwaza yila nhambiko ya kulakazwa ya chila zuwa hamwe na nhambiko yake ya chakunwa. Jeng'ha jiwe jilihela nongwa.<verse eid="NUM 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29"/>
  <para style="s">Nhambiko ya mnvina ya mhalamhanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:23-25">Walawi 23:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1"/>“Zuwa lya mwaluko lya mwezi wa saba modita nhing'hano yelile na mleche kukola mijito. Alyo ndo zuwa lya kutowa mhalamanda. <verse eid="NUM 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2"/>Molavya nhambiko ya kulakaza, kunhunyhilila goya komnojeza Mkulu Nguluwi, ilogota ilume limwe na ing'holo ilume limwe na ming'holo myana milume saba ja mwaka umwe, jeng'ha jiwe jilihela nongwa yoneche. <verse eid="NUM 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3"/>Molavya kahi nhambiko ya heye ya utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta, kilo zidatu kwa ilogota ilume na kilo mbili kwa ing'holo ilume <verse eid="NUM 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4"/>na kilo imwe kwa chila ing'holo lyana. <verse eid="NUM 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5"/>Kahi molavya ipongo limwe liwe nhambiko ya gehile kwa kuwaditila uhanyisi. <verse eid="NUM 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6"/>Molavya vinhu avi ne kuwaza yila nhambiko ya kulakazwa ya mwezi unyale na nhambiko yake ya nyhule na nhambiko zake za chakunwa kota vyoilajizwe kuwa unhunyhililo unojile ulingunojeza, ndo nhambiko yalingulavilwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiluli.<verse eid="NUM 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhambiko ya zuwa lya uhanyisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:26-32">Walawi 23:26-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7"/>“Zuwa lya kumi lya mwezi wa saba, modita nhing'hano yelile. Zuwa alyo yowagana mwesele kulya ne kukola mijito joneche. <verse eid="NUM 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8"/>Momlavila Mkulu Nguluwi nhambiko ya kulakazwa na kunhunyhilila kwa kumnojeza Mkulu Nguluwi. Ilogota ilume limwe na ing'holo ilume limwe na ming'holo myana saba milume ja mwaka umwe, jeng'ha jiwe jilihela nongwa yoneche. <verse eid="NUM 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9"/>Kuleka vinhu avyo, molavya kahi nhambiko ya utimbo unojile uhanzanywe na mafuta kilo zidatu hamwe na alyo ilogota ilume na kilo mbili hamwe na lila ing'holo ilume <verse eid="NUM 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10"/>na kilo imwe kwa chila ing'holo lyana. <verse eid="NUM 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11"/>Molavya kahi ipongo limwe kwa nhambiko ya gehile ne kuwaza yila nhambiko ya uhanyisi hamwe na nhambiko ya kulakazwa ya chila zuwa na nhambiko yake ya nyhule na nhambiko zake za kunwa.<verse eid="NUM 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhambiko ya mnvina ya vibumuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-44">Walawi 23:33-44</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13-17">Kukumbuchila 16:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12"/>“Zuwa lya kumi na kahano lya mwezi wa saba, modita nhing'hano yelile. Hamkola mijito zuwa alyo. Modita mnvina kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu Nguluwi kwa mazuwa saba. <verse eid="NUM 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13"/>Molavya nhambiko ya kulakazwa, iwele ndo nhambiko yalingulavilwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiluli, iwele na kunhunyhilila goya kulingumnojeza Mkulu Nguluwi na milogota milume kumi na jidatu na ming'holo milume mili na ming'holo myana ja mwaka umwe kumi na jine, jeng'ha jiwe jilihela nongwa yoneche. <verse eid="NUM 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14"/>Nhambiko yoiwa hamwe na ayo, yowa utimbo unojile uhanzigwe na mafuta, kilo zidatu kwa chila ilogota ilume na kilo mbili kwa chila ing'holo ilume <verse eid="NUM 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15"/>na kilo imwe kwa chila ing'holo lyana. <verse eid="NUM 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16"/>Molavya kahi ipongo limwe kwa nhambiko ya gehile, ne kuwaza yila nhambiko ya chila zuwa ya kulakazwa hamwe na nhambiko yake ya nyhule na nhambiko yake ya chakunwa.<verse eid="NUM 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17"/>“Zuwa lya keli, molavya milogota milume kumi na mili na ming'holo milume mili na ming'holo myana milume kumi na jine ja mwaka umwe jilihela nongwa yoneche. <verse eid="NUM 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18"/>Molavya kahi nhambiko ya nyhule na nhambiko ya chakunwa hamwe na jila milogota milume na ming'holo na ming'holo milume myana kwa winji wa hewo vyoilajizwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19"/>Molavya kahi ipongo limwe kwa nhambiko ya kulakazwa ya chila zuwa hamwe na nhambiko yake ya nyhule na nhambiko yake ya chakunwa.<verse eid="NUM 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20"/>“Zuwa lya kadatu, molavya mibuguma kumi na limwe na ming'holo milume mili na ming'holo myana kumi na jine ja mwaka umwe jilihela nongwa yoneche. <verse eid="NUM 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21"/>Molavya kahi nhambiko ya nyhule na nhambiko za chakunwa hamwe na ajo mibuguma na ming'holo milume na ming'holo myana kota vyoilajizwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22"/>Hihyo du, molavya ipongo limwe kwa nhambiko ya gehile ne kuwaza yila nhambiko ya kulakazwa hamwe na nhambiko yake ya nyhule na nhambiko yake ya chakunwa.<verse eid="NUM 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23"/>“Zuwa lya kane, molavya mibuguma kumi na ming'holo milume mili na ming'holo myana kumi na jine ja mwaka umwe jilihela nongwa yoneche. <verse eid="NUM 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24"/>Molavya kahi nhambiko ya nyhule na nhambiko za chakunwa hamwe na ajo mibuguma na ming'holo milume na ming'holo myana kwa winji wa hewo kota vyoilajizwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25"/>Molavya kahi ipongo limwe kwa nhambiko ya gehile ne kuwaza nhambiko ya chila zuwa ya kulakazwa hamwe na nhambiko yake ya nyhule na nhambiko yake ya chakunwa.<verse eid="NUM 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26"/>“Zuwa lya kahano, molavya mibuguma tisa na ming'holo milume mili na ming'holo myana milume kumi na jine ja mwaka umwe jilihela nongwa yoneche. <verse eid="NUM 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27"/>Molavya kahi nhambiko ya nyhule na nhambiko za chakunwa hamwe na mibuguma na ming'holo na ming'holo milume myana kota vyoilajizwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28"/>Molavya kahi ipongo limwe kwa nhambiko ya gehile ne kuwaza yila nhambiko ya chila zuwa ya kulakazwa hamwe na nhambiko yake ya nyhule na nhambiko yake ya chakunwa.<verse eid="NUM 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29"/>“Zuwa lya sita, molavya mibuguma nane na ming'holo milume mili na ming'holo myana milume kumi na jine ja mwaka umwe jiwele jilihela nongwa yoneche. <verse eid="NUM 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30"/>Molavya kahi nhambiko ya nyhule na nhambiko za chakunwa hamwe na ajo mibuguma na ming'holo milume na ming'holo myana kota vyoilajizwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31"/>Molavya kahi ipongo limwe lya nhambiko ya gehile hamwe na nhambiko ya kulakazwa na nhambiko yake ya nyhule na nhambiko zake za chakunwa.<verse eid="NUM 29:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32"/>“Zuwa lya saba, molavya mibuguma saba na ming'holo milume mili na ming'holo myana milume kumi na jine ja mwaka umwe, jilihela nongwa yoneche. <verse eid="NUM 29:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33"/>Molavya kahi nhambiko ya nyhule na nhambiko za chakunwa hamwe na ajo mibuguma na ming'holo milume na ming'holo myana kwa winji wa hewo kota vyoilajizwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34"/>Molavya kahi ipongo limwe kwa nhambiko ya gehile ne kuwaza yila nhambiko ya kulakazwa ya chila zuwa, hamwe na nhambiko yake ya nyhule na nhambiko yake ya chakunwa.<verse eid="NUM 29:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35"/>“Zuwa lya nane, mowa na nhing'hano ng'hulu. Mleche kukola mijito zuwa alyo. <verse eid="NUM 29:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36"/>Ila molavya nhambiko ya kulakazwa, nhambiko yalingulavilwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiluli, na unhunyhililo unojile ulingumnojeza Mkulu Nguluwi, ibuguma limwe na ing'holo ilume limwe na ming'holo myana milume saba ja mwaka umwe jilihela nongwa yoneche. <verse eid="NUM 29:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37"/>Molavya kahi nhambiko ya nyhule na nhambiko za chakunwa hamwe na alyo ibuguma na ing'holo ilume na jila ming'holo myana kwa winji wa migongolo kota vyoilajizwe. <verse eid="NUM 29:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38"/>Hamba kahi molavya ipongo limwe kwa nhambiko ya gehile ne kuwaza yila nhambiko ya chila zuwa ya kulakazwa hamwe na nhambiko yake ya nyhule na nhambiko yake ya chakunwa.<verse eid="NUM 29:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39"/>“Aga ndo malajizo galinguwala nhambiko za kulakazwa na nhambiko za nyhule na nhambiko za chakunwa na nhambiko za kikala goya zomlingumlavila Mkulu Nguluwi mhela wa mnvina za hemwe zoziwichigwe. Ne kuwaza nhambiko azo ziwele momlavila Mkulu Nguluwi kweneza kilaha kwa hemwe na nhambiko za hemwe za kunuwila.”<verse eid="NUM 29:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40"/>Lelo Musa nakawalonjela Waisilaeli chila chinhu kota Mkulu Nguluwi navyoyamlajize.<verse eid="NUM 29:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30"/>
  <para style="s">Malajizo kuwala kilaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1"/>Hamba, Musa nakalongasa na vilongozi wa nhanzi za Isilaeli, nakawalonjela, “Awu ndo ulonzi woyalonjile Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="NUM 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2"/>“Wone munhu yochilaha kwa Mkulu Nguluwi ama kiwika milagano kwa chilaho, imgana yeneze kilagana kwa heye, na imgana kahi yagakolele mijito gala geng'ha goyalonjile heye.<verse eid="NUM 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3"/>“Mhinza yawele yang'hali mbaka sambi kangikala haluga ha mhaza wa heye, yochilaha kwa Mkulu Nguluwi ama kiwika milagano, <verse eid="NUM 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4"/>na wone mhaza wa heye nakahulika kiwika milagano, wone yoleka kumlemeza, lelo vilaho vya heye vyoyawichile vyopona bahala na kulagana kwa heye kahi kopona bahala. <verse eid="NUM 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5"/>Ila wone mhaza wa heye yohulika kilaha ako, na yomlemeza, lelo kilaha kwa heye na kulagana kwa heye hambe vipone bahala. Mkulu Nguluwi komlechela kwa vila mhaza wa heye nakalemeza mbuli ayo.<verse eid="NUM 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6"/>“Wone mhinza ayo kohesigwa hala du nahoyalahile na kulagana ne kijesa goya tandi na kiwika heye yuye milagano, <verse eid="NUM 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7"/>hamba mlume wa heye yahuliche chilaho acho na wone yaleche kumlemeza, lelo kilaha kwa heye kopona bahala na kulagana kwa heye kahi kopona bahala. <verse eid="NUM 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8"/>Ila wone mlume wa heye yahuliche chilaho acho na wone yamlemeze, lelo ayo mlume wa heye kokusa chilaho cha mchewake na ulonzi wa heye woyaulavile ne kujesa goya, na Mkulu Nguluwi komlechela.<verse eid="NUM 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9"/>“Ila kilaha ama kulagana koneche koyawichile mdala yafililwe na mlume wa heye ama mdala yapegwe luleko, ahyo chilaho ama kulagana kwa ayo mdala vyopona bahala.<verse eid="NUM 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10"/>“Wone mdala yahesigwe yochilaha ama kulagana kwa kilaha kuno yawele haluga ha mlume wa heye, <verse eid="NUM 30:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11"/>hamba wone mlume wa heye yahuliche mbuli ayo ila wone yaleche kumlemeza ne kumlonjela chinhu, lelo chilaho cha heye cheng'ha chopona bahala na kulagana kwa heye kweng'ha kahi kopona bahala. <verse eid="NUM 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12"/>Ila wone mlume yahuliche mbuli za heye, hamba yazileme, lelo hambe yaganigwe kugongomanyiza kilaha ama kulagana kwa heye, haimganile kweneza, mlume wa heye nakazilemeza na Mkulu Nguluwi komlechela mdala ayo. <verse eid="NUM 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13"/>Mlume wa heye koweza kutawiza ama kulemeza kilaha ama kulagana koneche kula. <verse eid="NUM 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14"/>Ila wone mlume wa heye hambe yalonje chinhu choneche chila kulawa zuwa lyoyohulika mbuli za kilaha ama kulagana kwa mdala wa heye, lelo mlume ayo kowa nakatawiza chilaho na kulagana ako. <verse eid="NUM 30:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15"/>Ila wone yolemeza mhela umwenga loyahuliche mbuli za heye, lelo heye mlume kowa na nongwa kwa chiwalo cha mchewake.”<verse eid="NUM 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16"/>Aga ndo malajizo gawele Mkulu Nguluwi nayamlajize Musa kwa chiwalo cha mdala na mlume wa heye na mhaza na mhinza wa heye, wone mhinza ayo yawe yang'hali kwalama na kangikala kwa mhaza wa heye.<verse eid="NUM 30:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31"/>
  <para style="s">Ngondo ya Wamidiani na Waisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakalongasa na Musa, nakamlonjela, <verse eid="NUM 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2"/>“Wahilulile chibida Wamidiani kwa mbuli zowawaditile Waisilaeli, hamba hegwe kobagama.”<verse eid="NUM 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3"/>Lelo Musa nakalongasa na wamizi, nakawalonjela, “Muwawiche goya wanhu walume walute kuza kitowa ngondo na Wamidiani kuwahilulila chibida kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4"/>Kulawila chila nhanzi ya Isilaeli, mohilika wamizi elufu imwe kuli kitowa ngondo.”<verse eid="NUM 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5"/>Lelo wamizi elufu imwe nawalavigwa kulawila chila nhanzi hali wanhu wa maelufu ya Waisilaeli, walume wawichigwe goya kitowa ngondo nawali elufu kumi na mbili (12,000). <verse eid="NUM 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6"/>Musa nakawahilika kuli kitowa ngondo hali ulongozi wa Finehasi mwana wa mtambika Eleasali, yawele na vinhu vya honhu helile na mhalamhanda za kulajila ulajilo. <verse eid="NUM 31:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7"/>Nawaitowa isi ya Midiani, kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Musa, nawawakopola walume weng'ha. <verse eid="NUM 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8"/>Hali wanhu awo wakopoligwe, nakwali na wandewa wahano wa Midiani, Evi na Lekemu na Suli na Huli na Leba. Vivila nawamkopola Balaamu mwana wa Beoli. <verse eid="NUM 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9"/>Waisilaeli nawawahola wadala wa Midiani na wana wa hewo na misenga na ming'holo na lufufu lwa hewo lweng'ha. <verse eid="NUM 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10"/>Miji ja hewo jeng'ha na howalingikala hewo heng'ha nawahalakaza heng'ha kwa chiluli. <verse eid="NUM 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11"/>Nawahola vinhu vyeng'ha hamwe na wanhu na migongolo, <verse eid="NUM 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12"/>hewo nawawegala wanhu na migongolo na vinhu vyeng'ha na kuviwika hali Musa na mtambika Eleasali na hali Waisilaeli weng'ha aho hawele na kambi kuli isi iwele na ibalalika lya Moabu, hawele habehi na lwanda lwa Yolodani ilingilola na Yeliko.<verse eid="NUM 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhiluka kulawa kitowa ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13"/>Musa na mtambika Eleasali na vilongozi weng'ha wa Waisilaeli weng'ha nawalawa kuli kambi, nawaluta kuwabochela wamizi. <verse eid="NUM 31:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14"/>Musa nakazudizwa na wakulu wa wamizi na wamizi wemilile vilundo vya wamizi maelufu menji na vilundo vya wamizi mamiya ga wowahiluche kulawa kitowa ngondo. <verse eid="NUM 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15"/>Musa nakawauza, “Lekachoni namuwaleka wadala awa weng'ha wawele wakomu? <verse eid="NUM 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16"/>Mkumbuchile kota wadala ndo wawinzile ulonzi wa Balaamu, nawawambuza Waisilaeli wamleme Mkulu Nguluwi kula Peoli mbaka matamwa gehile nagawoyela Waisilaeli weng'ha wa heye Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17"/>Ahyo lelo, muwakopole wana weng'ha walume na chila mdala yawele nakawasa na mlume. <verse eid="NUM 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18"/>Ila mleche kuwakopola wahinza weng'ha wawele hawanawasa na mlume, muwaleche wawele wakomu kwa chiwalo cha hemwe mwemwe. <verse eid="NUM 31:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19"/>Wala weng'ha wawele hali hemwe wawele nawakopole munhu ama kudoliza mtufi yanguwalapa wekale kunze mwa kambi kwa mhela wa mazuwa saba, weyelize hamwe na Wamidiani wa hemwe kuli zuwa lya kadatu na zuwa lya saba. <verse eid="NUM 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20"/>Iwagana kahi welize chila ivalo na chila chinhu chigongomanyigwe kwa igozi na kwa milaika ja mhene ama kwa igodi.”<verse eid="NUM 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21"/>Mtambika Eleasali nakawalonjela walume wahiluche kulawila kuli kitowa ngondo, “Ali ndo ilajizo liwele Mkulu Nguluwi nalyoyampele Musa. <verse eid="NUM 31:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22"/>Zahabu na sendi na shaba na chuma na bati na madini galinguchemigwa lisasi, <verse eid="NUM 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23"/>ndo vinhu vyeng'ha viwele vilingwimilila chiluli, vyokwelizwa kwa kuvikoleza kuli chiluli. Ahyo, yanguganigwa kahi vyelizwe na mazi ga kweliza. Vinhu viyage vyeng'ha vila vyohambe vimilile chiluli vyokwelizwa kwa mazi ga kweliza. <verse eid="NUM 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24"/>Zuwa lya saba yangukulapa mhovuje mivalo ja hemwe, ndo vyomuwa mwelile na kukundigwa kwinjila kuli kambi.”<verse eid="NUM 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kigawila kwa vinhu viholigwe kuli ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakalongasa na Musa, nakamlonjela, <verse eid="NUM 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26"/>“Hegwe na mtambika Eleasali, hamwe na vilongozi wa ng'holo za nhanzi ya Waisilaeli, muwaze vinhu navyomholile kuli ngondo na Waisilaeli weng'ha na migongolo. <verse eid="NUM 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27"/>Mgawe vinhu avyo kuli vilundo vili, chilundo cha mwaluko ndo cha wamizi walutile kuli kitowa ngondo na chilundo chiyage kwa chiwalo cha Waisilaeli weng'ha. <verse eid="NUM 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28"/>Ila kwa chila chilundo cha wamizi walutile kuli kitowa ngondo, ubagule ndolendole kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu Nguluwi. Chinhu chimwe kulawila kuli vinhu miya zihano, wawe wanhu ama isenga ama idogowi ama ing'holo ama mhene, <verse eid="NUM 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29"/>umhe mtambika Eleasali iwe ndolendole kwa Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30"/>Kulawila kuli chilundo cha nhanzi yeng'ha ya wanhu wa Isilaeli, uhole honhu hamwe ha chila makumi gahano, wawe wanhu ama misenga ama midogowi ama ming'holo ama mhene. Ahyo mowapa Walawi wawele walinguganigwa kukola mijito kuli ihema lya Mkulu Nguluwi.” <verse eid="NUM 31:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31"/>Musa na mtambika Eleasali nawadita kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32"/>Vinhu navyowaholile kuli ngondo, navyali, ming'holo lachi sita na elufu makumi saba na zihano (675,000) <verse eid="NUM 31:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33"/>na misenga elufu makumi saba na mbili (72,000) <verse eid="NUM 31:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34"/>na midogowi elufu makumi sita na imwe (61,000) <verse eid="NUM 31:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35"/>na wadala wawele hawanating'hana na mlume elufu makumi gadatu na mbili (32,000). <verse eid="NUM 31:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36"/>Nusu yake, honhu hawele habaguligwe na wamizi walutile kuli ngondo, nayali ming'holo lachi zidatu na elufu makumi gadatu na saba na miya zihano (337,500), <verse eid="NUM 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37"/>kuli awo miya sita na makumi saba na wahano (675) walavigwe kwa Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 31:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38"/>Misenga ja wamizi wa ngondo najali elufu makumi gadatu na sita (36,000), na kuli ajo makumi saba na mili (72) najilavigwa ndolendole kwa Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39"/>Midogowi ajo najali elufu makumi gadatu na miya zihano (30,500) na kuli ajo makumi sita na imwe (61) najilavigwa ndolendole kwa Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40"/>Wanhu nawali elufu kumi na sita (16,000), na hali awo honhu ha Mkulu Nguluwi nahali wanhu makumi gadatu na mbili (32). <verse eid="NUM 31:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41"/>Lelo Musa nakamha mtambika Eleasali ndolendole ayo ilavigwe kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Musa.<verse eid="NUM 31:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42"/>Nusu ya keli yowapegwe Waisilaeli, iwele Musa nayaibagule kulawa yila nusu yowapegwe wamizi walutile kuli kitowa ngondo, <verse eid="NUM 31:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43"/>najali ming'holo lachi zidatu na elufu makumi gadatu na saba na miya zihano (337,500) <verse eid="NUM 31:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44"/>na misenga elufu makumi gadatu na sita (36,000) <verse eid="NUM 31:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45"/>na midogowi elufu makumi gadatu na miya zihano (30,500) <verse eid="NUM 31:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46"/>na wanhu elufu kumi na sita (16,000). <verse eid="NUM 31:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47"/>Kulawa nusu ayi yowapegwe Waisilaeli, Musa nakamhola yumwe kuli chila Wamidiani makumi gahano na migongolo makumi gahano, kota vyoyalonjelwe na Mkulu Nguluwi, nakawapa Walawi wawele wokola mijito ja ihema lya Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="NUM 31:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48"/>Hamba wakulu wawele hali vilundo vya awo wamizi na vilongozi wa maelufu ga awo wamizi na vilongozi wa mamiya ga awo wamizi, nawamlutila Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49"/>nawamlonjela, “Vitumagwa wa hegwe natuwawaza wamizi weng'ha nawawele hali ulongozi wa hetwe natona kota kuduhu ne yumwe wa hewo yawele haduhuli. <verse eid="NUM 31:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50"/>Lelo natigala vinhu vya zahabu na banjili na banjili zilivinji na pete za muhuli na vipuli na ugasi viwele chila munhu nakafichigwa navyo. Natuvilavya leka hetwe tuditilwe uhanyisi wa ukomu wa hetwe, hali Mkulu Nguluwi.” <verse eid="NUM 31:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51"/>Musa na mtambika Eleasali nawabochela vinhu vyeng'ha vinoligwe kwa zahabu. <verse eid="NUM 31:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52"/>Zahabu yeng'ha yowamlavile Mkulu Nguluwi nayali kota kilo miya mbili. <verse eid="NUM 31:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53"/>Chila mwamizi yohawele chilongozi, nahalavile vinhu vya heye yuye kwa Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 31:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54"/>Lelo Musa na mtambika Eleasali nawabochela zahabu ayo kulawa kwa vilongozi na kuihilika kuli ihema lya Nguluwi, leka Mkulu Nguluwi yawakumbuche Waisilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 31:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32"/>
  <para style="s">Nhanzi za kolilawilaga isanya mwa Yolodani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 3:12-22">Kukumbuchila 3:12-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1"/>Nhanzi ya Lubeni na Gadi nayali na migongolo ja kufujigwa minji ng'hatu. Lelo vyowawene kota honhu ha Yaseli na Gileadi nahali hanojile kwa migongolo ja kufujigwa, <verse eid="NUM 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2"/>nawawalutila Musa na mtambika Eleasali na vilongozi wa Waisilaeli weng'ha, nawawalonjela, <verse eid="NUM 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3"/>“Miji ja Ataloti na Diboni na Yaseli na Nimula na Heshiboni na Eleale na Sebamu na Nebo na Beoni, <verse eid="NUM 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4"/>isi iwele Mkulu Nguluwi nayaisumile kwa chiwalo cha Waisilaeli weng'ha, ndo isi inojile kwa migongolo ja kufujigwa, natwe twanajo migongolo minji ng'hatu. <verse eid="NUM 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5"/>Lelo wone mtukunde twanguwalanda uganililo leka mtupe isi ayi iwe ya hetwe, mleche kutuhilika kumwambu mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani.”<verse eid="NUM 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6"/>Musa nakawalonjela wanhu wa nhanzi za Gadi na Lubeni, “Ndaze, mwangugana kusigala hano kuno wang'holozenu Waisilaeli wanguluta kuli ngondo? <verse eid="NUM 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7"/>Lekachoni mwanguwadita Waisilaeli wagozole na waleche kuka kuli isi iwele nawapegwe na Mkulu Nguluwi? <verse eid="NUM 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8"/>Ahyo ndo navyowaditile wasekulu wa hemwe londiwalajize kulawa Kadeshi-balineya kuipugajiza isi. <verse eid="NUM 32:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9"/>Hewo nawaluta mbaka hali ibindi lya Eshikoli, nawayona isi, ila nalowahiluche, nawawadita Waisilaeli wagozole leka waleche kwinjila kuli isi yowapegwe na Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakazudila ng'hatu zuwa alyo, nakelaha yolonga, <verse eid="NUM 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11"/>‘Ndangukomya, haduhu munhu yoneche hali wanhu walawile Misili yawele na miyaka makumi meli na mzidi yawele koyona isi yondilahile kota ndowapa Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo, kwa vila hambe wanyhulichize goya. <verse eid="NUM 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12"/>Weng'ha hawoyona ila Kalebu mwana wa Yefune, Mkenisi, na Yoshua mwana wa Nuni, mina hewo nawanyhulichiza goya heni Mkulu Nguluwi.’ <verse eid="NUM 32:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakawazudila ng'hatu Waisilaeli, nakawadita wawe wolubaluba kuchiwala kwa mhela wa miyaka makumi gane, lulelo lweng'ha luditile wihe hali heye, nalubagama. <verse eid="NUM 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14"/>Lelo hemwe lulelo lwa wawele na gehile, namuya honhu ha wasekulu wa hemwe, konjeza ng'hatu kahi ng'halazi ya Mkulu Nguluwi kwa Waisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15"/>Wone hemwe molema kumuwinza, heye kowaleka kahi kuchiwala na mokwambuza kubagama kwa wanhu wano weng'ha.”<verse eid="NUM 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16"/>Lelo nawamlutila Musa, nawamlonjela, “Utukundize tandi tujizenjele mibani ming'holo ja hetwe na miji kwa chiwalo cha wana wa hetwe. <verse eid="NUM 32:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17"/>Ila hetwe tochiwika goya kwa ngondo kuka na wang'holozetu Waisilaeli na towa msitali wa kumwando kuli kitowa ngondo mbaka tuwahiliche hala honhu howochikala. Mhela awo wana wa hetwe wochikala kuli muji uwele na ngome, leka weyamile na wenyeng'haye wa isi ayi. <verse eid="NUM 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18"/>Hambe tuhiluche haluga mbaka aho Waisilaeli wanji weng'ha howowa na honhu hawo howohalila. <verse eid="NUM 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19"/>Hatuwa na honhu choneche hali hewo kolizinjilaga isanya mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani, kwa vila hetwe natupegwa honhu hetu ubanzi awu, kolilawilaga isanya mwa Yolodani.”<verse eid="NUM 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20"/>Musa nakawalonjela, “Wone ndo mkomya modita kota navyomlonjile, lelo baha hali Mkulu Nguluwi, miwiche goya kuza kitowa ngondo. <verse eid="NUM 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21"/>Chila yumwe wa hemwe yawichigwe goya kitowa ngondo, koloka lwanda lwa Yolodani kuno yawele kuli ulongozi wa Mkulu Nguluwi, mowatowa wang'honyo wa hemwe mbaka Mkulu Nguluwi hoyowawinga wang'honyo wa heye hali heye <verse eid="NUM 32:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22"/>na kuihola isi. Lomdita ago, mohiluka, mina mowa mgongomanyiza chomlinguganigwa kudita kwa Mkulu Nguluwi na wang'holozenu Waisilaeli. Na isi ayi yowa ya hemwe hali Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="NUM 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23"/>Ila ndanguwakanya kota wone hamgongomanyize kulagana kwa hemwe, mowa mumditila gehile Mkulu Nguluwi, na mvizele ng'hatu kota mogazigwa. <verse eid="NUM 32:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24"/>Mzenje miji kwa chiwalo cha wana wa hemwe na mibani kwa chiwalo cha ming'holo ja hemwe, ila mdite kota navyomlagane.”<verse eid="NUM 32:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25"/>Hamba, wanhu wa Gadi na wa Lubeni nawamlonjela Musa, “Mkulu, hetwe twa vitumagwa wa hegwe na todita kota vyoulonjile. <verse eid="NUM 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26"/>Wadala wa hetwe na wana wa hetwe na ming'holo ja hetwe na misenga ja hetwe, vyopona baha kuli miji ja Gileadi. <verse eid="NUM 32:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27"/>Ila hetwe vitumagwa wa hegwe tuwichigwa goya kitowa ngondo hali ulongozi wa Mkulu Nguluwi. Toloka lwanda lwa Yolodani kitowa, kota vyoulonjile.”<verse eid="NUM 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28"/>Lelo Musa nakalonga hino kwa mtambika Eleasali na kwa Yoshua mwana wa Nuni na kwa vilongozi wa nhanzi za Waisilaeli, <verse eid="NUM 32:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29"/>“Wone wanhu wa Gadi na wa Lubeni woloka lwanda lwa Yolodani hamwe na hemwe wawele wawichigwe goya kitowa ngondo hali ulongozi wa Mkulu Nguluwi, isi hoyosumya, mowapa isi ya Gileadi iwe ya hewo. <verse eid="NUM 32:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30"/>Ila wone hawoloka lwanda lwa Yolodani hamwe na hemwe wawichigwe goya kitowa ngondo, lelo honhu ha isi ya Kanaani yowa ya hewo na yowa ya hemwe kahi.”<verse eid="NUM 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31"/>Wanhu wa Gadi na Lubeni nawedichila, “Hetwe todita kota Mkulu Nguluwi navyoyatulonjele, hetwe vitumagwa wa hegwe. <verse eid="NUM 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32"/>Hali ulongozi wa Mkulu Nguluwi, toloka kuno tuwichigwe goya kitowa ngondo mbaka isi ya Kanaani, yila isi yotupegwe hano kolilawilaga isanya mwa Yolodani yowa ya hetwe.”<verse eid="NUM 32:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33"/>Lelo Musa nakawapa isi yeng'ha ya mndewa Sihoni wa Waamoli na isi ya mndewa Ogu wa Bashani hamwe na miji ja honhu hawele hafungo mwa miji ajo, wanhu wa nhanzi za Gadi na Lubeni na nusu ya nhanzi ya Manase mwana wa Yusufu. <verse eid="NUM 32:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34"/>Nhanzi ya Gadi naizenga miji ja Diboni na Ataloti na Aloeli <verse eid="NUM 32:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35"/>na Atiloti-shofani na Yaseli na Yogubeha <verse eid="NUM 32:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36"/>na Beti-nimula na Beti-halani, miji jiwele na ngome na mibani ja ming'holo. <verse eid="NUM 32:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37"/>Nhanzi ya Lubeni naizenga miji ja Heshiboni na Eleale na Kiliataimu <verse eid="NUM 32:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38"/>na Nebo na Baali-meoni na Sibuma. Hamba matagwa ga miji ajo nagagaluswa na kupegwa matagwa ganji kahi, matagwa ga wala wazenjile miji ajo.<verse eid="NUM 32:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39"/>Walelwa wa Makili mwana wa Manase, nawaitowa isi ya Gileadi, nawaihola na kuwawinga Waamoli wowawele wochikala amo. <verse eid="NUM 32:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40"/>Ahyo, Musa nakawapa isi ya Gileadi wanhu wa lukolo lwa Makili mwana wa Manase, na hewo nawekala amo. <verse eid="NUM 32:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41"/>Yaili wa nhanzi ya Manase, nakavitowa vijiji vya Gileadi na kuvihola, nakavichema itagwa lya Hawoti-yaili. <verse eid="NUM 32:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42"/>Na heye Noba nakaitowa na kuihola isi ya Kenati na vijiji vyake nakahachema Noba, itagwa lya heye yuye.<verse eid="NUM 32:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33"/>
  <para style="s">Majendo kulawila Misili mbaka Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1"/>Azi ndo kambi zowafichile Waisilaeli, nawawika kambi walawile Misili kuno wawele kuli vilundo vya nhanzi za hewo, kuli ulongozi wa Musa na Aluni. <verse eid="NUM 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2"/>Musa nakandika itagwa lya chila honhu howawichile kambi, honhu hamwe mbaka honhu hanji, kwa ilajizo lya Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="NUM 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3"/>Waisilaeli nawoka kuli muji uchemigwe Lamesesi kuli zuwa lya kumi na zihano lya mwezi wa mwaluko, zuwa limwe loimalile Pasaka ya mwaluko. Nawoka kwa nhumbula zikangale hali Wamisili weng'ha, <verse eid="NUM 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4"/>wawele wawatilile walelwa wa hewo wa mwaluko walume nawakopoligwe na Mkulu Nguluwi, Mkulu Nguluwi nayali yajigazile mbaka milungu ja hewo.<verse eid="NUM 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5"/>Lelo Waisilaeli nawoka Lamesesi, nawawika kambi ya hewo ako Sukoti. <verse eid="NUM 33:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6"/>Kulawila Sukoti, nawawika kambi ya hewo ako Etamu, hafungo ha chiwala. <verse eid="NUM 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7"/>Kulawila Etamu, nawahinduka na kuhiluka mbaka Pi-hahiloti, kolilawilaga isanya ya Baali-sefoni, nawawika kambi ya hewo habehi na Migidoli. <verse eid="NUM 33:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8"/>Nawoka Pi-hahiloti, nawakola Bahali ya Shamu mbaka kuchiwala ako Etamu, nawali mmajendo ako kuchiwala kwa utali wa kujenda mazuwa gadatu, nawawika kambi ya hewo ako Mala. <verse eid="NUM 33:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9"/>Kulawila Mala, nawaluka majendo mbaka Elimu, ako Elimu nakwali na nzasa kumi na mbili za mazi na mitende makumi saba, nawawika kambi ya hewo honhu aho. <verse eid="NUM 33:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10"/>Nawali mmajendo kulawila Elimu, nawawika kambi ya hewo habehi na Bahali ya Shamu. <verse eid="NUM 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11"/>Kulawila Bahali ya Shamu nawawika kambi ya hewo kuli chiwala ako Sini. <verse eid="NUM 33:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12"/>Kulawila kuli chiwala ako Sini, nawawika kambi ya hewo Dofuka. <verse eid="NUM 33:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13"/>Kulawila Dofuka nawawika kambi ya hewo ako Alushi. <verse eid="NUM 33:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14"/>Kulawila Alushi nawawika kambi ya hewo ako Lefidimu, hawele nakwali haduhu mazi ga kunwa. <verse eid="NUM 33:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15"/>Nawoka Lefidimu nawawika kambi ya hewo kuli chiwala ako Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 33:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16"/>Kulawila kuli chiwala ako Sinai nawawika kambi ya hewo ako Kibuloti-hataava. <verse eid="NUM 33:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17"/>Kulawila Kibuloti-hataava, nawawika kambi ya hewo Haseloti. <verse eid="NUM 33:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18"/>Kulawila Haseloti, nawawika kambi ya hewo ako Litima. <verse eid="NUM 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19"/>Kulawila Litima, nawawika kambi ya hewo ako Limoni-pelesi. <verse eid="NUM 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20"/>Kulawila Limoni-pelesi, nawawika kambi ya hewo ako Libuna. <verse eid="NUM 33:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21"/>Kulawila Libuna nawawika kambi ya hewo Lisa. <verse eid="NUM 33:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22"/>Nawoka Lisa, nawawika kambi ya hewo ako Kehelata. <verse eid="NUM 33:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23"/>Kulawila Kehelata, nawawika kambi ya hewo mchidunda cha Shefeli. <verse eid="NUM 33:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24"/>Kulawa mchidunda cha Shefeli nawawika kambi ya hewo ako Halada. <verse eid="NUM 33:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25"/>Kulawila Halada, nawawika kambi ya hewo ako Makeloti. <verse eid="NUM 33:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26"/>Kulawila Makeloti, nawawika kambi ya hewo ako Tahati. <verse eid="NUM 33:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27"/>Kulawila Tahati nawawika kambi ya hewo Tela. <verse eid="NUM 33:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28"/>Kulawila Tela nawawika kambi ya hewo Mitika. <verse eid="NUM 33:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29"/>Kulawila Mitika, nawawika kambi ya hewo Hashimona. <verse eid="NUM 33:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30"/>Kulawila Hashimona, nawawika kambi ya hewo Moseloti. <verse eid="NUM 33:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31"/>Kulawila Moseloti, nawawika kambi ya hewo Bene-yaakani. <verse eid="NUM 33:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32"/>Kulawila Bene-yaakani, nawawika kambi ya hewo Holi-hagidigadi. <verse eid="NUM 33:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33"/>Kulawila Holi-hagidigadi, nawawika kambi ya hewo Yotibata. <verse eid="NUM 33:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34"/>Kulawila Yotibata, nawawika kambi ya hewo Abulona. <verse eid="NUM 33:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35"/>Kulawila Abulona, nawawika kambi ya hewo Esioni-gebeli. <verse eid="NUM 33:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36"/>Nawoka Esioni-gebeli, nawaluka majendo na kuwika kambi ya hewo kuli chiwala ako Sini, kuwele ndo Kadeshi. <verse eid="NUM 33:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37"/>Kulawila Kadeshi, nawawika kambi ya hewo kuchidunda cha Holi, kuli mbaka wa isi ya Edomu.<verse eid="NUM 33:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38"/>Kwa ilajizo lya Mkulu Nguluwi mtambika Aluni nakakwina mchanya mwa chidunda cha Holi, na nakabagama zuwa lya mwaluko lya mwezi wa kahano, mwaka wa makumi gane kulawa Waisilaeli lowalawile kuli isi ya Misili. <verse eid="NUM 33:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39"/>Aluni nayali na miyaka miya imwe na makumi meli na gadatu (123) hoyabagame mchanya mwa chidunda cha Holi.<verse eid="NUM 33:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40"/>Mndewa wa Aladi, Mkanaani, nayawele yochikala Negebu kuli isi ya Kanaani nakahulika kota Waisilaeli nawali wokuya.<verse eid="NUM 33:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41"/>Kulawila kuchidunda cha Holi, Waisilaeli nawawika kambi ya hewo Salimona. <verse eid="NUM 33:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42"/>Kulawila Salimona, nawawika kambi ya hewo ako Punoni. <verse eid="NUM 33:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43"/>Kulawila Punoni, nawawika kambi ya hewo ako Oboti. <verse eid="NUM 33:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44"/>Kulawila Oboti, nawawika kambi ya hewo ako Iye-Abalimu, kuli honhu ha Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 33:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45"/>Kulawila Iye-Abalimu, nawawika kambi ya hewo ako Diboni-gadi. <verse eid="NUM 33:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46"/>Kulawila Diboni-gadi, nawaluka majendo na kuwika kambi ya hewo ako Alimoni-dibulataimu. <verse eid="NUM 33:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47"/>Kulawila Alimoni-dibulataimu, nawaluka majendo na kuza kuwika kambi ya hewo kuli vidunda vya Abalimu, habehi na chidunda cha Nebo. <verse eid="NUM 33:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48"/>Kulawa kuli vidunda vya Abalimu, nawaluka majendo na kuza kuwika kambi ya hewo kuli ibalalika lya Moabu kumwambu mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani ilingililola na Yeliko. <verse eid="NUM 33:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49"/>Nawawika kambi ayo habehi na lwanda lwa Yolodani hali Beti-yeshimoti na ibindi lya Abeli-shitimu kuwele na ibalalika lya Moabu.<verse eid="NUM 33:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malajizo kung'hali kwinjila Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50"/>Kuli ibalalika lya Moabu, kumwambu mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani ilingilola na Yeliko, Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 33:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51"/>“Walonjele Waisilaeli kota homloka lwanda lwa Yolodani na kwinjila kuli isi ya Kanaani, <verse eid="NUM 33:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52"/>muwawinje wenyeng'haye weng'ha wa isi ayo hali hemwe. Mowifya jimalukolo ja hewo jeng'ha ja maganga na jimalukolo ja chuma na kubomola chila honhu hawo ha kulanda milungu. <verse eid="NUM 33:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53"/>Moihola isi ayo na kikala amo kwa vila ndiwapani iwe ya hemwe. <verse eid="NUM 33:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54"/>Moigawanula isi ayo kwa kutowa simbi kwa kuwinza winji wa ivyazi lya hemwe, honhu hakulu ndo ha nhanzi ng'hulu na honhu hadodo ndo kwa nhanzi ndodo. <verse eid="NUM 33:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55"/>Ila wone hamuwawinjile wenyeng'haye wa isi ayo tandi, lelo awo wawele mowaleka wowa kota vibanzi kumeho henu ama miwa chila ubanzi, na wowagazani. <verse eid="NUM 33:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56"/>Nani ndowaditani hemwe kota vyonjesile kuwadita hewo.”<verse eid="NUM 33:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34"/>
  <para style="s">Mbaka ja isi ya Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2"/>“Walonjele Waisilaeli ulonga kota homkwinjila Kanaani, isi iwele ndanguwapa iwe ya hemwe, mbaka ja honhu ha hemwe heng'ha jowa kota vyoili. <verse eid="NUM 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3"/>Ubanzi wa kusini mbaka wa hemwe wowa kulawila kuchiwala ako Sini kukolela ubanzi wa Edomu. Wokwaluchila kolizinjilaga isanya ubanzi wa kusini koidumile Bahali ya Mwino. <verse eid="NUM 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4"/>Hamba wokolela kusini kuluta kula Akilabimu na kukolela Sini mbaka Kadeshi-balineya, ubanzi wa kusini. Kulawila aho, mbaka wokola mbaka Hasali-adali na kuza mbaka Asimoni. <verse eid="NUM 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5"/>Kulawila Asimoni wokola kuza kuli kalwanda ka Misili kuwele na mbaka wa Misili na kumalila kuli bahali ya Mediteleniyani.<verse eid="NUM 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6"/>“Mbaka wa hemwe wa ubanzi wa kolizinjilaga isanya wowa bahali ya Mediteleniyani.<verse eid="NUM 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7"/>“Mbaka wa hemwe wa ubanzi wa kasikazini wowa kota ahi, kulawa bahali ya Mediteleniyani, wogoloka kulutilila mbaka kuli chidunda cha Holi. <verse eid="NUM 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8"/>Kulawila chidunda cha Holi, wogoloka kulutilila mbaka Hamati na kulutilila mbaka ako Sedadi <verse eid="NUM 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9"/>na kukola mbaka Sifuloni na kumalila Hasali-enani, awo ndo wowa mbaka wa hemwe, ubanzi wa kasikazini.<verse eid="NUM 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10"/>“Mbaka wa hemwe ubanzi wa kolilawilaga isanya mouwika kulawila Hasali-enani mbaka Shefamu. <verse eid="NUM 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11"/>Kulawila Shefamu wogoloka kulutilila kusini mbaka Libula, kolilawilaga isanya kwa Aini, hamba mbaka awo woluta hasi mbaka kidulika kwa kolilawilaga isanya kwa ilamba lya Galilaya, <verse eid="NUM 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12"/>hamba wowinza lwanda lwa Yolodani mbaka Bahali ya Mwino. Ayo ndo yowa isi ya hegwe kota mbaka vyouli.”<verse eid="NUM 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13"/>Lelo Musa nakawalajiza Waisilaeli, “Ayi ndo isi yomuihalila kwa kutowa simbi, isi iwele Mkulu Nguluwi nakalajiza zipegwe nhanzi tisa na nusu. <verse eid="NUM 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14"/>Nhanzi ya Lubeni na ya Gadi, na nusu ya nhanzi ya Manase zipegwa uhalizi wa hewo kwa kiwhana na winji wa ivyazi lya hewo. <verse eid="NUM 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15"/>Nhanzi azo mbili na nusu nazipegwa uhalizi wa hewo kumwambu mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani ubanzi ya kolilingulawila isanya, habehi na Yeliko.”<verse eid="NUM 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongozi wawele wololela kigawila honhu ha isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17"/>“Mtambika Eleasali na Yoshua mwana wa Nuni ndo wowagawila wanhu isi, iwe ya hewo. <verse eid="NUM 34:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18"/>Kohola kahi chilongozi yumwe kulawila chila nhanzi kukutanza kuli kugawanula isi. <verse eid="NUM 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19"/>Aga ndo matagwa ga hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 34:19">“Kulawila nhanzi ya Yuda, nayali Kalebu mwana wa Yefune.<verse eid="NUM 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20"/>Kulawila nhanzi ya Simeoni, nayali Shemueli mwana wa Amihudi.<verse eid="NUM 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21"/>Kulawila nhanzi ya Benjamini, nayali Elidadi mwana wa Kisiloni.<verse eid="NUM 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22"/>Kulawila nhanzi ya Dani, nayali Buki mwana wa Yoguli.<verse eid="NUM 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23"/>Kulawila nhanzi ya Manase mwanage Yusufu, nayali Hanieli mwana wa Efodi.<verse eid="NUM 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24"/>Kulawila nhanzi ya Efulaimu, mwanage Yusufu, nayali Kemueli mwana wa Shifutani.<verse eid="NUM 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25"/>Kulawila nhanzi ya Sebuluni, nayali Elisafani mwana wa Palinaki.<verse eid="NUM 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26"/>Kulawila nhanzi ya Isakali, nayali Palitieli mwana wa Asani.<verse eid="NUM 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27"/>Kulawila nhanzi ya Asheli, nayali Ahihudi mwana wa Shelomi.<verse eid="NUM 34:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28"/>Kulawila nhanzi ya Nafutali, nayali Pedaheli mwana wa Amihudi.”<verse eid="NUM 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29"/>Awa ndo wanhu wawele Mkulu Nguluwi nakawahagula wawagawile Waisilaeli isi ya Kanaani iwe ya hewo.<verse eid="NUM 34:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35"/>
  <para style="s">Miji ja Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakalongasa na Musa kuli ibalalika lya Moabu, kumwambu mwa lwanda lwa Yolodani ilingilola na Yeliko, nakamlonjela, <verse eid="NUM 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2"/>“Walonjele Waisilaeli kota uhalizi wowawele nawo, wawagawile Walawi miji ja kikala na honhu ha kudimila migongolo hafungo ha miji ajo. <verse eid="NUM 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3"/>Miji ajo jowa ja hewo, na hewo wochikala amo na honhu ha kudimila migongolo howa ndo kwa chiwalo cha misenga hamwe na migongolo ja hewo jiyage. <verse eid="NUM 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4"/>Honhu ha kudimila homuwapa Walawi hafungo ha muji hokwenela chila ubanzi utali wa mita miya zine na makumi gahano kulawila kuli lukanzi lwa muji awo. <verse eid="NUM 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5"/>Ahyo, honhu aho ha kudimila migongolo howa ha mita miya tisa, na hokwenela chila ubanzi, muji awo wowa hagati. Honhu aho howa ha kudimila hewo hafungo ha miji ajo. <verse eid="NUM 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6"/>Mowagawila Walawi miji sita ja kubilimila, hawele wone munhu yamkopole miyage ne kunuwila, kokundizwa kubilimila ako. Hamwe na ago, mowapa kahi miji jiyage makumi gane na mbili. <verse eid="NUM 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7"/>Miji jomuwapa Walawi jowa makumi gane na nane hamwe na honhu hake ha kudimila. <verse eid="NUM 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8"/>Miji jomuwapa Walawi kuli uhalizi wa Waisilaeli jiwhane na ukulu wa nhanzi, nhanzi ng'hulu yolavya miji minji na nhanzi ndodo yolavya miji mido. Chila nhanzi yolavya miji jake kwa chiwalo cha Walawi kwa kiwhana na honhu hoichihalila.”<verse eid="NUM 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Miji ja kubilimila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">Kukumbuchila 19:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Yoshua 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9"/>Mkulu Nguluwi nakalongasa na Musa, nakamlonjela, <verse eid="NUM 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10"/>Walonjele Waisilaeli kota mhela womloka lwanda lwa Yolodani na kwinjila isi ya Kanaani, <verse eid="NUM 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11"/>mohagula miji jiwele jowa miji ja kubilimila hawele kota munhu wone yamkopole miyage ne kunuwila koweza kubilimila. <verse eid="NUM 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12"/>Miji ajo jowa honhu ha kubilimila, leka yula yakopole yaleche kubagama na yula munhu yalinguhilula chibida, yang'hali kutagusigwa hali nhing'hano. <verse eid="NUM 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13"/>Mobagula miji sita kwa chiwalo cha kubilimila. <verse eid="NUM 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14"/>Hali miji ajo sita jombagula, jidatu jiwe kolilawilaga isanya mwa Yolodani, na jidatu jiyage jiwe kuli isi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="NUM 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15"/>Miji ajo jowa ja kubilimila kwa chiwalo cha Waisilaeli na wajenzi na wajenzi wowochikala hamwe na hewo mhela udo. Munhu yoneche yomkopola miyage ne kunuwila koweza kubilimila ako.<verse eid="NUM 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16"/>“Ila munhu wone yamtowe miyage na chinhu cha chuma, kabagama, munhu ayo ndo mkopolaji na yangumlapa yabagame. <verse eid="NUM 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17"/>Munhu yoneche yomtowa miyage na iganga, wone yabagame, munhu ayo ndo mkopolaji, yangumlapa na heye yabagame. <verse eid="NUM 35:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18"/>Wone yamtowe miyage na chilungu cha igodi chiwele chomwambuza kubagama, na wone yabagame, munhu ayo ndo mkopolaji, na yangumlapa yabagame. <verse eid="NUM 35:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19"/>Mng'holoze wa habehi wa munhu yawele nakabagama, kohilula chibida. Ahyo hoyoting'hana na ayo mkopolaji, na heye komkopola.<verse eid="NUM 35:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20"/>“Hihyo du, na wone munhu yomzudila miyage, hamba yomkundujiza ama kumtozela chinhu kwa chinyele, <verse eid="NUM 35:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21"/>ama kwa kumtowa ngumi na yabagame, lelo munhu ayo yamtowile miyage ndo mkopolaji na yangumlapa yabagame. Mng'holoze wa habehi wa munhu yawele nakabagama, kohilula chibida howoting'hana hamwe.<verse eid="NUM 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22"/>“Ila wone munhu yamkundujize miyage baho du, ne kuzudila ama kumtozela chinhu ne chinyele, <verse eid="NUM 35:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23"/>ama wone munhu yatoze iganga lilinguweza kwambuza munhu yabagame, na kumkopola munhu, hanga hawele mng'honyo wa heye na ayo yakopole nahaganile kukopola, <verse eid="NUM 35:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24"/>lelo, nhing'hano yokwamula hali munhu ayo mkopolaji na mng'holoze wa habehi wa munhu yawele nakabagama, kwa kuwinza utaguso awu. <verse eid="NUM 35:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25"/>Nhing'hano yomlohola munhu ayo yakopole, mmoko mwa mng'holoze wa habehi wa munhu yawele nakabagama na kumhilula kuli muji wa kubilimila monayali yabilimile. Kochikala ako mbaka kubagama kwa mtambika mkulu yabakalizwe mafuta gelile. <verse eid="NUM 35:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26"/>Ila wone ayo munhu yakopole yalawe kunze mwa muji woyabilimile mhela woneche ula, <verse eid="NUM 35:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27"/>hamba wone mng'holoze wa habehi wa munhu yawele nakabagama, yamfiche kunze mwa mbaka ja muji awo wa kubilimila na yamkopole, ayo kowa kahela nongwa ya kukopola. <verse eid="NUM 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28"/>Mina ayo yakopole imgana yekale mgati mwa awo muji wa kubilimila mbaka mtambika mkulu hoyobagama, ila hoyobagama mtambika mkulu koweza kuhiluka kaye.<verse eid="NUM 35:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29"/>“Malajizo aga na mizilo aji jowinzigwa kuli lulelo lwa hemwe lweng'ha, honhu honeche homchikala.<verse eid="NUM 35:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30"/>“Munhu yoneche yokopola munhu, kotagusigwa kubagama kwa walolezi weli ama mzidi, munhu yoneche howeza kutagusigwa kubagama kwa ulolezi wa munhu yumwe.<verse eid="NUM 35:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31"/>“Mleche kubochela sendi yoneche kulohola ukomu wa mkopolaji yawele na nongwa na yatagusigwe kubagama, munhu ayo yangumlapa yabagame. <verse eid="NUM 35:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32"/>Mleche kubochela sendi yoneche kulawila kwa munhu yabilimile muji wa kubilimila leka kumkundiza yahiluche kikala kaye kwa heye, kuno mtambika mkulu yang'hali kubagama. <verse eid="NUM 35:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33"/>Lomdita ahyo mowa muidita ikokomoche isi yomlingikala. Uboholaji wa danda woidita isi iwe ikokomoche, na kuduhuli uhanyisi kwa chiwalo cha kuyeliza isi iditilwe ukopolaji, ila kwa kumkopola ayo yakopole. <verse eid="NUM 35:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34"/>Mleche kuidita isi yomlingikala iwe ikokomoche, isi iwele heni yondilingikala, mina heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndangikala hali hemwe Waisilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 35:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36"/>
  <para style="s">Uhalizi wa wadala wahesigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1"/>Vilongozi wa wanhu kuli lukolo lwa Gileadi, mwana wa Makili, mwana wa Manase, mwana wa Yusufu, nawaluta kulongasa na Musa na vilongozi wanji wa lukolo lwa Waisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2"/>Nawalonga, “Mkulu Nguluwi nakakulonjela uwagawile wanhu wa Isilaeli isi kwa kutowa simbi, iwe uhalizi wa hewo, nakakulonjela kota uwape wahinza wa Selofehadi mng'holozetu uhalizi wa mhaza wa hewo. <verse eid="NUM 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3"/>Ila wone hewo wohesigwa na Waisilaeli wa nhanzi ziyage, uhalizi wa hewo wolawa kwa hetwe na kuwalutila wanhu wa nhanzi yowohesigwa, ahyo uhalizi wa hetwe wokuka kwa hetwe. <verse eid="NUM 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4"/>Kuli mnvina ya kukumbuchila ya miyaka makumi gahano, uhalizi wa isi ya hewo wokonjezeka kuli uhalizi wula wa nhanzi yowohesigwa, ahyo uhalizi wa hewo woholigwa kulawa kuli nhanzi za wahaza wa hetwe.”<verse eid="NUM 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5"/>Lelo Musa nakawapa Waisilaeli ilajizo alyo kulawila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, nakawalonjela, “Wanhu wa lukolo lwa nhanzi ya Yusufu, nawalonga wokomya. <verse eid="NUM 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6"/>Ahi ndo vyoyalingulonga Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha wahinza wa Selofehadi, ‘Walecheligwa wahesigwe na munhu yoneche walingumgana, ila wahesigwe kuli nhanzi ya hewo, <verse eid="NUM 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7"/>leka uhalizi wa Waisilaeli uleche kuka kuli nhanzi imwe kuza kuli nhanzi iyage, chila Muisilaeli kochibatilila uhalizi wa nhanzi ya heye. <verse eid="NUM 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8"/>Mdala yoneche yawele na uhalizi kuli nhanzi imwenga ya Isilaeli yangumlapa yahesigwe na munhu wa nhanzi ya heye, leka chila Muisilaeli yahole uhalizi wa wasekulu wa heye. <verse eid="NUM 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9"/>Ahyo howa haduhu uhalizi woneche wokuka kulawila nhanzi imwe mbaka iyage. Chila nhanzi ya Waisilaeli yobatilila uhalizi wake wa isi.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10"/>Wahinza wa Selofehadi nawadita kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyamlajize Musa. <verse eid="NUM 36:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11"/>Weng'ha, Mala na Tilisa na Hogula na Milika na Noa, wahinza wa Selofehadi nawahesigwa na wana wa wang'holoze wa wahaza wa hewo. <verse eid="NUM 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12"/>Nawahesigwa kuli nhanzi za lukolo lwa Manase mwana wa Yusufu, na uhalizi wa hewo nausigala kuli nhanzi ya wahaza wa hewo.<verse eid="NUM 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13"/>Ajo ndo mizilo na malajizo gawele Mkulu Nguluwi nakawapa Waisilaeli kwa kukolela Musa kuli ibalalika lya Moabu, kumwambu kwa lwanda lwa Yolodani ilingilola na muji wa Yeliko.<verse eid="NUM 36:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36"/>
</usx>
